<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Luk fiis</para>
  <para style="mt">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Luk fiis</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk ɓaaheeɗi ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ciŋ Yeesu. Waaye a nikee na ɓooɓi meeɗ hun na Yeesu. Ŋ ineem a meeksiɗ ɓa findi yeem pesohee po wa ñiinnda nga ɗe. Ƴutta a fiisiɗtaa ƴaar na woyse Tewofiil.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk nikee paƴoh<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Ɓi Kolos 4:14</ref></char></note> te a huniɗ na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> Pool kiis laayiɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:10-28:16">Tum ci 16:10–28:16</ref></char></note> A yi dong nikɗi Yawuut ŋ ɓooɓi fiis <char style="tl">Biibali</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk namiɗ fiis teerndiŋ ɗe kanakɗoh weɗ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci". Teerndeem na taalndiɗe in ci a naandsuk ŋ teerndii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk woyiɗ ŋ teerndii findi Yeesu rimohu na in ci a haɓiɗ ŋ kehƴi, na in ci a jangɗoh, na kakaan kiŋ ɗe, na hultiŋ ɗe. Yeesu yegɗeen ɓooɓa woo kiŋ Kooh, a wirɗeeɗa kosaayiɗ ca, a aañeeɗa <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniica</char>, a tumeeɗa in feyohiɗ ca uupee haf caŋ ɓooɓa. Ini a fiis, wa mand na ini Macce na Maarko fiis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yegɗohiŋ Muci Luk fiis kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">Ini tah ɗe fiisa <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Findi <char style="w">Yahya</char> na Yeesu rimohu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1:5–2:52</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ɓeeɗkohiŋ Yahya <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3:1-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ɓoktukiŋ Yeesu na findi Seytaani jaɗɗohee ɗe fiir <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3:21–4:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nikaŋ Yeesu ŋ Galile <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4:14–9:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pulaŋ Yeesu Galile ne a kaɗ Yerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9:51–19:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Aasaŋ Yeesu Yerusalem po kakaan kiŋ ɗe <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19:28–23:56</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hultiŋ Yeesu <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">24:1-12</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Teeɓkaŋ Yeesu ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ciŋ ɗe na kaɗaŋ ɗe ɗafka <char style="ior"><ref loc="LUK 24:13-53">24:13-53</ref></char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Rangsoha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Tewofiil kilifaani, ɓo' laayiɗ ndengɗukiɗ ŋ fiisiŋ in ci haɓɗu ŋ harmban ɓoo ; <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>ɓa kooɗ naandsuk ciŋ ɓooɓi maasoh ina amboh ŋ cambohaaɗa te ɓooɓeem mirndohha nik ɓi na taambkohe woo kiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Mi nak, ŋ meeksohiɗ baahiɗ findi in ceem jen raakoh ŋ cambohaana po ŋ reehɗohaana, weɗi tah po ŋ namiɗ ɗa waaɗ teeɓ ngaŋ fiis, findi in ceem taambtiɗohohe. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Ŋ fiisiɗ in ceem jen ne fu min inah ne, ini fu jangɗu, wa ɗaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jibriil gapohiɗ raakuukiŋ Yahya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Ŋ jamanoona Herod nikoh buuraŋ Yudee, wa raakeen ƴaar teeku Sakariya, a ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ cuuɓaŋ Abiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seeƴkiɗoh caŋ cuuɓaŋ Abiya nikee cuuɓ seeƴkiɗoh ; wa teeksee Abiya, wa ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓ ca ndaŋkiyaah-kanak na cuuɓ yatuus (25) caŋ Israayel ca meeɗ seeƴkiɗoh. Ɓa jen, ɓa nikee set ciŋ Aaruna.</char></note>. Ɓitiice teeksee Elisabet, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi kahan <char style="w">Aaruna</char>, caaciŋ seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ Israayel. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Ɓa kanak jen ɓa nikee ɓo' yurhiɗ ŋ fiki Kooh ; ɓa meeɗta taambiɗ in ci Heɗ ɓoo nakoh jen na waasiŋ ɗe te ali ɓo' raakeeɗi woyaah ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Waaye ɓa raakeeɗi kuɓu laam Elisabet jaasiree jaasir, te ɓa kanak jen, ɓa nikee yakak.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Sakariya <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkeeɗa</char> wuu Kooh sagu ne e cuuɓaŋ Abiya raakɗohee seeƴka ŋ neeh caam. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Findi ɓa meeɗa tumoh, seeƴkiɗoh ca markiskeeɗa ne Kooh teeɓ ɓa ɓoyi joy aas ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hooliɗaŋ</char> <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahnaŋ Kooh</char> Heɗ ɓoo, ne a fuuɗ cuuraay nga, wa hennda nga ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Ŋ jamanoona cuuraaya na fuuɗohse, tel mboolnda jen ŋ hara kiimeeɗa Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Malaaka Heɗ ɓoo teeɓukka Sakariya, a nikee ŋ ñaahmaŋ seeƴkohaana na suusohse cuuraaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Sakariya hot ɗe hot rek, a feyuusa, a tiitta. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Malaakaana woosa ɗe ne : « Kana neƴƴoh Sakariya, kiimiŋ ɗa teyɗukuuɗ : ɓitiifu Elisabet hey raake kuɓu ƴaar yi fu na hee teeke <char style="w">Yahya</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yahya Ɓoktohi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi Saaŋ <char style="tl">Batiis</char> ŋ farañse.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>A hey soosɗe keeñiŋ ɗa te ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ hey sume ŋ raakuukiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Laam a hey nikee ɓo' yakiɗ ŋ fiki Heɗ ɓoo, a heyɗi ane biiñ mbaa sangara wiiriis, te a rimkan riifiɗ na <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ Israayel, a hey ɓa dokne ŋ Heɗi, Koohiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>A hey adge Heɗ ɓoo, a hun na hatiliŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh, findi woosuuɗi <char style="w">Ilyas</char> hunohee naa. A hey ɓeke kerhiɗoh ŋ harmban baab na kuɓu, a yurhiɗ ɓooɓi kerhiɗɗi Kooh ; ŋ ineem, a hey kooɗkiɗe Heɗ ɓoo cuuɓ tufkiɗuuɗ po ƴutiɗ. »<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Sakariya meekissa malaakaana ne : « Ŋ min inhoh na ne ineem wa keeh ? Laam ŋ yakak te ɓitiiso ɓitfiɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Malaakaana loffa ɗe ne : « Ñam Jibriil, yi nik na Kooh. A yi woos so ne ŋ gap ɗa in ci neɓiɗ cii. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Fu kosɗi woo kiŋ ngo, wa tahiɗ po fu hey muume, fu minissanɗi jomb po mbaɗna ini ŋ woo ɗa raakan ŋ jamanoonaŋ wa. »<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Waam raak ɓooɓa sekeeɗa Sakariya, ɓa feyuusa ŋ maaña a maañ ŋ Ɗiska Hooliɗa. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Wa a pul, a minɗi woo, ɓooɓa inahha ne in hayɗohiɗ ɗe findi heeƴ ŋ ɗiska. A nikka muum, a woyee na ɓa woo muum.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Wa mbeh ca a joyee panguk reeh, a haadda kahan ce. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Wa maañɗi ɓitiice Elisabet ammba rook, a ɗemmba naa caɓin yatuus. A woyeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ ce an : <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>« Inii, a Heɗ ɓoo tuma, a baahohiɗ to po, a paƴɗiɗ to kaciikiŋ ngo ŋ ɓooɓi. »<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jibriil gapohiɗ raakuukaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Wa Elisabet nik ŋ caɓnaŋ ɗe yasna-yino'ɗoh, Kooh woossa malaakaaniŋ ɗe Jibriil ŋ kur ka nik ŋ Galile na woyse Nasareet. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>A tuuƴ ɗe ŋ cafaƴ inhaaɗi ƴaar na woyse Maryaama. Maryaama yeem, fiira nguɗee <char style="w">cakiim</char> nga ɗe teeksee Suseef te a ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓiŋ Dawuuda.<verse eid="LUK 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Malaakaana reɓpa, a woosa ɗe ne : « Mi yii kañiɗ ɗa Maryaama, fu yi baahohu ; Heɗ ɓoo a yi na ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Kañɗoheem feyya Maryaama, a liiɓeeɗa ini wa joy tokis. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Malaakaana woosa ɗe ne : « Kana neƴƴoh Maryaama, Kooh baahohiɗ ɗa. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Fu hey ambe rook, fu raak kuɓu ƴaar ; yi fu na hee teeke Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>A hey nike ɓo' yakak, a hey ɓeeɗkasse <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka, te Kooh Heɗ Ɓoo hey ɗe eɗe Nguuriŋ caac ɓa Dawuuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>A hey adgohe cuuɓiŋ Yaŋhooɓa po faw te Nguuriŋ ɗe moosanɗi reeh. »<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maryaama meekissa malaakaana ne : « Ineem na hee nikohe na te ŋ inahɗi ƴaar ? » <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Malaakaana loffa ɗe ne : « Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh hey haye nga ɗa, hatiliŋ Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka hey ɗa saangne. Ineem weɗi tah po kuɓki hoolɗi fu na hee raake hey ɓeeɗkohse Kuɓkiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Marka, Elisabet yi ndaamu nga ɗa, a rook ; a hey raake kuɓu ƴaar ŋ kiɓitfiŋ ɗe wii. A yi ɓooɓi woyee ne, a jaasir jaasir, moona a rook po wa raakiɗ caɓin yasna-yino. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Laam raakɗi ini wooñ Kooh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Camba 18:14</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maryaama loffa ne : « Mi deey, ŋ <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> Heɗ ɓoo. Ineem rahsaat to findi fu woyoha. » Malaakaana cootta.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maryaama ŋ ɗiskaŋ Elisabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Ŋ neeh caam, Maryaama arra kaɗ ŋ kur, ŋ tangoocaŋ Yudee. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Wa a ree, a aassa kahan Sakariya, a kañiɗta Elisabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elisabet kerah kerah kañɗohaŋ Maryaama rek, kuɓkiŋ ɗe yoonnda ŋ ɗooƴ rookiŋ ɗe. Elisabet riiffa na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>a woosa Maryaama ŋ ɗafka ne : « A fu uupiɗ barke ŋ ɓitiɓ ci jen te kuɓki fu na hee raake barke'iɗ. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>A mi ya ɓa po yaayiŋ Heɗ ɓoo hee so marke ? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Wi ŋ kerah kañɗohiŋ ɗa, kuɓki ŋ rookiŋ ngo yoonnda, sagu sum. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Suma, fu yi kos ne ini Heɗ ɓoo woo ɗa hey raake. »<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maryaama ƴeekiɗ Kooh</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Ŋ ineem Maryaama woosa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">« Coonndiŋ ngo weɗi ƴeek yakkiŋ Heɗ ɓoo,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Keeñiŋ ngo soosiɗ ŋ Kooh Mucɗohiŋ ngo.<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>A alɗi so, mi yi ñaamiŋ ɗe ñakiɗ njirñi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Ee, ini camboh woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">ɓooɓi jen ngaŋ jamano nu nik ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">hey woye ne ŋ ɓitiɓ barke'iɗ.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Laam, Koohi Min tumɗiɗ to in yakiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Tiikiŋ ɗe Hooliɗ.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Yirmandeeniŋ ɗe genan gen ngaŋ ɓooɓi neek ɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">gomal nu gomal.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>A teeɓohiɗ doolndiŋ ɗe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">A pasarohha ɓooɓi yaksiɗkiɗ ci.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>A folla buur.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">A kurkiɗta ɓooɓi eɗfiɗ ci.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>A onnda aɗkiɗ ci kañam baahiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">A aannja raakiɗ ci yaah ɓarang.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>A hirpiɗ Israayel ci ñaam ciŋ ɗe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">A alkohɗi teeɓoh yirmandeeniŋ ɗe<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>ŋ Ibrahiima na ɓi puloh nga ɗe gomal nu gomal</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">findi a gapohee wa caac ciŋ ɓoo. »<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Maryaama ɓooffa ŋ ɗiskaŋ Elisabet ŋ ini ɗal ree caɓin kaahay, wala wa uupa, ƴutta a haadda.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Raakuukaŋ Yahya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Wa noha Elisabet joy ɓasloh ree, a raakka kuɓu ƴaar. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Gentoh ciŋ ɗe na ɓaah ciŋ ɗe kerahha ne Heɗ ɓoo baahohiɗ ɗe ŋ ineem, ɓa ambsukohha na ɗe, ɓa neɓuusa nga.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Wa mbeha a ɓasloh dokuk, ɓa hayya ne ɓa nguɗ kuɓka. Ɓa waaɗta ɗe teek ŋ baab ɓa Sakariya <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>waaye Elisabet woosa ɓa ne : « Muk, a teeksan Yahya. » <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Moo, ɗu raakɗi ali ɓaahi teeku ɗaa. » <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Ɓa meekseeɗa Sakariya na yaah findi a waaɗ ne kuɓkiŋ ɗe teeku. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>A nakohha waakɗu fiisoha, ɓa eɗta ɗe, a fiissa nga ne : « A teeku Yahya. » Ɓooɓa jen feyuusa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, Sakariya minissa jomb, a woyeeɗa baahkiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Ɓooɓa genee na ɗe feyuusa ŋ ina raake, ɓa laamtoheeɗaa ŋ kur caŋ tangoocaŋ Yudee jen. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Hatiliŋ Heɗ ɓoo hunee na kuɓka, tahha po, ɓa kerhee naandsukaŋ ineem jen, ɓa liiɓeeɗa an : « Kuɓkii joy ye nik ? »<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sakariya ƴeekiɗ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Baabiŋ kuɓki, Sakariya, wa a kaɗ po a minissa jomb, Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh riiffa ɗe, a woyeeɗa woo ci puloh ŋ Kooh an :<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>« Heɗ ɓoo Koohiŋ Israayel ƴeekaah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">ŋ ini a hirip ɓooɓiŋ ɗe, a muciɗta ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>A komiɗ ɓoo Mucɗoh raakiɗ hatil</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">ŋ cuuɓiŋ ñaamiŋ ɗe Dawuuda,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>findi a gapohee wa maañiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">a taambiɗtaa ŋ nguɓ caŋ woosuuɗ caŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">te ɓa jen ɓa hooliɗ,<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>ne a hey ɓoo saɓsohe na sangiɗ ciŋ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">a muciɗ ɓoo ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓi sang ɓoo jen.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>A teeɓ caac ciŋ ɓoo baahkiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">a naandsuk ambtiɗohiŋ ɗe hool,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>findi a giñɗohee wa caac ɓoo Ibrahiima,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>ne a hey ɓoo pulɗe ŋ ɓi sang ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">po ɓoo ñaamkee ɗe te ɓoo neƴƴohanɗi,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>ɓoo nikan ɓo' hooliɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">yurhiɗ ŋ fikiice ŋ kipes kiŋ ɓoo jen.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Te fu kuɓu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">fu nikan woosuuɗiŋ Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">laam, a fu adgan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">fu paɗiɗ Heɗ ɓoo waasiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>Fu inhiɗ ɓooɓiŋ ɗe ne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">ɓa hey ɗaasse bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa muc.<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Laam, Koohiŋ ɓoo keeñkohiɗ ɓoo te a baahiɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Weɗi tah, a hey ɓoo woosohe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">siñaari na hee pulohe ŋ ɗafki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">mand na nohi na hane pul,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>ne wa siñaariɗ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">ɗiski ɓoo ɓoof ŋ ñuusiŋ kakaan ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">a deg ɓoo ŋ waas jam. »<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Ŋ ineem, njaanja yakeeɗa, liiɓiŋ ɗe ɓaatkeeɗa, a gennda ŋ nduufa po wa a teeɓ Israayel ci haf ce.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Raakuukaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Ŋ jamanoocaam, buura yakkaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> teeksee Ogis nakohha ne tiik caŋ ɓooɓa jen fiissaat. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Fiisiŋ tiik ceem nikka wa koc, wa hendee ŋ jamanoona Kiriñus nikoh goornooraŋ Siri. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Ŋ ineem, yaa nu nga ɗah, kaɗeeɗa ne a fiisu ŋ kur ka a cosaankoh. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Suseef nammba puloh kur ka na woyse Nasareet ŋ Galile, a kaɗta Betlehem ŋ Yudee, kur ɓi Dawuuda laam a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>A kaɗta bindka na ɓitiice Maryaama tel ɗe rook. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Noha a joy ɓasloh raak ɓa reyiɗ Betlehem, <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>a ɓasilla kuɓu ƴaar saawiŋ ɗe, a lemessa ɗe ŋ daah. Ina ɓa haɓeeɗi ŋ dalohaanaŋ hanheeca, tahha po a faannda ɗe ŋ ñamohaanaŋ ɗoopaat ca.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malaaka teeɓkiɗ niiɗoh ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ŋ bilaf faŋ kur ka, ɓi niiɗoh meeɗeen neeh nga ne ɓa taambkoh ɗoopaat caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Malaaka teeɓukka ɓa, siñaariŋ Heɗ ɓoo yipukka nga ɓa, ɓa feyuusa lool. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Waaye malaakaana woosa ɓa ne : « Kinaat neƴƴoh, ŋ kom ɗu woo neɓiɗ wi fu inah ne ɓooɓi jen hey sume nga keeh-keeh. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Woti ŋ kur ɓi Dawuuda, Mucɗoh wuu ɗu rimkiɗ nga ; a yi <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>, weɗ Heɗ ɓoo, <char style="w" lemma="Mucɗohi Gapohse">Mucɗohi Kooh gapohe</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Inii weɗ na hee ɗu wa teeɓe : Ɗu hey hote kuɓu lemesuuɗ ŋ daah, a faanu ŋ ñamoha ɗoopaat. » <verse eid="LUK 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Ɗekka po, mboolo malaaka laayoh na laayoh nikka na ya koc ŋ ɗiska, ca ƴeekeeɗa Kooh an :<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>« Yakkiŋ Kooh ƴeekaah</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">ŋ ɗiska uup ɗafuk ŋ Eel ca</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">te ɓooɓi neɓ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">ɓa raakaat jam ŋ kehƴi. »<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Wa malaakaaca faɗ ɓa ndaam, dokukka Eel ca, niiɗoh ca woosa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ɓoo kaɗaat Betlehem, marka ini raak nga, wi Heɗ ɓoo woo. » <verse eid="LUK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Ɓa arra kaɗ, ɓa raakka Maryaama na Suseef nga na kuɓka faanuuɗ ŋ ñamoha ɗoopaat. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Wa ɓa hot kuɓka, ɓa naandsukka ɓooɓa ini ɓa woyu nga ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Ɓooɓa kerah naandsukaŋ niiɗoh ca jen feyuusa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Maryaama, a ammba woo ceem jen ŋ hafiŋ ɗe, a markiseeɗa ca ŋ ɗooƴ ce. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Niiɗoh ca dokkeeɗa, ɓa ƴeekeeɗa yakkiŋ Kooh, ŋ ina ɓa kerah te ɓa hottaa laam wa raakoh ɗaa findi ɓa woyohsee wa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu teeɓohuuɗ ŋ Kahan Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Wa mbeha Maryaama ɓasloh dokuk, kuɓka <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗukka</char> ; ɓa teekka ɗe Yeesu, tiika malaakaana eɗohee bala yaay ɓa amban rook.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Wa neeh ca ɓa farsukohee reeh findi <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakoha, ɓa ɓayya kuɓka Yerusalem ne ɓa eɗ ɗe Heɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Laam, ŋ waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo, wa fiisuuɗ ne : « Komaaki saaw ƴaar nu nik ɗah, Heɗ ɓoo hey ɗe waɗse.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2-12">Pula 13:2-12</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Ɓa nammba <char style="w">seeƴuk</char> ne Maryaama hool findi wa nakohu ŋ waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo : hoɗ kanak mbaa banuut ƴin kanak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Lewiici 12:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simeyong na Aana yakɗiɗ Kooh sagu Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ŋ Yerusalem, raakiɗ ƴaara teeksee Simeyong nga, a nikee ƴaar yurhiɗ te a kerhiɗta Kooh, a nikee sekeeɗa mbehi Israayel hirpohsan. <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> nikee na Simeyong. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>A teeɓeen ɗe ne bala a kaanan ɗah, a hey hote Mucɗohi Gapohse Heɗ ɓoo woos. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani hiirra ɗe ŋ kaɗ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, raak Maryaama na Suseef ɓayiɗ Yeesu ne ɓa wik ɗe Kooh findi waasiŋ Musaa nakoha. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simeyong ammba gooya, a yakiɗta Kooh, an :<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>« Ɗiski wa nik ndii Heɗ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">fu miniɗ faɗ <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> ɗa a coot ŋ jam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">Fu haɓɗiɗ ini fu gapohee,<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>laam, na has ciŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:30">ŋ hotootiɗ Mucɗohi puloh nga ɗa<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>yi fu kooɗkiɗ ɓooɓi jen<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>a nikka ñiini na hee ɗa teeɓohe ŋ cuuɓ ci jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">te a yi ndamiŋ Israayel, cuuɓiŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Baabiŋ kuɓki na yaay ɓa feyuusa ŋ in ci Simeyong woo nga ɗe, <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simeyong barke'iɗta ɓa, a hannda woo Maryaama, yaayi ne : « Kuɓkii hay ne, ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ Israayel keen, laayiɗ kuruk. A hey nike firndeeni na hee taasse. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Ŋ ineem, liiɓ ci ɓo' laayiɗ ɗasiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa hey teeɓohse. Te fu Maryaama, fu hey raake miskiɗ findi ɓoyi yipu salma ŋ keeñ. »<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Wa nameen raak woosuuɗ ɓitiɓ teeku Aana, a nikee kuɓu Fanuwel yi ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓiŋ Aser. A ɓitfeen lool ; wa kilookiŋ ɗe coot, a pesiɗ kiis yasna-kanak na ƴaar ce, yeem kaannda, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>a rissa raakaaɗi ƴaar. A raakee kiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kaahay na kiis nikiis (84). A meeɗɗi kurkoh ŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh, a oreeɗa, a kiimeeɗa Kooh noh na wek ; a nikiɗohee ɗe ɗaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>A maasoheen wa Simeyong na woye, a nammba gidim Kooh, a woyeeɗa ɓooɓa seke faɗsuukiŋ Yerusalem jen ini kaɗ ŋ kuɓka.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Wa Suseef na Maryaama ƴut haɓiɗ in ci waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo nakoh jen, ɓa dokukka Galile, ŋ kur ɓa wi na woyse Nasareet. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Kuɓka yakeeɗa, a ndengeeɗa, a ɓaateeɗa raak liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ te Kooh hunnda na ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Kiis nu ree ɗah, Maryaama na Suseef kaɗ Yerusalem ne ɓa maasoh <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> ci, mbeh ci ɓa na naandsukohe pulohaŋ Israayel ci <char style="w">Misra</char>. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Wa Yeesu raak kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis kanak (12), a kaɗta na ɓa findi wa na tumohse. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Wa hewa reeh, ɓa haadeeɗa, waaye a yi Yeesu, a tassa ŋ Yerusalem. Yaay ɓa na baab ɓa yegɗi. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Ɓa liiɓpa haa ne a yaa ŋ huntoh caŋ ɓa ɓinooɓa, ɓa tiinnda ini ree noh mulnguus, ɓa hotɗi ɗe. Ɓa marakka ɗe ŋ nawleecaŋ ɓa na ɓaah caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Ɓa hotɗi ɗe, ɓa dokukka, ɓa waakeeɗa ɗe po ŋ ɗooƴ Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Ŋ mbeha kaahayɗoh, ɓa raakka ɗe ɓoofiɗ ŋ ɗooƴ Kahan Kooh ŋ leernaŋ jangɗohoh ca ; a sikɗukeeɗa ɓa, a nameeɗa ɓa meekis. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Ɓooɓa kerhee ɗe jen feyuusa ŋ neɓkiŋ ɗe hel, na findi a lofohee ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Wa yaay ɓa na baab ɓa hot ɗe, ɓa feyuusa. Yaay ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kuɓkiŋ ngo wa ye tah, fu haɓiɗta ɓoo inii ? Mi na baab ɗu, ɓoo feysee feyu, ɓoo ɓii waak ɗa poyi. »<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu waakeeɗa so ? Hanaa ɗu inahɗi ne, ŋ joy nik ŋ Kahan Baabiŋ ngo ? » <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Waaye ɓa inahɗi ini a woo ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Ŋ ineem Yeesu hunnda na ɓa, ɓa dokukka kur ka na woyse Nasareet. Ŋ ineem, a kerhiɗeen ɓa, yaay ɓa ammba in ceem jen ŋ hafiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yeesu yakeeɗa, a uupeeɗa uup raak liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ, a neɓpa ɓooɓa, a neɓpa Kooh.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Woo kiŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Wa nikee ŋ jamanoonaŋ buura yakkaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> na woyse Tibeer, wa a tum kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis yatuus (15) ŋ hafaŋ kur ka, waam a Ponse Pilaat nikee goornooraŋ Yudee, Herod adgohha Galile, Filip taambɗoh ce adgohha Iture na Tarakonit, Lisañas adgohha Abileen ; <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Hannas na Kayif nikka <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca yakak ca<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hannas a yi nikee seeƴkiɗoha yakka, waaye e ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> nihsohee ɗe nga, tufkiɗta Kayif. Kon ŋ jamanoonaam, ɓa kanak jen, ɓa ɓeeɗkohsee seeƴkiɗoh yakak.</char></note>. Ŋ kiis kaam, Kooh dengkohha kuɓkiŋ Sakariya na woyse <char style="w">Yahya</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yahya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a na name ɓeeɗkohu Yahya Ɓoktohi. A yi Saaŋ <char style="tl">Batiis</char> ŋ farañse.</char></note> woo kiŋ ɗe, raak ɗe genee nduufa. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yahya wileeɗa ŋ ɓakaŋ kalaŋ Yurdan jen, a inhiɗeeɗa ɓa ne ɓa hayaat ɓa ɓoktuk, wa teeɓoh ne ɓa teyiɗ ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ, ɓa min ɗaasu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Wa raakohha ɗaa findi wa fiisohu ŋ teerndiŋ woosuuɗi Esayi an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">« Hooso wa ɗaa leehuk ŋ nduufa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“ Haɓɗaat waasiŋ Heɗ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">haɓɗiɗaat ɗe waas ciŋ ɗe jen, ca yurah.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Oon ci jen hey uumbse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">tangooci na tund ci jen hey girtasse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">waas ci nduuɗkiɗ ci hey yurhiɗasse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">te ci raak atoh hey luhtasse.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-4">Esayi 40:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Ɓooɓi jen hey hote findi Kooh na mucɗohohe. ” »<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Ɓo' laayiɗ hayeeɗa ŋ Yahya Ɓoktohi ne a ɓokit ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ini ɗu añaand haa ne iiñ jen, ɗu liiɓiɗ ne ɗu miniɗ penduk ayrukiŋ Kooh wi na haye e ? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗu baahaat, wa teeɓoh ne ɗu ɓoƴsohiɗ pesohaaɗ, te kinaat ɗaar rek ɗu woyee ŋ ɗooƴ ɗu ne “ Ɓoo rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima. ” Ñam na woyee ɗu ne atoh cii, Kooh miniɗ pulɗiɗ Ibrahiima kuɓu nga ca. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Ɗiski wa nik ndii, kiw ki ƴutiɗ ne wa giing tas kidig, te waa nu raakɗi rim baahiɗ ɗah, wa hey ƴoɓse wa njafu ŋ yongkaaha. »<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Ɓooɓa meekseeɗa Yahya ne : « Ɓoo tuman na ? » <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu raak kulɓa kanak ɗah, eɗa ɓoyi raakɗi winoori, te ɓo' nu nam raak kañam ɗah, paysohaa na ɓoyi raakɗi. » <verse eid="LUK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Ɓi <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> nammba hay nga ɗe ne ɓa ɓoktu, ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo joy ye haɓiɗ Jangɗohohi ? » <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Kanaat ɓaat tus ŋ ini ɗu naku. » <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Ɓi soldaar hayya nga ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Moo ! Ɓoo joy ye haɓiɗ ? » A woosa ɓa ne : « Kinaat ɓay kopor ɓo' ŋ naafiɗ wala ŋ lee ; topaat ŋ ini ɗu na wirndasse. »<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Ɓooɓa nikee sekeeɗa <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> sek keeh-keeh, yaa nu nga woyeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Andi e Yahya Mucɗohi Kooh gapohe ? » <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yahya loffa ɓa jen ne : « Mi na ɓoktee ɗu na masuɓ, waaye raakiɗ ɓoyi na haye yi uup po nik kilifa, te ŋ yeyyooɗi nik <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> ɗe ne ŋ toksiɗee ɗe ñafaɗ ciŋ ɗe. A yi, a ɓoktohan ɗu <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, na yongkaah. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>A amb saliŋ ɗe ŋ yaah, ne a nistoh pees na fuñind. A nangɗoh pees ci ŋ ndapiŋ ɗe, a doh fuñndi ŋ yongkaahi heyɗi ƴime. » <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Yahya ñaaheeɗa ɓooɓa ŋ inaa laayiɗ ne a woo ɓa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Ŋ mirndaani, Yahya woytohha Herod ya adgoh Galile ŋ ini a kooɗ Herojaad, yi ɓiti taambɗoh ce, na in ca moɗaaɗiica wiiriis ca a tumee jen. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Herod taƴɗukka Yahya ŋ kasoona, ɓaatta ŋ in ca moɗaaɗiica a tume.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cambiŋ pangkiŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Ŋ jamanoona Yahya ɓoktohee ɓooɓa jen, Yeesu nammba ɓoktu. Wa a na kiime Kooh, Eel ci rangsukka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh yipukka nga ɗe, ŋ mandohaaɗ banuut. Hooso kerhukka ŋ Eel ci an : « A fu kuɓkiŋ ngo ŋ waaɗ keeh-keeh te ŋ neɓuuɗ nga ɗa lool.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sabuur 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Esayi 42:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Wa Yeesu na cambe pangkaŋ ɗe raak ɗe ŋ ɓak kiis ndaŋkiyaah-kaahay (30). Ɓooɓa ammba ne a kuɓu Suseef.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:23">Suseef, a Heeli rim ɗe,<verse eid="LUK 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Heeli a kuɓu Matat,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Matat nikka kuɓu Lewi,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Lewi a yiŋ Melki,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Melki nikka yiŋ Yanayi,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:24">Yanayi yiŋ Suseef,<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Suseef Matacas,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Matacas Amos,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Amos Nahum,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Nahum Esli,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:25">Esli Nagayi,<verse eid="LUK 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nagayi Maat,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:26">Maat Matacas, Matacas Semeyin,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:26">Semeyin Yosek, Yosek Yoda,<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yoda Yowanan, Yowanan Resa,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa Sorobabel, Sorobabel Salacel,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:27">Salacel Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neri Melki,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:28">Melki Adi, Adi Kosam,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosam Elmadam, Elmadam Er,<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Er Yeesu, Yeesu Eliyeser,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyeser Yorim, Yorim Matat,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:29">Matat Lewi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lewi Simeyong,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeyong Yudaa, Yudaa Suseef,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:30">Suseef Yonam, Yonam Eliyakim,<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliyakim Meleya, Meleya Menna,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:31">Menna Matata, Matata Natan,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:31">Natan Dawuuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Dawuuda Yesay,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:32">Yesay Obed, Obed Boos,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:32">Boos Salmon, Salmon Nahson,<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nahson Aminadaab, Aminadaab Admin,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:33">Admin Arni, Arni Hesroon,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:33">Hesroon Peeres, Peeres Yudaa,<verse eid="LUK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yudaa Yaŋhooɓa, Yaŋhooɓa Isaahha,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:34">Isaahha Ibrahiima, Ibrahiima Tera,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:34">Tera Nahor, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahor Serug,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:35">Serug Reyu, Reyu Peleg,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:35">Peleg Eber, Eber Selah,<verse eid="LUK 3:35"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Selah Kaynan, Kaynan Arpaksad,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:36">Arpaksad Sem, Sem Noohin,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:36">Noohin Lemek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lemek Matusalem,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:37">Matusalem Henok, Henok Yered,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:37">Yered Mahalal'el, Mahalal'el Kenan,<verse eid="LUK 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenan Enos, Enos Set,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="LUK 3:38">Set Aadama, Aadama yi Kooh fer.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Seytaani jaɗɗiɗ Yeesu fiir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Wa Yeesu puloh kalaŋ Yurdan, raak <char style="w">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> riifiɗ ɗe. Fuuɗseem kaɗɗukohhaa ɗe nduufa. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>A nikka nga neeh ndaŋkiyaah-nikiis (40), ndaam, Seytaani fiireeɗa ɗe. A ñamɗi ŋ neeh ceem, ŋ mirndaani a aɗukka. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Weɗi Seytaani woyoh ɗe ne : « Nik ne fu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> ɗah, woya atoh fii wa ɓoƴsuk mbuuru. » <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyiɗ ne : “ Ɓo' na pesohe mbuuru dong haa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Rohƴiɗi 8:3</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Seytaani ɓayya ɗe ŋ ɗiska uup ɗafuk, a teeɓpa ɗe, ŋ harmban ñep na marak, nguur ciŋ adinaani jen. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>A woosa ɗe ne : « Nguur cii jen na ini ŋ ɗooƴ ca degu ŋ yaah ciŋ ngo te ŋ miniɗ ca eɗ ɓoyi neɓ po. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Fu teyɗuk ƴek ŋ fikiiso ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa ca one jen. » <verse eid="LUK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Fiis ci woo ne “ Ƴekɗa Kooh Heɗ fu, te fu ñaamuk a yi dong.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Rohƴiɗi 6:13</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Seytaani ɓayissa ɗe Yerusalem, ŋ jol <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahnaŋ Kooh</char>, a woosa ɗe ne : « Nik ne fu Kuɓkiŋ Kooh ɗah, faɗsuka ŋ kehƴi ; <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyiɗ ne : “ Kooh hey nake malaakaaciŋ ɗe, ca niiɗ ɗa. ” <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Te : “ Ca ɓay ɗa ŋ yaah ciŋ ca, po kot ciŋ ɗa laɓkanɗi ŋ atoh. ” » <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yeesu nammba ɗe lof ne : « Fiis ci namiɗ woo ne : “ Kana markisuk Kooh Heɗ fu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Rohƴiɗi 6:16</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Wa Seytaani jaɗiɗ ɗe fiir po a miniɗɗi ɗe in, a cootta, a sekɗoheeɗa ɗe mbeh wiiriis.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ Galile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>A Yeesu dokuk Galile kotii, raak ɗe riifiɗ na doolndiŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. Ɓooɓa laamtoheeɗa ɗe ŋ kur caam jen, <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>a jangɗoheeɗa ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ca, ɓooɓa jen laaskeeɗa ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>A aaseeɗa, a puleeɗa kur ca po a reesa ŋ Nasareet, kur ka a yakoh. Wa <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> ree, a aassa ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char> findi a meeɗa tumoh, a kurukka ne a jang ini fiisu. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Ɓa eɗta ɗe teerndiŋ woosuuɗi na woyse Esayi, a puliɗta ɗiski inii fiisu :<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>« Fuuɗsiŋ Heɗ ɓoo yii nga so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">laam a yi kooɗ to ne ŋ kom ñakiɗ ci <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">a yi woos so ne ŋ woo ambuuɗ ci faɗsuukiŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">ŋ woo fuuliɗ ci ne ɓa hey hote</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">te ŋ nam puliɗ torhiɗuuɗ ci ŋ miskiɗiŋ ɓa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>ŋ yegɗoh ne kiis kii, weɗ kiis ki Heɗ ɓoo teeɓohan baahkiŋ ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Esayi 61:1-2</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut, a lemmba teernda, a dokinndaa ƴaara na ɗaakee wa, a ɓooffa ne a woo ; ɓooɓa nikee ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char> jen yurhiɗkohha na ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ini Fiis ci woyee wii te ɗu kerahhaa, wa raakiɗ woti. » <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Ɓooɓa jen woyeeɗa in baahiɗ nga ɗe, ɓa feyuusa ŋ woo ca neɓiɗ ca a woo. Ɓa weeɗa ne : « Ƴaarii a kuɓu Suseef haa e ? » <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ inhiɗ ne ɗu hey yo woye woo kii : “ Paƴohi, paƴa haf fu. Ɓoo kerhiɗ in ca fu tum ŋ Kapernawum jen, tuma mand ɗaa ndii, ŋ kur ki fu genoh. ” »<verse eid="LUK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Yeesu degiɗta ɓa nga ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh : Ali woosuuɗ na teyɗukseeɗi ŋ kur ka a genoh. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Ɗu inhiɗ ne ŋ jamanoonaŋ woosuuɗi <char style="w">Ilyas</char>, wa Kooh toɓɗi kiis kaahay na camban te aɗ miskiɗ raakka ŋ kur ka jen, wa raak ɓitiɓ laayiɗ ŋ Israayel ƴaar caŋ ɓa kaaniɗ. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Moona Kooh tuuƴɗi Ilyas ŋ ali ɓitiɓ nga ɓa, waaye a tuuƴ ɗe ŋ ɓitɓa ƴaar ce nam kaan ya genee Sarepta ŋ kur kaŋ Sidoon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Te ŋ jamanoonaŋ woosuuɗi na woyse Elise, ɓo' laayiɗ raakeen <char style="w">kosaay ki na oɓse faan</char> ŋ Israayel, moona ali ɓo' wirɗuuɗi nga ɓa, waaye a Naaman ya genee Siri, a yi wirɗu. »<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Wa ɓa kerah woo ceem, ɓooɓa nikee ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char> jen ayrukka po ɓa heeɗa pooke. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Ɓa kurukka, ɓa puliɗta ɗe kur ka, ɓa ɓayya ɗe ŋ suunaŋ tangoora ɓa yipohee kur kaŋ ɓa ne ɓa yeñ ɗe a kaan <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>waaye a lahha ŋ harmban ɓa, a cootta waas ce.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ƴaara jiini amb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Yeesu kaɗeeɗa po a reesa kur wiiriis ŋ Galile na woyse Kapernawum ; a jangɗeeɗa ɓooɓa ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>A woyee woo kilifa, tahha po, ɓa feyuusa ŋ jangɗohiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Ŋ ɗooƴ <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>, wa raakeen ƴaara <char style="w">jiini</char> ambe, a leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka an : <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>« Hee ! Yeesu yiŋ Nasareet, waas fu ye nga ɓoo ? Fu hay ne fu yah ɓoo e ? Ŋ inhiɗ ɓoyi fu nikoh ; a fu Ɓoyi Hooliɗi Kooh woos. » <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yeesu ngassa ɗe an : « Ɗeka, te fu pul ngaŋ ƴaari ! » Jiinnda folla ƴaara ŋ fiki ɓooɓa waaye a tumɗi ɗe in, a pulla nga ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Wa ineem raak, ɓooɓa jen feyuusa, ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa an : « Cey, woo kiŋ ƴaarii wa woo ye ? Wa hun na hatil, jiiniici sah na hoolaaɗiiki ca hoolaaɗi, ca kerhiɗiɗ ɗe po a woo ca ne pulaat ɗah, ca saandohe ! » <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Ɓa laamtoheeɗa Yeesu, ŋ ɗisik nu nik ŋ kur caam jen.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ kosaayiɗ laayiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Wa Yeesu puloh <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char>, a kaɗta kahan Simong tel yaayiŋ ɓiti Simong kosaayiɗ po faaniŋ ɗe nikka dohiɗ jip. Ɓa kiimmba Yeesu ne a wiriɗ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>A hiirra nga ɗe, a ngassa kosaay ka, wa saɓsukohha na ɗe. Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska a kurukka, po a taambkoheeɗa ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Wa noha muy, ɓa raakee kosaayiɗ jen hayya ŋ Yeesu na ɓi jangaaro ɗalohiɗ, a degga yaa nu nga ɗah yaah ciŋ ɗe, yaa nu a degga yaah ciŋ ɗe ɗah, yeem wir. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Ɓi jiini puloheeɗa ŋ kosaayiɗ laayiɗ, ca leehkeeɗa ne : « Fu Kuɓkiŋ Kooh ! » Ca inheen ne a yi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, tahha po a ngasukka ca, a faɗɗi ca ne ca woo.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Wa Kooh wiis, Yeesu pulla kur ka, a kaɗta ŋ ɗisik ɗaayiɗ, ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ waakeeɗa ɗe. Wa ɓa hot ɗe, ɓa waaɗta ɗe amb ne a cootuu. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Waaye a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ joyiɗ nam ɓay Yegɗohiŋ Muci, wiŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh, ŋ kur ci cinooci, ineem weɗ tah ho woosu. » <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>A taalndiɗta, a yegɗoheeɗaa ŋ <char style="tl">sinaagog</char> caŋ kur caŋ Yudee.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓeeɗkiɗ ɓi taalube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu nikka ŋ sereendaŋ Cookmaŋ-Senesaret<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cookmaŋ-Senesaret weɗ nam teeku Cookmaŋ-Galile.</char></note>, ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ ndeerra ɗe, ɓa baɓkoheeɗa ne ɓa min sikɗuk woo kiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Yeesu hotta gaal kanak ŋ sereendaŋ cookma, waam raak seeɓoh ca ruhsiɗ ŋ gaal ca po ɓa naawseeɗa mbaal caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>A rappa ŋ waŋ Simong, a woosa ɗe ne : « Yeña gaali ŋ ɗooƴ masmi ƴissuut. » Simong yennjaa, Yeesu ɓooffa nga, a jangɗeeɗa ɓooɓa.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Wa a ƴut ɓa jangiɗ, a woosa Simong ne : « Kaɗa na gaali po ɗiska cookmi nooɗoh, ɗu njaf mbaal ciŋ ɗu, ɗu seeɓ. » <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simong loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, niinma ɓoo neeh seeɓ te ali cuurund ɓoo ambɗi waaye, ŋ hey njafe mbaal ci. »<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Wa ɓa njaf ca, ɓa ammba cuurund laayiɗ po mbaal ca faarkeeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa kaayilla huntoh caŋ ɓa nikee ŋ gaala winoora yaah, ne ɓeem hay ɓa ɓaatɗohe. Ɓa hayya, ɓa siffa gaal ca kanak ca jen cuurund po ca diigeeɗa.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Wa Simong Piyeer hot ŋ ineem, a ƴekka ŋ fiki Yeesu a woosa ne : « Us so kilifaani, ŋ bakaaɗoh. » <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>A feyse feyu a yi na ɓooɓa a hunee na ɓa jen sagu cuurund ca ɓa amb. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Huntoh caŋ ɗe Saak na Saaŋ, kuɓuuciŋ Sebede, nammba feyu. Yeesu woosa Simong ne : « Kana tiit, ini amboh woti fu seeɓan ɓo' kotii. »<verse eid="LUK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Wa ɓa puliɗ gaal caŋ ɓa ŋ sereendaŋ cookma, ɓa faɗta in caŋ ɓa jen, ɓa ñaakiɗta Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ɓo' kosaayiɗ kosaay ki na oɓse faan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu nikka ŋ kur, raak ƴaar yaa nga, a ambohee <char style="w">kosaay ki na oɓse faan</char> po faaniŋ ɗe jen yahrukohha. A hot hot Yeesu rek, a ƴekka po pukiŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi, a kiimmba ɗe an : « Kilifaani, fu waaɗa ɗah, fu miniɗ to saɓsoh na kosaay kii po ŋ nik ɓo' hooliɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yeesu raɗissa yaah, a degga ɗe wa, a woosa ne : « Ŋ waaɗiɗa, hoola ! » Ŋ ɗiska ɗiska kosaay kaŋ ƴaara saɓsukohha na ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yeesu nakka ɗe ne a kinaata woo ali ɓo', a woosa ɗe ne : « Kaɗa fu teeɓa haf fu <char style="w" lemma="seeƴkiɗoh">seeƴkiɗoha</char>, fu haɓiɗ seeƴki <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> nakoh ne fu hool, wa teeɓoh ne fu wiriɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-32">Lewiici 14:2-32</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Tiikiŋ Yeesu uupeeɗa nga kerhu, ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ hayeeɗa nga ɗe ne ɓa sikɗuk ɗe te ɓa wir ŋ kosaay caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, a meeɗeen ɗaay ŋ nduufa, a kiimee Kooh nga.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ lafñiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu jangɗoheeɗa. Ɓi ɓo' ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca na ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa nikee nga. Ɓa pulohee kur caŋ Galile jen na caŋ Yudee na Yerusalem. Hatiliŋ Heɗ ɓoo huneen na Yeesu ne a wiriɗ kosaayiɗ ca. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Ɓi ɓo' hayya, gaalɗohiɗ ƴaar ŋ faankoha. E kot ciŋ ɗe sange. Weɗ tahee ɓa ɓayeeɗa ɗe ŋ Yeesu, raak ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ taɓah. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Waaye ɓa raakɗi ɗiski ɓa hee taambe sagu findi ɓooɓa laayohe. Ɓa rappa ŋ ɗafuk taɓaha, ɓa nihissa ŋ poon caŋ wa, ɓa yoorra ɗe ŋ ɗooƴ ɓooɓa ŋ fiki Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Wa Yeesu hot ɓa na findi ɓa kosoh, a woosa ƴaara kosaayɗa ne : « Ƴaariŋ ngo, fu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca woyeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa ne : « Ƴaarii a yi ɓa po a ɗale Kooh mand an ? Ali ɓo' minɗi ɗaasoh bakaaɗ ɗal Kooh dong ! » <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Waaye Yeesu inahha ina ɓa liiɓee ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu liiɓee ineem ? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Ŋ woo ƴaarii ne : “ Fu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa ” wala ŋ woo ɗe ne : “ Kurka fu tiind. ” A winde uup yooɓ ? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Mbaa ŋ hey ɗu teeɓe ne <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> raakiɗ doolndi a min ɗaasoh bakaaɗ ŋ kehƴi. » Yeesu woosa ƴaara lafñiɗa ne : « Ñam woo ɗa wa, kurka fu ɓay basngiŋ ɗa te fu haad. » <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Ŋ fiki ɓooɓa jen ƴaara jaarra kuruk, a ɓayya faankohaanaŋ ɗe, a haadeeɗa, a yakɗeeɗa Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Ɓooɓa jen feyuusa ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh ; ɓa jaahiɗta, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ɓoo hotiɗ in feyohiɗ woti. »<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ kahan Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Wa Yeesu pul, a hotta <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> teeku Lewi ɓoofiɗ ŋ ɗiska a na juuti'ohe. A woosa ɗe ne : « Ñaakiɗ to. » <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Lewi kurukka, a faɗta in caŋ ɗe jen, a ñaakɗeeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Wa ɓa ree kahan Lewi, a tikɗukiɗta Yeesu kañam laayiɗ ndaam. Ɓi <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> laayiɗ na ɓi ɓo' wiiriis ñameeɗa na ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>
    <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca na jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa ñaɗtukeeɗa ŋ taalubeeciŋ Yeesu an : « Wa ye tah ɗu ñame, ɗu anee na juuti'oh ci na bakaaɗoh ci ɓinooɓi ? » <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi kosaayɗi etohɗi paƴoh, e kosaayiɗ ci etoh paƴoh. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ŋ hayɗi ne ŋ ɓeeɗuk ɓooɓi yurhiɗ ci waaye ŋ hay ne ŋ ɓeeɗuk bakaaɗoh ci, ɓa ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ. »<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Ɓa woosa Yeesu ne : « Taalubeeciŋ <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> na ɗeke po ɓa ore, ɓa kiimee Kooh findi ɓiŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci, waaye ɓiŋ ɗa deey, na ñamee ñam, ɓa ane. » <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Hanheeci hay kilook, ɓa hey orɗukohse te raak heɗ kilooki yii na ɓa e ? Wa minɗi nik ! <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Waaye wa hey raake jamano heɗ kilooki kooɗohu nga ɓa, ndeem, ɓa hey ore. »<verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Ŋ ineem Yeesu woosa ɓa andiini mandtiɗkohaanii : « Ali ɓo' na faareeɗi ŋ kulɓa as ne fu daaf kulɓa maañiɗ. Mbaa fu hey yahe kulɓaaki asi te seeketi fu na hee kooɗohe nga hunanɗi na kulɓaaki kiisɗi. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Te ali ɓo' na tumeeɗi biiñi asi na soñe ŋ mbohos und maañiɗ ; mbaa biiñi hey pooke mbohoseem, wa aamuk, mbohosi yahrukoh. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Biiñ as joy tumu ŋ mbohos as. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Waaye ɓo' nu an biiñ maañiɗ ɗah, fu heyɗi waaɗe biiñ as, laam fu na woyee ne : “ Wi maañɗi baahiɗ. ” »<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu, Heɗ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Wa nikee ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗeeɗa, ɓa taammba ŋ yohon caŋ beleeca, taalubeeciŋ ɗe piikeeɗa nga ca, ɓa ɓorñeeɗa pees ca, ɓa ñameeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Ɓi <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> hotta ɓa, woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na haɓɗe ini waasiŋ ɓoo sangoh ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:21">Pula 34:21</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Mand haa ne ɗu moosɗi jangoh ina Dawuuda haɓɗee wa a aɗuk a yi na ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe ? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>A aas ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a ɓayya mbuuruuca degsee ŋ taaɓla wuu Kooh, a ñammba nga ca, a nammba eɗ ɓooɓa hunee na ɗe, te ali ɓo' joyɗi ñam mbuuruuceem ɗal <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lewiici 24:9</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Yeesu degiɗta ɓa nga ne : « <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> a yi Heɗ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse. »<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ heɗ yaah ɓeendkiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Wa raakissa jamano, ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, Yeesu aassa ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>, a jangɗoheeɗa. Wa raakeen ɓo' nga, yaahiŋ ɗe ñaahmi ɓeendkee ɓeenduk. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca markiɗeeɗa Yeesu andi a hey wirɗohe ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, ɓa raak yambaah ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Yeesu inhee inah ini ɓa liiɓee, tahha po a woosa ƴaara na yaaha ne : « Kurka fu tufuk ŋ fiki ɓooɓi jen. » Ƴaara tufukka ŋ fiki ɓooɓa. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ meekis ɗu, wa ye teyɗohu ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, in baahiɗ wala in baahaaɗi ? Ɓo' joy joy hirpu nga wala a joy joy apu ? » <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Ŋ ineem, a marakka ɓa jen, a woosa ƴaara ne : « Raɗsa yaahiŋ ɗa. » Ƴaara raɗissa yaahiŋ ɗe, wa wirra peng. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Jangɗohoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca ayrukka po ɓa heeɗa kaane. Ɓa hotoheeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne ɓa marak findi ɓa joy tum Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu taniɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ŋ neeh caam, Yeesu rappa ŋ ɗafuk tango ne a kiim Kooh ; a neehha kiim Kooh nga. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Na ɓaaɓa teel, a ɓeeɗukka taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a kooɗta nga ɓa ɓo' ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12), a teekka ɓa "<char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char>". <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Ɓa nikee Simong yi a teekee Piyeer na Andare taambɗoh Simong na Saak na Saaŋ na Filip na Bartalemi <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>na Macce na Tomaa na Saak kuɓkiŋ Alfe na Simong yi teeksee <char style="tl">Selot</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">Selot</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi ɓoyi waaɗ kur ce po a ƴutiɗ ne a hiñohiɗa.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>na Yudaa kuɓu Saak na Yudaa Iskaryot yi mirndoh nik woroh.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Wa a tan ɓa, a hunnda na ɓa, a ruhussa tangoora. A kaɗta po ŋ ɗisik angiɗ, raak ɓo' laayiɗ nga ɓaah ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe na ɓooɓa fu inah ne ɓa pulohee kur caŋ Yudee jen na Yerusalem, na kur ca huntiɗkohee na cookma ŋ ɓakaŋ Tiir na Sidoon. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Ɓooɓeem ɓa hayee ne ɓa sikɗuk Yeesu te ɓa wirɗu ŋ kosaay caŋ ɓa. Ɓa fu inah ne <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniica</char> na hoolaaɗiika ca hoolaaɗi, ca ambeen ɓa, ɓa wirra. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Ɓo' nu nga ɗah waaɗta ɗe laal sagu hatila pulohee nga ɗe wirɗeeɗa ɓa jen.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Neɓ na neɓaaɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Weɗi Yeesu yurhiɗkoh na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">« Ɗu neɓɗiɗ, ɗu ɓi ñakiɗ ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">laam, Nguuriŋ-Kooh wa wuu ɗu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Ɗu neɓɗiɗ, ɗu ɓi aɗkiɗ ci woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">laam, ɗu hey kape nding.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Ɗu neɓɗiɗ, ɗu ɓi na fuɗe woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">ɗu hey ƴene.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Ɗu neɓɗiɗ, ne ɓooɓi sang ɗu ɗah, ɓa aañee ɗu, ɓa ɓasee ɗu, te ɓa moɗaaɗiɗɗee tiik ciŋ ɗu sagu Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi ɗah. <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Wa ree ɗah, sumaat po ɗu mbece, laam aafi na sekee ɗu ŋ ɗafka yakiɗ te ɗu inah ne caacuuciŋ ɓa mbugalohee woosuuɗ ci ɗaa.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>Mas, ɗu ɓi heɗ raak-raak ci</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">laam ɗu rahsiɗ ini joy ɗu sumiɗ po ƴutiɗ.<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Mas, ɗu ɓi kap woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">laam, kim ɗu hey aɗke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Mas, ɗu ɓi na ƴene woti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">laam, ɗu hey nike ŋ tiis te ɗu hey fuɗe.<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Mas, ne ɓooɓi jen woyɗee ɗu baahiɗ ɗah, laam caacuuciŋ ɓa meeɗ tumoh ɗaa na ɓi tumee haf ɓa woosuuɗ. »<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Waaɗ ɓi sang ɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>« Ɗu ɓi na sikɗukee so, ñam na woyee ɗu ne waaɗaat ɓooɓi sang ɗu, te ɗu tumɗee ɓa in baahiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>Kiimɗaat barke ɓooɓi waaɗ ne ɗu alku, te ɗu kiimɗe ɓooɓi na torhiɗee ɗu in baahiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Ɓo' nu tip ɗa paɗ ŋ kaɓaaɓ ɗah, eɗaa ɗe wi tas. Ɓo' nu naaf paltooniŋ ɗa ɗah, kanaa ɗe sangoh kulɓaakiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Ɓo' nu kiim ɗa ɗah, onaa ɗe te ɓo' nu ɓay in ci fu raak ɗah, kinaa ɗe ca meekis.<verse eid="LUK 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Mbaa tumɗaat ɓooɓi in ci ɗu waaɗ ne ɓa haɓɗiɗ ɗu ca. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>Ɗu waaɗ ɓooɓi waaɗ ɗu dong ɗah, ɗu raak ye gidmaah ŋ ineem ? Bakaaɗoh ci sah waaɗiɗ ɓooɓi waaɗ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Te ɗu haɓɗiɗee in moɗiɗ ɓooɓi na tumɗee ɗu baahiɗ ɗah, ɗu raak ye gidmaah nga ? Bakaaɗoh ci sah na tumohe ɗaa. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Te ɗu wotɗee dong ɓooɓi ɗu amb ne ɓa hey ɗu wirnde ɗah, gidmaah raakɗi ŋ ineem. Bakaaɗoh ci sah na wotɗe bakaaɗoh ci ne ɓa min rahas ini ɓa wotɗoh.<verse eid="LUK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Waaye waaɗaat ɓi sang ɗu, ɗu tumɗee ɓa in baahiɗ, ɗu wotɗohee te ɗu heelkuu wirind nga. Ŋ ineem aafiŋ ɗu hey yake te ɗu nikan ini ŋ moos ɗu teek, kuɓuuciŋ Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka. Laam, a yi, a na teeɓohee teeɓoh baahkiŋ ɗe ŋ ɓooɓi añaandiɗ ci na corkiɗeeɗi ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Yirmohaat findi Kooh Baabiŋ ɗu na yirmohe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Pula 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:15">Sabuur 86:15</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kinaat markoh ɓo' in</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>Kinaat markoh ɓo' in, mbaa ɗu heyɗi markohse in te kinaat amboh ɓo' in, mbaa ɗu heyɗi ambohse in. Ɗaasohaat te ɗu hey ɗaasse. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Onohaat te ɗu hey onse. Ɗu hey poonɗasse laayiɗ, ca ɗengu po ca aamke, laam ɓeesohaani ɗu na ɓeesɗohohe, weɗ ɗu ɓeesɗohsan. »<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Yeesu woyissa ɓa woo kii : « Fuuliɗ miniɗ nook fuuliɗ e ? Ndaa ɓa kanak jen, ɓa keenanɗi ŋ nung e ? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Taalube uupɗi inah ɓoyi na jangɗee ɗe waaye a teeɓu baahiɗ ɗah, a hey mande na ɓoyi na jangɗee ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>Wa ye tah fu markee ɓoli ŋ hasiŋ morom fu, te wa ndooɗ yakak nik ŋ hasiŋ ɗa ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Fu min na woyoh morom fu ne : “ Ƴaariŋ ngo faɗa ŋ nihsiɗ ɗa ɓoli ŋ hasiŋ ɗa ”, te fu yegɗi ndooɗi yakki nik ŋ wiŋ ɗa ? Naafeehaani, koca nihis ndooɗi yakki ŋ hasiŋ ɗa. Fu min hot baahiɗ ne fu nihsiɗ morom fu ɓoli ŋ hasiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidig na rim ciŋ wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>Kidig baahiɗ minɗi raak rim baahaaɗi te kidig baahaaɗi minɗi raak rim baahiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Laam, kidig na inhisohse rimiŋ wa. Ndun na ɓeenohseeɗi ŋ ñaaɓaaɓ, reseñ na nameeɗi ɓeenohu ŋ kidig rup. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Wa mand ɗaa, ɓo' baahiɗ na pulɗe in baahiɗ raakee weɗ a ɗaak ŋ keeñiŋ ɗe. Ɓo' baahaaɗi na pulɗe in baahaaɗi raakee weɗ a ɗaak ŋ keeñiŋ ɗe. Laam, nguɓ na woye ini keeñ riif naa.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mandohaaɗ taalube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>Wa ye tah ɗu ɓeeɗkee so “ Heɗ ɓoo, Heɗ ɓoo ” te ɗu na tumeeɗi ini mi na woye ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Ɓo' nu hay nga so, a sikɗuk woo kiŋ ngo te a pesohee wa ɗah, hayaat ŋ woo ɗu ini ɓoyeem mand naa : <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>a mand na ɓoyi na taɓahe kahan, a acca nooɗiɗ po a pulla ŋ atoh, a yippa <char style="tl">fondamaaniŋ</char> ɗe nga. Mbeh, Kooh toɓpa, masma baliɗta po wa laɓpa nga, wa miniɗɗi kahneem in laam wa taɓahu taɓah ndengiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Waaye ɓoyi na sikɗuke woo kiŋ ngo te a pesohuu wa, a mand na ɓoyi na taɓahe kahan te a haɓɗiɗuu wa <char style="tl">fondama</char>. Wa masma bal po wa laɓpa nga, wa jaarraa fol, wa yahrukohha jameet. »<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kosaŋ kilifaanaŋ soldaar ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo na ɓooɓa ŋ in ceem jen, a kaɗta Kapernawum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Raakeen ƴaar nga, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓa adgohee soldaar caŋ Rom, a raakka <char style="w">ñaam</char> kosaayiɗ kosaay miskiɗ po a heeɗa kaane te ƴaareem a keeñkoheen ñaama lool. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>A kerahha laamtohaŋ Yeesu, a woossa ɓi kilifa Yawuut nga ɗe ne ɓa kiim ɗe, a hay wirɗe ñaamiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4-5"/>Ɓa kaɗta ŋ Yeesu, ɓa kiimeeɗa ɗe keeh-keeh ; ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ƴaari woos ɓoo deey, a waaɗiɗ ɓoo, ɓi Yawuut ci. Te a yi sah taɓahɗuk <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagogiŋ</char></char> ɓoo. Weɗ tah, a cariɗ ɓaatɗohu. » <verse eid="LUK 7:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yeesu hunnda na ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa heeɗa ree kahna, ƴaara woosissa nawleeciŋ ɗe ne ɓa woo Yeesu ne : « Ƴaari woo ne, kina yaaɓ nga kilifaani, a hot ne a yeyyooɗi ne fu aas kahan ce. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ineem weɗ tah po, a nammba hot ne a ƴissuutiɗ ngaŋ hayoot nga ɗa ; woya woo rek, ñaamiŋ ɗe kuruk. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>A raakiɗ ɓooɓi adgoh ɗe te a namiɗ raak soldaar ci a adgoh. Yaa nu a woo kaɗa ɗah, a kaɗ te yaa nu a woo haya ɗah, a hay. In nu a woo ñaamiŋ ɗe ne a haɓɗaata ɗah, a haɓiɗa. »<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Wa Yeesu kerah ineem, a feyuusa ŋ ƴaara ; a woosa mboolnda ñaakɗee ɗe ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ŋ Israayel ci sah, ŋ hotɗi ali ɓo' kosiɗ kosii. »<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Wa ƴaaɓa woossee dokuk kahna, ɓa raak ñaama kosaayee wiriɗ.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu hultiɗiɗ kuɓka fiira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Ŋ finho ineem, Yeesu kaɗeeɗa kur ka na woyse Nayin. Taalubeeciŋ ɗe na ɓo' laayiɗ hunnda na ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>A kaɗta po a heeɗa ree <char style="w" lemma="aasoha kur">aasohaanaŋ kur ka</char>, a cohha na ɓi ɓo' kaɗeeɗa uumba fiɗaaf komaaki fiir, yi fu inah ne yaay ɓa raakee ɗe yino te ɓitɓeem ƴaar ce kaaneen. Ɓo' laayiɗ ŋ kur ka huneen na ɗe, ɓa kaɗeeɗa ruy-ruy ca. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Yeesu Heɗ ɓoo hotta yaay ɓi kuɓka, yeem misikka ɗe lool, a woosa ɗe ne : « Kina fuɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>A reɓpa, a degga yaah ŋ jaata, ƴaaɓa gaalɗohee wa tufukka, a woosa ne : « Ŋ woo ne : Kurka ƴaari. » <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Kaanɗa kurukka ɓooffa, a jombeeɗa. Yeesu wikka ɗe yaay ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Ɓooɓa nikee ndaam jen feyuusa, ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh, ɓa woyeeɗa an : « Woosuuɗ yakak hayiɗ nga ɓoo. Kooh hayiɗ hirpe ɓooɓiŋ ɗe. » <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa laamtoheeɗa woo keem ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu ŋ kur caŋ Yudee jen na ca wilee wa.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahya woosiɗ ɓi ɓo' ŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Wa taalubeeciŋ <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> naandsuk ɗe in ci Yeesu na tume jen, Yahya ɓeeɗukka kanak nga ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>a woossa ɓa ŋ Yeesu Heɗ ɓoo, ne ɓa meekis ɗe andi a yi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> joy hay wala ɓa joy sek ɓo' wiiriis. <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Ɓa kaɗta ŋ Yeesu ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Yahya Ɓoktohi a yi woos ɓoo, a woo ne ɓoo meeksaat ɗa andi a fu Mucɗohi Gapohse joy hay wala ɓoo joy sek ɓo' wiiriis. » <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Weem, raak, Yeesu wirɗeeɗa ɓo' laayiɗ, kosaayiɗ na jiriɗ na fuuliɗ ; a aañeeɗa <char style="w">jiini</char> ŋ ɓi ɓo'. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat ɗu woya Yahya ini ɗu hot te ɗu kerahhaa : Fuuliɗ ci ɓii hot, lafañ ci ɓii tiind moɗoɗ, ɓi raak <char style="w">kosaay ki na oɓse faan</char> ɓii wir, ɗikiɗ ci ɓii kerah, kaaniɗ ci ɓii hulit te ñakiɗ ci ɓii woyu <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>A sumaat, ɓoyi moosanɗi kurkoh ŋ kosi a kos sagu tumohaaɗ ciŋ ngo. »<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyiɗ na ɓooɓa, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yahya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Wa taalubeeca Yahya woosee coot, Yeesu woyeeɗa na mboolnda ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yahya ; a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu kee ye marka ŋ nduufa ? Caaɓsi yino-kongi puuɗsi na giyaange e ? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Ŋ liiɓɗaa ! Kon ɗu kee ɓa marka ? Ɓo' ɓekkiɗ kulɓa moɗiɗ e ? Ŋ hot ɓooɓi na ɓekke kulɓa moɗiɗ te ɓa ñame neɓiɗ, na nike ŋ kahan ciŋ buur ci. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Moo ɗu kee ɓa marka ? Woosuuɗ e ? Ee, ñam na woyee ɗu wa, a yi uup sah woosuuɗ. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Yahya Ɓoktohi a yi Kooh woyee ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">“ Ŋ hey woose ɓo', a adug ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">ne a haɓɗiɗ ɗa waasi. ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malasi 3:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Yeesu degiɗta ɓa nga ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ŋ ɓooɓi rimuk jen ali ɓo' uupɗi Yahya Ɓoktohi nga. Waaye ɓoyi uup ƴissuut ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh a yi uup ɗe yak.<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Ɓooɓi kerah Yahya Ɓoktohi jen, po <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> ci sah, ɓa ambiɗ ne Kooh yurhiɗ, ɓa teyɗukka ɓoktiŋ Yahya. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Waaye <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ci na jangɗohoh ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> teyɗukɗi ini Kooh waaɗɗiɗ ɓooɓi, ɓa teyɗukɗi ɓoktiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Moo, ŋ min mandtiɗkoh ɓooɓi woti na ye ? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Ɓa mand na komaakci ɓoof ŋ ɗiski na toonohse ŋ kur ki, ɓa woytiɗohee ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">“ Ɓoo tipɗiɗ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"Ɓoo tipɗiɗ ɗu" : ndii, ini fiisu ŋ gerek, wa "Ɓoo mbiiɓɗiɗ ɗu".</char></note> ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">ɗu mbecɗi ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">ɓoo ƴeekɗiɗ ɗu ƴeek ruy,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">ɗu fuɗɗi. ”<verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Laam Yahya Ɓoktohi hayiɗ, a ñameeɗi ina ɓooɓa na ñame, a aneeɗi biiñ ; ɗu na woye ne a raak jiini. <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/><char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayiɗ, a na ñamee ñam, a ane ; ɗu na woye ne : “ A ñamoh, a anoh biiñ, te a nawle juuti'oh ci na bakaaɗoh ci. ” <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Waaye liiɓohaaɗi moɗiɗi puloh ŋ Kooh na teeɓohe yurhiŋ wa, taamboh ŋ ɓooɓi Kooh ona jen. »<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ kahan Simong <char style="tl">Farisena</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Wa raakka mbeh, ƴaar ɓaah ŋ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca ɓeeɗukka Yeesu ne a ñama ŋ kahan ce, Yeesu kaɗta, ɓooffa, a raɗissa kot caŋ ɗe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">raɗis kot </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ƴenguk, yip yaah, ñame, wa nikee mbaah ŋ jamanoonaam.</char></note>, a ñameeɗa na ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Ɓitiɓ mbalayoh gen kur ka kerahha ne Yeesu a yaa ŋ kahan <char style="tl">Farisena</char>, a kaɗta na <char style="tl">buteel</char> <char style="tl">albaatar</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">albaatar</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa atoh moɗiɗ, yooɓiɗ pestu, wa na etohse haɓɗoha tumoha laackoloñ.</char></note> riifiɗ na laackoloñ eeñiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>A nikka ŋ kot ciŋ Yeesu, a fuɗeeɗa ; a cammba ca iiri'iɗ na muhun, a mooseeɗa ca na findiŋ ɗe, a fooneeɗa ca, a laackoloñeeɗa ca. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Wa <char style="tl">Farisena</char> hot ineem, a woosa ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : « Ƴaari nikee woosuuɗ ɗah, a heen inhe ne ɓoyi na laalee ɗe bakaaɗoh. »<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Ŋ ineem Yeesu woosa ne : « Simong, raakiɗ ini ŋ waaɗ ɗa woo. » A loffa ne « Ee, Jangɗohohi, woya. » <verse eid="LUK 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « A nikee ƴaar, ɓo' kanak joyya ɗe wirind kombot ; yinoori joyee ɗe eɗ <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char> teemet-yatuus (500), yi tas joyya ɗe eɗ <char style="tl">dinaar</char> ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50). <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Ɓa kanak jen, ɓa minɗi ɗe ca wirind, a ɗaassa ɓa ca. Woo so yi uupan ɗe waaɗ nga ɓa. » <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>A loffa ɗe ne : « Ŋ liiɓiɗ ne a yi ɗaasu kombot ki uup laay. » Yeesu woosa ɗe : « Ee, fu woo keeh. »<verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Ƴutta, a heelukka ɓitɓa, a woosa Simong ne : « Fu hotiɗ ɓitɓii e ? Ŋ aasiɗ kahan fu, te fu onɗi so masuɓ ne ŋ naawis kot ciŋ ngo, waaye a iiri'ɗiɗ ca na muhun ciŋ ɗe, a moossa ca na findiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Fu foonɗi so, waaye ina ŋ reyoh po wi a yi fooneeɗa ŋ kot ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Fu diwɗi hafiŋ ngo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nga ɓa, fu raakeen hanhe yakak ɗah, fu foon ɗe, naawis kot ciŋ ɗe, fu tumiɗ ɗe diw ŋ hafiŋ ɗe.</char></note> waaye a laackoloñiɗ kot ciŋ ngo. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Mi na woyee ɗa ne a ɗaasu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗe laayiɗ ci, weɗi tah a teeɓohha waaɗoh hend an. Waaye ɓoyi ɗaasu ƴissuut na waaɗee waaɗ ƴissuut. » <verse eid="LUK 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Ƴutta Yeesu woosa ɓitɓa ne : « Fu ɗaasuuɗ bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Ɓooɓa ɓinooɓa a ñamee na ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa ne : « Moo, ƴaari a yi ɓa po a ɗaasohee bakaaɗ ci ? » <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Waaye Yeesu woosa ɓitɓa ne : « Kosi fu kos tosiɗ ɗa, kaɗa ŋ jam. »<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Sokohi na tisohiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Wa in ceem coot, Yeesu kaɗeeɗa ŋ kur ca yakak ca na ca ƴin ca, a woyeeɗa ɓooɓa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wi kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh ; a hunee na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12). <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>A nameen hun na ɓi ɓitiɓ ɓi a saɓsohee na <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniica</char> ambee ɓa, na ɓa a wirɗee ŋ kosaay caŋ ɓa. Findi Mari yi na woyse Mari Makdala yi a saɓsohee na jiini yasna-kanak, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>na Saan ɓiti Kuusa, ƴaara nikee daga meeɗ taambkoh raak-raakaŋ Herod, na Susaan na ɓi wiiriis laayiɗ. Ɓeem ɓeɗ ɓaatɗohee Yeesu na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ciŋ ɗe ŋ in ca ɓa raak.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Ɓooɓa puloheeɗa ɗisik nu ɗisik, ɓa hayeeɗa ŋ Yeesu. Wa mboolnda laay, a woosa ɓa andiinii : <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>« A nikee guuroh, a kaɗta soka. Wi a soke, a saaweeɗa tisohi, in nga hennda ŋ waasi ŋ ɗooƴ yohni, ɓooɓi daksoheeɗa ca, sel ci hayya ñammbaa. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Raakka ci keen ŋ keheƴ raakiɗ atoh ; wi ca paar, maañɗi ca suyya laam ɗiska iiri'eeɗi. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Cum keennda ŋ ñaaɓaaɓ ci, ca paarandoosa na ca, ñaaɓaaɓ ca ammba ca. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Cinooca hennda ŋ kehƴa baahɗa, ca paarra, wa ca yak ca eɗohha ini ree waas teemet ŋ ina soku. » Teemb ndeem, Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu raak nof kerhoha ɗah, a kerhaat. »<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe meekissa ɗe ini andiineem tokis. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu onuuɗ ne ɗu inah in ci ɗasɗukiɗ ciŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh, waaye ɓinooɓi na woyse in ŋ andiin ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">“ Ɓa markee baahiɗ, ɓa minuu hot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">ɓa sikɗuke, ɓa minuu inah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Esayi 6:9</ref></char></note> ”<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ andiinii, wa tokis inii : Tisohi weɗ woo kiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Ɓum ɓeɗ ŋ sero waasi, ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe woo kiŋ Kooh, waaye Seytaani hay a nihisa ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa ; a hondoh ɓa kos ne ɓa mucɗu. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Ɓum ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ kehƴi raak atoh ci ; ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe Woo ki, te ɓa teyɗuka na keeñ soosiɗ, waaye ɓa na raakeeɗi niir, laam kosi ɓa kos na maañeeɗi, miskiɗ ci hayya ɗah, ɓa faɗ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Ɓum ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ ñaaɓaaɓ ci, ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa teyɗuka, waaye liiɓsiɗoh ci na raak-raak ci na neɓiɗ ciŋ Adina amb ɓa po ɓa raakuu rim ruundiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Ɓinooɓi ɓeɗ paaroh ŋ ini saawu ŋ kehƴi baahiɗi, ɓeɗ ɓi na kerhe Woo ki, ɓa teyɗuka na keeñ moɗiɗ ! Ɓa amba ndengiɗ po ɓa raak rim.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laampaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>Ali ɓo' na fuuɗeeɗi laampa, a kuna na kanoh wala a ɗaaka ŋ ooɓ fiƴaang, waaye a na degee wa ŋ degohaaniŋ wa ne ɓo' nu aas ɗah, wa ñiinɗiɗ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Laam, ini ɗemb jen hey hotke, ini ɗasɗu jen hey inhasse noh cong. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Mbaa sikɗukaat na nof laam ɓoyi raak hey ɓaatse, te ɓoyi raakɗi, ini a liiɓ ne a raakiɗa, hey ɓayse. »<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">A ɓinde yaay ɓi Yeesu na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Weɗ yaay ɓi Yeesu na taambɗoh ciŋ Yeesu hayoh ɗe marke, waaye ɓa minɗi ree nga ɗe sagu mboolnda. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>A woyuusa ne : « Yaay ɗu na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa ɓa ɗaa ŋ finhoora te ɓa waaɗiɗ ɗa hot. » <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>A loffa ne : « Yaay ɓoo na taambɗoh ciŋ ngo ɓeɗ ɓooɓi na sikɗukee woo kiŋ Kooh te ɓa taambɗee wa. »<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tufkiɗiɗ puuɗsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu aassa ŋ gaal, a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓoo kaɗaat ŋ ɓaka faahaŋ cookma. » Ɓa kaɗta. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Wa ɓa joowe, Yeesu neehha. Ɗekka po puuɗis yakak raakka ɓa ŋ cookma, gaala riiffa na masuɓ po wa heeɗa diige. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe reɓpa nga ɗe ɓa yuneeɗa ɗe an : « Kilifaani ! Kilifaani, ɓoo ɓii kaan de' ! » Yeesu yunukka, a ngassa puuɗsa na ginaah ca yakiɗ ca, ca yeeɓukka, ɗiska eennda. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Wa nde kosi ɗu kos ? » Ɓa feyuusa ; ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : « Ƴaarii joy nik ɓa, po a woyee na puuɗsi na masmi ca kerhiɗee ɗe ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:8">Sabuur 65:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:10">89:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:23-32">107:23-32</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ɓoyi jiini amb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Ŋ pulohaŋ ɓa Galile, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe taalndiɗta, ɓa kaɗeeɗa ŋ cookma po ɓa serra ŋ kur caŋ Geraas ca ; kur ceem yurhiɗkoh na Galile. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Wa Yeesu yipuk, ƴaar gen kur ka kaɗta coha na ɗe, ca jiini ambee ɗe. A gijeen ɓekuk kulɓa te a nikeeɗi ŋ kahan, a genee ruy-ruy ca. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>A hotta Yeesu, a ƴekka ŋ fikiice a leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka, a woosa ne : « Yeesu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka, fu nar ye nga so ? Mi yii kiim ɗa ne fu tumuu so miskiɗ. »<verse eid="LUK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Laam raak Yeesu woyiɗ jiiniica na hoolaaɗiika ca hoolaaɗi, ne ca pulaat ŋ ƴaara. Ca meeɗeen ɗe amb waas laayiɗ. Ca ammba ɗe ɗah, ɓa tok yaah ci na kot ciŋ ɗe na ceen, ɓa niiɗee ɗe. Hondohɗi a nguɗ ceen ceem te jiiniica hiir ɗe ne a kaɗ ɗaaya ŋ nduufa.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yeesu meekissa ƴaara ne : « Fu teeku na ? » A loffa ne « Ŋ teeku <char style="tl">Lesiyong</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">lesiyong</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ŋ ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> ɗeɓgaan, weɗ soldaar junni junni.</char></note>. » Ca jiini gooñ nikee na ɗe, weɗ tah a woosa ineem. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Jiiniica kiimeeɗa Yeesu ne a kinaat ca tuuƴ ŋ nunga nooɗɗa ca na hee torhiɗohse. <verse eid="LUK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Raak ŋ serooɓa, ŋ tangoora, gat mbaam-huk yakak nikee ñameeɗa nga. Jiiniica kiimmba Yeesu keeh-keeh ne a on ca ca aas ŋ mbaam ca ; a onnda ca ineem. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Ca pulla ŋ ƴaara, ca aassa ŋ mbaam ca, gata jen giirukka, hunnda na mbartala, faɗsukka ŋ cookma, mbaam ca lappa nga.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Wa ɓooɓa niiɗee mbaam ca hot ineem, ɓa nuppa, ɓa kaɗtaa woya ŋ kur-taaha na kur ca ƴin ca. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Ɓooɓa hayeeɗa marke ini raak. Ɓa reesa, ɓa raakka ƴaara jiiniica puloh nga ɗe ɓoofiɗ ŋ kot ciŋ Yeesu, ɓekkiɗ kulɓa, a hunnda na sagooniŋ ɗe ; ɓa neƴƴohha. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Ɓooɓa maasohee naandsukka ɓa findi ƴaara saɓsohohu na jiiniica. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Ɓeɗ ɓa genee Geraas jen kiimmba Yeesu ne a pul ndaam laam ɓa neƴƴoheen lool. Yeesu rappa ŋ gaala ne a coot, <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>ƴaara kiimmba ɗe ne : « On ndo ŋ hun na ɗa. » Waaye Yeesu gurdiɗta ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>« Haada kahan ɗu, fu naandsuka ini Kooh tumiɗ ɗa jen. » Ƴaara haadda, a naandsukka ɓi kur ka jen ina Yeesu haɓɗiɗ ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu hultiɗiɗ kuɓkiŋ Jayrus ɓitɓi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Wa a dokuk Galile, Yeesu raak ɓo' laayiɗ sekeeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Ɗekka po ƴaara na woyse Jayrus, ya adgohee <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char> hayya nga ɗe. A ƴekka ŋ fikiice a kiimmba ɗe ne a kaɗ kahan ce, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>laam raak kuɓkaŋ ɗe cafƴa heeɗa kaane te a raakee ɗe yino, tel kuɓkeem yii ŋ kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis kanak ciŋ ɗe (12).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Wa Yeesu kaɗee nga, mboolnda ɗiifɗoheeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Ŋ ɗooƴ mboolnda, ɓitiɓ nikeen nga, ñif miŋ ɗe meeɗ meeɗ aamuk, a tumiɗ na kosaay keem kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis kanak (12), [a tumeen ina a raake jen ŋ paƴoh ca,] te ali ɓo' mineeɗi ɗe wiriɗ. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>A lahha Yeesu finho, a laalla lecmiŋ kulɓaakiŋ ɗe ; ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, ñif maŋ ɗe aamkisɗi. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yeesu meeksohha ne : « Ya ɓa laal lo ? » Yaa nu nga ɗah taaskeeɗa. Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Moo Kilifaani, ɓooɓi wil ɗa wil te ɓa ɗii ɗiifkoheeɗa ! » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>« Ee ! Waaye raakiɗ doolndi puloh nga so, weɗ tah ŋ inahha ne raakiɗ ɓoyi laal lo. »<verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Wa ɓitɓa inah ne a yeguuɗ, a saakɗoheeɗa, a ƴekka ŋ kot ciŋ Yeesu, a naandsukka ŋ fiki ɓooɓa jen, ini tah a laalla Yeesu na findi a wiroh ŋ ɗiska ɗiska. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kosi fu kos wirɗiɗ ɗa, kaɗa moɗoɗ ɓitɓi. »<verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Wa Yeesu woyee, ɓo' pulohha kahan Jayrus, a woosa yeem ne : « Wa etohisɗi fu yaaɓɗe Jangɗohohi, kuɓkiŋ ɗa kaaniɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Yeesu kerahha nga a woosa Jayrus ne : « Kina neƴƴoh, kosa rek, kuɓkiŋ ɗa hey muce. »<verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Wa Yeesu ree kahna, ɗal Piyeer na Saaŋ na Saak na baab ɓi kuɓki na yaay ɓa ɗah, a faɗɗi ali ɓo' ne a aas na ɗe nga. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ɓooɓa jen nikee rooyeeɗa kuɓka, Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Kanaat rooy, a kaanɗi, a na neehe. » <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Ɓa njembteeɗa ɗe laam ɓa inheen ne a kaaniɗ. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Yeesu ammba yaahiŋ kuɓka, a woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Kuɓu kurka ! » <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>A hulitta, a jaarra kuruk. Yeesu woosa ɓa ne ɓa onaat kuɓka a ñam. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Yaay ɓa na baab ɓa feyuusa waaye Yeesu woosa ɓa ne ɓa kinaata woo ali ɓo'.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tuuƴiɗ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu cohɗohha <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12), a onnda ɓa hatil na min-min aañoha <char style="w">jiini</char> nu nik na wirɗoha kosaay ci. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Ƴutta a tuuƴca ɓa ne ɓa yegɗoha Nguuriŋ-Kooh te ɓa wiriɗ kosaayiɗ ci. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu kaɗee ɗah, kinaat ɓayndoh ali in, findi ndooɗ, saak, kañam wala kopor, te kinaat ɓay kulɓa kanak. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ɗu aas kahan, ɓa teyɗuk ɗu ɗah, nikaat nga po mbaɗna ɗu cootan. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Waaye ɗu kaɗ kur, ɗu teyɗukuuɗi nga ɗah, paangaat kot ciŋ ɗu, ɗu pul, ɓa inah ne ɓa heya markiɗe na Kooh. » <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Ɓa kaɗta, ɓa aaseeɗa ŋ kur na kur ; ɗisik nu ɗisik, ɓa woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ɓa wirɗeeɗa kosaayiɗ ca.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Herod, ya adgohee Galile, wa a kerah in ca raakee jen, a feyuusa, laam raakiɗ ɓi woyee ne : « A <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> a yi hultiɗu. » <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Ɓum woyeeɗa ne : « A woosuuɗi <char style="w">Ilyas</char> a yi hayis. » Ɓinooɓi woyeeɗa ne : « A woosuuɗ ŋ woosuuɗ ca ɗeɓgaan a yi na pesisse. » <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Waaye Herod woosa ne : « Yahya Ɓoktohi, ñam nguɗɗuk hafiŋ ɗe ; kon ƴaari mi na kerhe na haɓɗe in cii, a joy nik ɓa ? » A waakeeɗa ɗiski a hotohan Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓaataŋ mbuuruuca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Wa <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca puloh ɗisik ca ɓa tuuƴse, ɓa naandsukka Yeesu in ca ɓa haɓiɗ jen. Ƴutta, a ɓayya ɓa ŋ kur ka na woyse Betsayda, a ɗaayya na ɓa nga. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Waaye ɓooɓa yegga ineem, ɓa raakka ɗe nga. Yeesu teyɗukka ɓa, a woyeeɗa na ɓa ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh, a wiriɗta kosaayiɗ ca.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Wa noha na niine, <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci reɓpa ŋ Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ndii bilaf. Woya ɓooɓii ɓa kaɗ ŋ kur ci reɓ ndii, ɓa waaka ɗiski ɓa nikan na ini ɓa ñaman. » <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Waaye a loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu, eɗaat ɓa ini ɓaa hee ñame. » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo raak mbuuru yatuus na cuurund kanak dong ndii, te ɓoo minɗi ɓa kaɗ romɗa kañam jen ! » <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Ƴaar ca ŋ ɗiska ɗaleen ree junni-yatuus (5000) wala ini uupa. A woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Woyaat ɓa, ɓa ɓoof ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50-50). » <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Ɓa haɓiɗta ini a woo, ɓa ɓoofiɗta ɓooɓa jen. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>A ɓayya mbuuru ca yatuus ca na cuurund ca kanak ca, a taaknukka ŋ Eel ci, a gidimmba Kooh, a nguɗsohha ca, a eɗta taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne ɓa paysoh mboolnda ca. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Ɓooɓa jen ñammba po ɓa kappa. Ɓa tummba tasɗohiica ŋ pañe ndaŋkiyaah na kanak (12).<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu a yi ɓa ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu ɗaayya, a kiimeeɗa Kooh ; taalubeeciŋ ɗe nikee na ɗe, a meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi na woye ne ñam ɓa ? » <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓum na woye ne a fu Yahya Ɓoktohi, ɓinooɓi woyee ne a fu Ilyas, raakka ɓi na woye ne fu woosuuɗ wiiriis, ɓaah ŋ ɓa maañiɗ ca, fu hulit hulit. » <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Moo ɗu nak ? Ɗu na woye ne a mi ɓa ? » Piyeer loffa ɗe ne : « Ya fu <char style="w" lemma="Mucɗohi Gapohse">Mucɗohi Kooh gapohe</char>. »<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yeesu dennga ɓa baahiɗ ne ɓa kinaata woo ali ɓo'. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> joyiɗ yaaɓ keeh-keeh ŋ yaah ciŋ yakak ci na kilifaaciŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh ciŋ wa, ɓa hey ɗe sange, a apu te a hultiɗu ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh. »<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>A woyissa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu waaɗ hun na so ɗah, a joyɗi liiɓ haf ce te Kooh-nu-wiis ɗah, a deguk kurwaani aa hee daaƴohse, a ñaakiɗ to. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Laam ɓo' nu waaɗ muciɗ kipes kiŋ ɗe ɗah, a heya ñake, waaye ɓo' nu eɗoh kipes kiŋ ɗe saguuso ɗah, a hey wa mucɗe. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Ɓo' raak adinaani jen na in ci nik nga, a han ñak kipes kiŋ ɗe wala a yah haf ce ɗah, wa raakiɗ ɗe winde etoh ?<verse eid="LUK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Ɓo' nu supuk hun na so na woo ciŋ ngo ɗah, Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey ɗe supke inah ne a hayee ŋ kiyak kiŋ ɗe, na wiŋ Baabi na wiŋ malaakaaci hooliɗ ci ɗah. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu inii, te wa keeh, ɓi ɓo' ɓii ŋ ndii, ɓa kaananɗi muk te ɓa hotɗi Nguuriŋ-Kooh. »<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ca kaahay ca hotiɗ Yeesu na ndami nik nga ɗe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Wa degga ini ɗal ree neeh yasna-kaahay ŋ finho woo ceem, Yeesu hunnda na Piyeer na Saaŋ na Saak ; a rappa ŋ tango ne a kiim Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Wa a na kiime, fikiiriŋ ɗe ɓoƴsukohha, kulɓaaciŋ ɗe nikka yaanow tar po ca melciɗeeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Ɗekka po ɓo' kanak woyeeɗa na ɗe, ɓa nikee woosuuɗ, Musaa na Ilyas. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Ɓa siñaarɗeeɗa siñaariɗ, ɓa woyeeɗa na Yeesu ŋ kurkohiŋ ɗe ŋ Adina wi ɗiindohan ini ɓay ɗe, te wa joyya raakoh Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Piyeer na huntoh ciŋ ɗe nikee neeheeɗa neeh nooɗiɗ. Ɓa yunukka, ɓa hotta siñaariŋ ndamiŋ Yeesu na ɓooɓa kanak ca jombee na ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Wa ƴaaɓa kanak ca na coote, Piyeer woosa Yeesu ne : « Kilifaani, wa baahiɗ ne ɓoo nik ndii, ɓoo haɓiɗ ɗiip kaahay, winoori nik wiŋ ɗa, winni nik wiŋ Musaa, wi tas nik wiŋ Ilyas. » Waaye a inheeɗi ini a woye.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Wa a na woye, eel saanginnda ɓa, taalubeeci neƴƴohha wa eela muur ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Ŋ ɗooƴ eela raakka hoosoora woo ne : « Yii, a yi kuɓkiŋ ngo ŋ tan, sikɗukaat a yi. » <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Wa hoosoora kerhuk, ɓa hotta Yeesu kiik ce njong. Ŋ neeh caam, ɓa naandsukɗi ali ɓo' ini ɓa hot, ɓa ɗekkaa teɗ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ njaanja jiini ambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Wa Kooh wiis, ɓa ruhussa tangoora weɗ mboolo yakak hayoh cohe na Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Wa raakeen ƴaar nga a woyeeɗa ŋ ɗafka an : « Jangɗohohi mi yii kiim ɗa, markiɗ to kuɓkiŋ ngo, a yi dong ŋ raak ; <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>na ɗekee ɗek po jiini amb ɗe, a leehke, a walañke, nguɓiŋ ɗe soñe ; a na faɗseeɗi ɗe te a pooksohɗi faaniŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Ŋ nakiɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗa ne ɓa saɓsoh ɗe na ɗe, waaye ɓa minɗaa. » <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Ɗu ɓi ɓooɓi woti-woti e ɗu kosaaɗi, ɗu yahukka, ŋ nikan nik na ɗu ŋ muñɗee ɗu po kiɗa ? » A woosa ƴaara ne : « Ɓaya kuɓkiŋ ɗa ndii. » <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Wa kuɓka na reɓe, jiinnda folla ɗe, a walañkeeɗa. Yeesu ngassa jiinnda, a wiriɗta kuɓka, a wikka ɗe baabiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Ɓooɓa jen feyuusa ŋ yakkiŋ Kooh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ɓo' nu nga feyuusa ŋ in ca Yeesu haɓɗe jen. Weɗi a woyoh taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>« Sikɗukaat baahiɗ ini maa hee ɗu woye : Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey degse ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓooɓi. » <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Waaye taalubeeciŋ ɗe inheeɗi ini woo keem tokis, ɓa ɗasɗohseen ini wa waaɗ woo, te ɓa kaañeeɗi ɗe wa meekis.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ya ɓa uup yak ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Taasoh raakka ŋ harmban taalubeeciŋ Yeesu, raak ɓa markee yi uup nik kilifa nga ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yeesu inahha ini nik ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa, a ɓayya komaaki ƴin a tufkiɗta ɗe ŋ serooce, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓo' nu teyɗuk njaanjii saguuso ɗah, a teyɗuk ko ; te ɓo' nu teyɗuk ko ɗah, fu teyɗuk Kooh yi woos so ; laam, ɓoyi uup ƴissuut nga ɗu jen, a yi uup yak. »<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Saaŋ woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ɓoo hotiɗ ɓo' aañeeɗa jiiniici ŋ tiikiŋ ɗa, te a ɓaahɗi nga ɓoo, tahha po ɓoo woosa ɗe ne a kinaata tumis. » <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Kinaat ɗe wa sangoh, ɓo' nu sangɗi ɗu ɗah, a hun na ɗu. »<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Jamanoona Yeesu joy rapɗohu Eel ci reɓeeɗa, heliŋ ɗe jen nikka ngaŋ kaɗ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>A woossa ɓi ɓo' ne ɓa adug ɗe ŋ kur ngaŋ caŋ ɓi Samari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:52 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓi Samari na Yawuut ca kerhiɗoheeɗi ; ɓa heeftiɗohee heeftiɗoh, ɓa sangtiɗohha.</char></note>, ne ɓa waakiɗ ɗe dal nga, <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>waaye ɓi kur ka sannga sagu ina Yeesu ɓay waasa kaɗ Yerusalem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓi Samari teyɗukeeɗi ne Yerusalem, weɗ ɗiski joy <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkohu</char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe Saak na Saaŋ hotta ŋ ineem ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu waaɗiɗ ne ɓoo nak yongkaah, wa puloh eel ci wa ɗumbiɗ ɓa e ? » <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yeesu yurhiɗkohha na ɓa, a ngassa ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>A na huntoh ciŋ ɗe kaɗta kur wiiriis.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Findi taalube joy mand</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Wa ɓa kaɗee, raakka ƴaara woo Yeesu ŋ waasa ne : « Kilifaani, ɗisik nu fu kaɗ ɗah, ŋ hey ɗa ñaakɗe. » <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓaakoɓ ci raakiɗ nung, sel ci raakiɗ taar, waaye Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi raakɗi sah ɗiski a na hee iɗsiɗkohe. » <verse eid="LUK 9:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yeesu woosa ƴaar wiiriis ne : « Ñaakiɗ to. » Waaye ƴaara loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, on ndo paaɗ, ŋ taambkoh yaɓkooriŋ ngo po a kaan, ŋ uumb ɗe. » <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Faɗa kaaniɗ ci ɓa uumb kaaniɗ ciŋ ɓa te fu kaɗ yegɗoha Nguuriŋ-Kooh. » <verse eid="LUK 9:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Raakka ƴaara nam ɗe woo ne : « Kilifaani ŋ hey ɗa ñaakɗe, waaye on ndo ŋ kaɗ aska ɓi kahan ndo paaɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Nguuriŋ-Kooh etohɗi ɓoyi na guure heelke. »<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu tuuƴiɗ taalube ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na taalube kanak (72)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Wa in ceem coot, Yeesu Heɗi kooɗissa taalube ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na taalube kanak (72), a tuuƴca ɓa kanak kanak ŋ kur ca a joyee kaɗoh jen ne ɓa adug ɗe nga. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Yohni laaɓiɗ waaye nguɗoh ci laayɗi. Kon kiimaat Heɗ yohni a woosoh ɓi pangkoh, ɓa nguɗ yohni. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Kaɗaat, mi yii tuuƴ ɗu findi buul mbaal ŋ ɗooƴ gat ɓaakoɓ. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Kaɗaat yaah ɓarang ; kinaat ɓayndoh kopor, saak mbaa ñafaɗ te ŋ waasi, kinaat tufuk ne ɗu kañɗoh.<verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Ɗu aasee kahan ɗah, kocaat woo ne : “ Jam raakaat ŋ kahnii. ” <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Ɓo' jam nik nga ɗah, jameem hey nike na ɗe ; a raakɗi nga ɗah, wa dokuk nga ɗu. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Tasaat ŋ kahneem, ɗu ñamee, ɗu anee, in nu ɓa eɗ ɗu ɗah, laam pangkoh joyiɗ wirndu. Kinaat tooruk ŋ kahan na kahan. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Kur nu ɗu aasoh, ɓooɓa nga teyɗuk ɗu ɗah, in nu ɓa eɗ ɗu ɗah, ñamaat weɗi. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Wirɗaat kosaayiɗ ca nik nga te ɗu woo ɓooɓa ne : “ Nguuriŋ-Kooh reɓiɗ ɗu. ”<verse eid="LUK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Waaye ɗu aas kur, ɓooɓa nik nga teyɗukɗi ɗu ɗah, pulaat po ŋ mbeeddaaca, ɗu woo ɓa ne : <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>“ Ɓoo ɓii faris merhey mi nik ŋ kot ciŋ ɓoo nga ɗu, waaye inhaat ne Nguuriŋ-Kooh reɓiɗ. ” <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu ne mbehi Kooh atte'ohan ɓooɓi, e ɓi kur keem uupan miskiɗ ɓi Sodom.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-38">Camba 19:1-38</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>Mas ɗu ɓi gen Korasin na Betsayda. Keemaan ci tumu ŋ kur ciŋ ɗu, ca tumseen ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Tiir">Tiir na Sidoon</char> ɗah, ɓooɓa gen nga ca heen ɓoƴsohe tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa maañ. Ɓa ɓekuk daah ɓa ɓoof ŋ wet ne ɓa teeɓoha. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Ineem weɗ tah po mbehi Kooh atte'ohan ɓooɓi, e ɗu na hee uupee miskiɗ ɓi Tiir na ɓi Sidoon. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Te ɗu ɓi gen Kapernawum, ɗu liiɓiɗ ne Kooh hey ɗu rapɗe po ŋ Eel ci e ? Muk ! A hey ɗu ruhsiɗe po ŋ kaaniɗ ca. » <verse eid="LUK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Ɓo' nu sikɗuk ɗu ɗah, a sikɗuk ko ; te ɓo' nu teyɗukɗi ɗu ɗah, a teyɗukɗi so. Ɓo' nu teyɗukɗi so ɗah, a teyɗukɗi Yi woos so. »<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Wa taalubeeca ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kanak na kanak ca hay, ɓa hayya neɓuuɗ, ɓa woosa Yeesu ne : « Kilifaani, <char style="w" lemma="jiini">jiiniici</char> sah, ca tumiɗ ini ɓoo woo sagu tiikiŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ hotiɗ Seytaani keenohha Eel ci findi meleñ. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Sikɗukaat, ŋ oniɗ ɗu ne ɗu min tiind ŋ ɗafuk iiñ ci na ndangal ci, te ɗu min Seytaani, sangiɗiŋ ɓoo, na hatiliŋ ɗe jen po tus minɗanɗi ɗu in. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Waaye kinaat neɓu ŋ ini jiiniici kerhiɗ ɗu, neɓsaat ŋ ini tiik ciŋ ɗu fiisu ŋ Eel ci. »<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Teemb ndeem <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> sumɗukohha Yeesu keeh-keeh, a woosa ne : « Mi yii corkiɗ ɗa Baab, fu yi Heɗ Eel ci na kehƴi, ŋ ini fu ɗasɗoh heɗ haf ci na ñaañiɗ ci in cii, fu teeɓpa ca komaakci. Ee Baab, mi yii corkiɗ ɗa. A fu waaɗoha ɗaa ŋ baah kiŋ ɗa. »<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>A woyissa ɓooɓa ne : « Baabiŋ ngo degiɗ in ci jen ŋ yaah ho. Ali ɓo' inahɗi <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓki</char> ɗal Baabi, te ali ɓo' inahɗi Baabi ɗal Kuɓki na ɓooɓi a waaɗ ɓa ɗe teeɓ. » <verse eid="LUK 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Ŋ ineem, Yeesu yurhiɗkohha na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa, ɓeɗ dong ne : « Ɗu neɓɗiɗ ŋ hoti ɗu hot in ci ɗu deg has. <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu ne woosuuɗ laayiɗ na buur laayiɗ waaɗeen hot ini ɗu na hote te ɓa hotɗaa, ɓa waaɗeen kerah ini ɗu na kerhe te ɓa kerahɗaa. »<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ƴaara baahɗa genee Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Raakka ƴaar nga, a nikee jangɗohoh yakak ŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, a kurukka, ne a markisuk Yeesu, a meekissa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, ŋ joy ye haɓiɗ po ŋ min raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe ? » <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Wa ye fiisu ŋ waasiŋ Musaa ? Fu jang ye nga ? » <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Ƴaara loffa ɗe ne « Waaɗa Kooh Heɗ fu na keeñiŋ ɗa jen, na ruuhiŋ ɗa jen, na hatiliŋ ɗa jen, na liiɓiŋ ɗa jen. Waaɗa morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Rohƴiɗi 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewiici 19:18</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Findi fu lofoh, wa ɗaa. Fu tumoh ɗaa ɗah, fu hey pese.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:5">Lewiici 19:5</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Waaye ƴaara waaɗta teeɓoh ne meeksohiŋ ɗe raakiɗ etoh, a woosa ne : « Ee, moo a ɓa morom mbo ? » <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Raakeen ƴaar, a pulohee Yerusalem a kaɗeeɗa Yeriko, a cohha na nguɗndukohoh ci, ɓa wolla ɗe, ɓa laɓpa ɗe po a taskohha kaan, ɓa faɗta ɗe ŋ ɗiska. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Wa hennda ƴaar ɓaah ŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ci lahha ŋ waaseem, a hotta ɗe, a lahha ŋ ɓaka winooraŋ waasi. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Ƴaar ɓaah ŋ <char style="w">Lewiici</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lewiici </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓa ɓaah ŋ cuuɓiŋ Lewi, kuɓkiŋ Yaŋhooɓa. Seeƴkiɗoh ciŋ waasiŋ Musaa ɓaahee ŋ cuuɓeem, waaye ɓi na ɓeeɗkasse "Lewiici", ɓa seeƴkiɗoh haa, ɓa meeɗ ɓaatɗoh seeƴkiɗoh ci.</char></note>, nammba taamb nga, a hotta ƴaari, a nammba tum ɗaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Waaye ƴaar gen Samari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ɓi Samari na Yawuut ca kerhiɗoheeɗi ; ɓa heeftiɗohee heeftiɗoh, ɓa sangtiɗohha. </char></note> ɓaaɓeeɗa, a raakka ƴaari nga, wi a hot ɗe, yeem misikka ɗe lool. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>A reɓpa nga ɗe, a ɓayya diwliin na biiñ, a tumiɗta ɗe ŋ gaañ ciŋ ɗe, a tokka ca na daah. Ƴutta a rapiɗta ɗe ŋ ɗoopti a ɓaye, a ɓayya ɗe ŋ kahna ɓaaɓoh ca na dalohe, a taambkohha ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Na ɓaaɓa, a eɗta ƴaari adgoh kahni kopor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"kopor" : ŋ Fiis ci ndii, gerek woo ne "<char style="tl"><char style="w">dinaar</char></char> kanak".</char></note>, a woosa ɗe ne : “ Taambkohiɗ to ƴaarii, te in nu fu ɓaat nga ɗah, ñam na hee ɗa wa dokne ne ŋ wiirkee ɗah. ” »<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Teemb ndeem Yeesu meekissa ƴaara ne : « Ŋ ini fu liiɓ, ya ɓa ngaŋ ƴaaɓi kaahay ceem, a yi morom ƴaari cohee na nguɗndukohoh ci ? » <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Ƴaara loffa ɗe ne : « A ƴaari a misik. » Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Fu kaɗ ɗah, tuma findiice. »<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marta na Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu na taalubeeciŋ ɗe kaɗeeɗa po ɓa aassa ŋ kur, ɓitiɓ geneen nga teeku Marta, a daliɗta ɗe ŋ kahan ce. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>A raakeen taambɗoh na woyse Mari, yeem ɓooffa ŋ ɗiska na Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu a sikɗukeeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Waaye Marta, e taambkohaŋ hanheeca laayɗa ambee ɗe. A hayya ŋ Yeesu, a woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu hotoh inii na ? Taambɗoh ho faɗiɗ to kiik ko na pangki. Woyaa ɗe a amboh ho book. » <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Marta, Marta, in ci hondoh ɗa raak jam laayiɗ, <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>waaye in yino dong weɗi raak etoh. Mari kooɗ ini uup baah te wa nihsassanɗi nga ɗe. »<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Findi taalubeeciŋ Yeesu joy kiimoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu kiimeeɗa ŋ ɗisik, wa a ƴut, yino ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> jangɗiɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗe findi ɓa joy kiimoh ; nama teeɓ ɓoo findi ɓoo na hee kiimohe. » <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu kiimee Kooh ɗah, woyaat ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">“ Baab,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">tiikiŋ ɗa teyɗuksaat ne wa tiik hooliɗ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Nguuriŋ ɗa hayaat.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Mbeh nu nik ɗah, ona ɓoo kañam ki ɓoo etoh.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Ɗaasa ɓoo bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">laam ɓoo na name nam ɗaas ɓooɓi na ɗale ɓoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">te kina tum po ɓoo jaɗɗu fiir. ” »<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Wa a jangiɗ ɓa ineem, a woyissa ɓa ne : « Wa mand na ɓo' nga ɗu raak nawle, a kaɗ nga ɗe ŋ ndengelnde wek, a woo ɗe ne : “ Naw, ɓand ndo mbuuru kaahay ndeem, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>ŋ raak hanhe ŋ kahan ndo, te ŋ raakɗi kañam ki ŋ eɗan ɗe. ” <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Ŋ ineem ƴaara miniɗ ɗe lof ŋ ɗooƴ kahna ne : “ Faɗ to, ŋ rangkiɗ po ƴutiɗ, te mi na kuɓuuciŋ ngo ɓoo faankiɗ, ŋ minɗi kuruk ne ŋ eɗ ɗa. ” <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Ñam woo ɗu wa, ƴaara hey kurke ne a eɗ ɗe ini a etoh jen. Ali a eɗɗi ɗe sagu niki a nik nawleece, a hey ɗe eɗe sagu kiima a kiimee te a supukɗi nga.<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Ineem weɗ tah mi woo ɗu ne, kiimaat kiim ɗu hey onse, waakaat waak ɗu hey hote, laɓɗaat laɓiɗ ɗu hey rangsiɗasse. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Laam ɓo' nu kiim ɗah, a hey onse, ɓo' nu waak ɗah, a hey hote, te ɓo' nu laɓiɗ ɗah, a hey rangsiɗasse. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>A yinde baab nga ɗu, a yi kuɓkiŋ ɗe kiiman ɗe cuurund, a on ɗe iiñ ? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Mbaa a kiim ɗe wak, a on ɗe ndangal ? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Nik ne ɗu ɓi baahaaɗiici, e ɗu min on kuɓuuciŋ ɗu in baahiɗ ɗah, ŋ woyisɗi ɗa Baab Kooh yiŋ Eel ci. A onanɗi ɓi na kiimee ɗe <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> e ? »<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na wirɗohe hatiliŋ ya ɓa ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Wa raakka mbeh, Yeesu wiriɗta muum, ya <char style="w">jiini</char> ambe. Jiinnda saɓsohu saɓsohu na ɗe, ƴaara jombeeɗa moɗoɗ, mboolnda nikee nga feyuusa. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Waaye raakka ɓa woyee ŋ ɓooɓa ne : « A Belsebul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belsebul </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa ɓaah ŋ tiik ciŋ Seytaani.</char></note>, kilifaaniŋ jiiniici na onee ɗe hatili a na aañohee ca. » <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Raakka ɓi markiskee ɗe, ɓa woyeeɗa ne, a teeɓaat ɓa firndeeni puloh ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Waaye Yeesu inahha liiɓ ciŋ ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓooɓi ɓaah nguur hiñohee ŋ harmban ɓa ɗah, nguureem hey keene, kahan cum keen ŋ ɗafuk cinooci. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Ɗu na woye ne mi na aañe jiiniici na hatiliŋ Belsebul ; nik ne a Seytaani paysukoh ŋ haf ce ɗah, kon nguuriŋ ɗe min na tufkoh ? <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Nik ne mi na aañohe jiiniici hatiliŋ Belsebul ɗah, moo ɓooɓiŋ ɗu na namee ca aañ, ɓa na aañohee ca winde hatil ? Ineem weɗ tah ɓeɗ atte'an ɗu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Waaye nik ne mi na aañohe jiiniici hatiliŋ Kooh ɗah, kon Nguuriŋ-Kooh reyiɗ nga ɗu.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>Ɓo' raakiɗ hatil, ganaayuk, niiɗee kahan ce ɗah, raak-raakiŋ ɗe hey nike ŋ ɗisik wooriɗ. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Waaye ɓoyi uupiɗ ɗe hatil raak ɗe nga laɓ ɗe ɗah, a hey naafee ganaay ci a oolkohe, a ɓay in ci a raakee jen, a paysoh ca. <verse eid="LUK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>Ɓo' nu langɗi na so ɗah, a sangiɗ to ; te ɓo' nu nangɗohohɗi so ɗah, a na pasarohe.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>Jiini, na hoolaaɗiikiŋ ɗe, a faɗta ɓo' ɗah, a na kaɗe ŋ ɓi ɗisik suyiɗ, a waakee ɗiski a iɗsiɗkohan. A hotɗi ɗah, a woo ŋ haf ce ne : “ Mi na hee dokke kahnaŋ ngo ŋ puloh. ” <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>A wiiruk ɗah, a raak kahna paɗuuɗ, haɓɗuuɗ moɗoɗ. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Jaar a kaɗ waaka jiini yasna-kanak ci uup ɗe añaand ; ca kaɗ kahna, ca gen. Ŋ ineem, mirndohaaɗiŋ ɓoyeem weɗ na uupe misik fuuf findi a kocee mand. »<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Wa Yeesu na woyee in ceem, ɓitiɓ ŋ ɗooƴ mboolnda woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Yaayi ɓasil ɗa, a ɓapiɗta ɗa, joyiɗ neɓu. » <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Woya kay ne, ɓooɓi na sikɗuke woo kiŋ Kooh, te ɓa pesohee wa, ɓeɗ neɓu. »<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Findi Yunus na Suleymaan teyɗukohse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Ɓooɓa hayeeɗa, mboolnda ɓaatkeeɗa ; Yeesu woosa ne : « Ɓooɓi woti, ɓeɗ baahaaɗi, ɓa na meeksohe firnde, waaye ɓa eɗsanɗi ali firnde, ɗal wiŋ Yunus. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Findi Yunus ŋ haf ce nikohee firnde nga ɓi Niniw,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 2">Yunus 2</ref></char></note> <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> naman nikoh firnde ɗaa ngaŋ ɓooɓi woti.<verse eid="LUK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Buura ɓitɓaŋ Saba pulohee kur usiɗ ne a sikɗuk liiɓohaaɗa moɗɗaŋ Suleymaan. Te moona raakiɗ ini uup Suleymaan ŋ ndii, weɗ tah mbehi Kooh na hee atte'ohe ɓooɓi, buuri ɓitɓeem hey kurke, a teeɓ ɓooɓi woti ne ɓa raakɗi keeh. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Ŋ mbehaŋ atteena, ɓi Niniw hey kurke, ɓa teeɓ ɓooɓi woti ne ɓa raakɗi keeh, laam wa ɓi Niniw kerah woo kaŋ Yunus, ɓa ɓoƴsoheen pesohaaɗ keeh-keeh<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3">Yunus 3</ref></char></note> ; te moona ini nik ndii, weɗ uup Yunus.<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laampaaniŋ faan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>Ali ɓo' na fuuɗeeɗi laampa po ƴut, a ɗembiɗa ɗisik wiiriis, wala a kuna na kanoh ; a degana kay ŋ degohaaniŋ wa ne ɓo' nu aas ɗah, wa ñiinɗiɗ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Has weɗ laampaaniŋ faan. Hasiŋ ɗa wir ɗah, faaniŋ ɗa jen na nikee ŋ siñaar, waaye hasiŋ ɗa wirɗi ɗah, faaniŋ ɗa jen na nikee ŋ ñuus. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Mbaa ndengɗuka po ñiini nik nga ɗa, nikuu ñuus. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Nik ne faaniŋ ɗa jen ñiiniɗ, te ali ɓak ñuusɗi nga ɗah, wa hey nikee leer po maa wa laampa ñiiniɗ ɗa. »<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woytohiɗ <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca na jangɗohoh ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Wa Yeesu na woye, ƴaar ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca ɓeeɗukka ɗe ne a ñama ŋ kahan ce, Yeesu teyɗukka. Wa ɓa ñame, <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/><char style="tl">Farisena</char> hotta ne Yeesu ɓohñukɗi findi ɓa na ɓohñukohe, a feyuusa nga.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Ɗu ɓi <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci, ɗu mand na ɓooɓi ɓohoñ finhooriŋ kaasi na booli ɓa faɗta ɗooƴi ; ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ciŋ ɗu, ɗu riifiɗ na liiɓohaaɗ rok na añaand. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Naandiɗ ci ! Kooh yi haɓiɗ finhoori, a yi nam haɓiɗ ɗooƴi haa e ? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Sarhohaat in ci nik ŋ ɗooƴi, ɗu hool jameet.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>Mas ɗu ɓi <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci, ɗu ɓii eɗoh sah in ci ƴin ƴin ci ɗu na guure findi naana, pooɓar, na in ci mand ɗaa ndaŋkiyaah nu nik yinoori ; waaye ɗu faɗiɗ ini uupiɗ etoh, weɗ yurah na waaɗ Kooh ; ineem weɗ ɗu joyee tum, te ɗu sang sagankoh ci tas.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lewiici 27:30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:22">Rohƴiɗi 14:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>Mas ɗu ɓi <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci, ɗu waaɗ ne ɗu ɓoofan ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ngaŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci te ɗu kañɗassee yaah kanak ŋ ɗisik ci na toonohse ŋ kur.<verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Mas ɗu ɓi <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ci, ɗu mand na ruy-ruy ci muuƴ, ɓooɓi inhuu dakee nga ca, wa ɓekee ɓa hoolaaɗi. »<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Wa a kerah ineem, ƴaar ɓaah ŋ jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, fu woyoh ɗaa ɗah, fu na namee ɓas ɓoo. » <verse eid="LUK 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yeesu loffa ne : « Na ɗu, ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi, ŋ masɗiɗ ɗu, laam ɗu na raane ɓooɓi in ɓitiɗ te ɗu waaɗɗi ca sah laal na lecem ndukun.<verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Ŋ masɗiɗ ɗu, e ɗu na taɓahe ruy-ruy ciŋ woosuuɗ ci te a caac ciŋ ɗu ap ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Ŋ ineem, ɗu na teeɓohe ne ɗu huniɗ ŋ in ci caac ciŋ ɗu tum. Ee di' ! Ɓeɗ ap woosuuɗ ci, ɗu taɓahee ruy-ruy ciŋ ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Ineem weɗ tah, Kooh, ŋ moɗkiŋ ɗe liiɓohaaɗ, a woosa ne : “ Ŋ hey woosohe woosuuɗ na <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ; ɓum apu, ɓinooɓi tumu miskiɗ. ” <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Te ɓooɓi woti ɓeɗ na hee wirndiɗkasse ñif miŋ woosuuɗ ci aamu ŋ ina amboh ŋ cambohaaɗa poyi. <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>Ŋ Abel po ŋ Sakariya, yi ɓa apoh <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, ŋ harmban <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkohaana</char> na taɓaha. Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, in ceem jen Kooh na hee ca wirnduke ngaŋ ɓooɓi woti.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Mas ɗu ɓi jangɗohoh ciŋ waasi, ɗu ambiɗ caaɓndi joy rangis findi in ciŋ Kooh inhohsan ; ɗu ŋ haf ɗu, ɗu aasɗi te ɗu sangohiɗ ɓooɓi waaɗ aas. »<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Wa Yeesu pul kahna, jangɗohoh caŋ waasi na <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca ayrukka ɗe, ɓa cammba ɗe meekis meeksoh laayiɗ <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>ne ɓa raak yambaah ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Wortukaat naafeeha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Ŋ jamanooneem, ɓo' laayiɗ coheen ne ɓa sikɗuk Yeesu ; mboolnda laayya laay po ɓa daktiɗoheeɗa. Yeesu kockoh ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wortukaat naafeehaakiŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ci, wa mand na lawiir. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>In nu ɗembɗu ɗah, wa hey teeɓohse te in nu ɗemb ɗah, wa hey inhasse. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Kon in nu ɗu woo na wek ɗah, wa hey kerhasse noh cong ; te in nu ɗu moondɗoh ŋ nof ŋ ɗooƴ tuuƴ ɗah, wa hey leehkasse ŋ ɗafuk taɓah ci.<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kooh dong a yi nupaah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu ne, ɗu ɓi nawleeciŋ ngo, kinaat nup ɓi min top dong ngaŋ ap faan. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Ŋ hey ɗu teeɓe ya ɓa a yi ɗu joy nup : Nupaat Kooh yi min ɗu ɓek ŋ yongkaaha, ne ɗu apu po ƴut ɗah. Ee, ñam na woyee ɗu ne, a yi ɗu joy nup. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Sel ƴin yatuus na toonohseeɗi daram kanak dong e ? Moona deey, Kooh alɗi yino nga ca. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Te a inhiɗ sah findi find ciŋ haf ciŋ ɗu hend, mbaa kanaat neƴƴoh ! E ɗu uupiɗ juuk sel njiriñ. »<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Yeesu ɓaatta nga ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu ne, ɓo' nu woo ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ne a ɓaah nga so ɗah, mi yi <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> ŋ hey name woo ŋ fiki malaakaaciŋ Kooh ne ɓoyeem ɓaah nga so. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Waaye ɓo' nu taasuk ko ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ɗah, a hey name taasku ŋ fiki malaakaaciŋ Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Ɓo' nu woo in moɗaaɗi ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi ɗah, a ɗaasnuk ɗah, a hey ɗaasse ; waaye ɓo' nu woo in moɗaaɗi ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ɗah, a ɗaassanɗi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>Ɓa ɓay ɗu ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ca, wala ŋ fiki kilifaaca ne ɓa attee ɗu ɗah, kinaat feyu ŋ findi ɗu joy ngeloh, <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>laam Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, hey ɗu teeɓe ndeem ini ɗu joy woo. »<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Heɗ raak-raaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Ŋ ɗooƴ mboolnda raakka ƴaara woo Yeesu nga ne : « Jangɗohohi, woya taambɗoh ho, ɓoo paysoh lamaahi baab ɓoo faɗiɗ ɓoo. » <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ƴaariŋ ngo, ya ɓa tum mbo atte'ohiŋ ɗu, po ŋ joyya ɗu paysoh raak-raak kiŋ ɗu ? » <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>A woosa ɓooɓa jen ne : « Wortukaat, kinaat waaɗ raak kopor in hend na cakna mboɓ, laam kipes ɓo' nikɗi ŋ ini a raak, ali a raakoh na ! »<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Weɗi Yeesu naandsukoh ɓa andiinii : « A nikee heɗ raak-raak, yohon ciŋ ɗe laaɓpa keeh-keeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>A woosa ŋ haf ce ne : “ Ŋ joy ye haɓiɗ ? Ŋ raakɗi ɗiski ŋ min ɗaak laaɓɗiŋ ngo jen. ” <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>A woyissa ne : “ Seka, inii weɗ mi na hee tume : Mi na hee nihse ndap ciŋ ngo cii, ŋ haɓiɗ ci uup ca yak, ŋ ɓek laaɓɗiŋ ngo nga, na in ciŋ ngo cinooci. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Ƴut ɗah, ŋ woo ŋ haf fo ne : ‘Ƴaari, fu ɗaakkiɗ laayiɗ, pesoha ɓi kiisi kiis. Ɗiski wa nik, iɗsiɗka, fu ñame, fu ane, fu neɓsiɗke.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Waaye Kooh woosa ɗe ne : “ Naandɗi ! Ŋ weki woti, ŋ hey ɓaye kiñin kiŋ ɗa. Moo, ya ɓa raakan ɗaakkiŋ ɗa kotii ? ” » <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>Yeesu ɓaatta nga ne : « Ɓoyi na waake raak-raak a nangɗohe, te a raakɗi ali in ŋ Kooh, a in mand ɗaa rahsan ɗe. »<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oolkoh Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Ƴutta, Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Weɗ tah mi na woyee ɗu ne, kinaat jaahiɗ ŋ kipes ki, ŋ ini ɗu ñaman. Kinaat jaahiɗ ŋ faan ciŋ ɗu, ŋ ini ɗu ɓekkan. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Laam kipes weɗ uup kañam, te faan weɗ nam uupiɗ ɓekkaah njiriñ. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Markaat ngaak-suur ci, ca na sokeeɗi, ca na nguɗeeɗi, ca raakɗi ɗaakkoha, ca raakɗi ndap ; waaye Kooh yii ñamiɗ ca, te a ɗu uupiɗ sel ci njiriñ. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Ya ɓa min jaahiɗ nga ɗu, po a ɓaat wahtu ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗe ? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Nik ne ini ƴissuuteem, ɗu minɗaa ɗah, wa ye tah ɗu feyse ŋ in ci cinooci ?<verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Markaat pos ciŋ paangiici findi ca na mande : Ca na pangkeeɗi, ca na teɗeeɗi ; ñam na woyee ɗu ne Suleymaan sah, na ina a raakee jen, a moosɗi raakoh kulɓa mand na yino nga ca moɗ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Kosi ɗu kos ƴissuutiɗ ! A Kooh na ɓekɗe paangfi ɓekɗi moɗɗeem woti, ali nik ne kim sah, wa miniɗ dohu. Kooh tumiɗ paangfi ineem ɗah, ŋ woyisɗi ɗu, ɗu ɓi uupiɗa njiriñ.<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>Kinaat feyu ŋ ini ɗu ñaman, wala ini ɗu na hee ane. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>E ɓooɓi inahɗi Kooh na gene waak in ceem, waaye Baabiŋ ɗu inhiɗ ne ɗu etohiɗ ca. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Mbaa ɗah, waakaat ini na kaɗɗe Nguuriŋ ɗe fiki, a hey ɗu wa one, a ɓaatiɗ ɗu cinooci nga. »<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>Yeesu ɓaatissa nga ne : « Ɗu ɓi gatiŋ ngo, ɗu laayɗi, waaye kinaat neƴƴoh, wa neɓiɗ Kooh ne a ɓaahndoh ɗu ŋ Nguuriŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Toonaat ini ɗu raak, ɗu eɗa ñakiɗ ci, weɗ ne ɗu waak ɗaakkoha minaaɗi yahuk, ɗu nangɗoh raak-raak ŋ Eel ci ; wa heyɗi reehe, wa roksanɗi, te wa ñuhkanɗi. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Laam ɗiski raak-raakiŋ ɗu nik, keeñ ciŋ ɗu na name nik nga. »<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dokkiŋ Heɗ ɗu raakaat ɗu ƴutiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>Yeesu woyissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Tokɗukaat, te laampaaciŋ ɗu kanaat ƴim. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Mandaat na <char style="w">ñaam</char> ci na seke heɗ ɓa yi joy wiirkoh ŋ kilook, ne a laɓɗee rek ɗah, ɓa rangsiɗ ɗe buntaani. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Wa hey neɓe ŋ ñaam ceem, ne heɗ ɓa hay, raak ɓa sekee ɗe ɗah. Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, a hey ɓekke kulɓa pangkoha, a ɓoofiɗ ñaam ciŋ ɗe, a noɗɗee ɓa, ɓa ñame. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Ali a hay ŋ ndengelnde wek wala ŋ wiisaaɗi, a raak ɓa sekee ɗe ɗah, wa hey neɓe nga ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Inhaat ne, heɗ kahni inheen wahtuuni roki na hee aasohe kahan ce ɗah, a heeɗi ɗe faɗe a aas. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Ɗu, namaat kooɗuk, laam Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hayan ŋ jamanooni ɗu liiɓɗi. »<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Weɗi Piyeer woyoh ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu na woye na ɓoo ŋ andiinii, wala na mboolndi jen ? » <verse eid="LUK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Yeesu Heɗi woosa ɗe ne : « Ya ɓa a yi ñaami woor, te a ñaannja po, heɗ ce hee ɓaaɓe ɗah, a nak ɗe niiɗɗu kahan ce ne a eɗee pangkoh ciŋ ɗe ɓinooɓi kañam ŋ jamanooniŋ wa ? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Ñaameem hey neɓɗe ne heɗ ce hay, raak ɗe tumee ineem findi a nakohee ɗe wa ɗah. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, heɗ ce hey ɗe tufkiɗe, a adgoh in ciŋ ɗe jen.<verse eid="LUK 12:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Waaye ñaameem woo ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne heɗ ce hayɗi paaɗ, a nik nga a laɓee ñaam ci ɓinooɓi, ƴaar na ɓitiɓ, a ñame, a ane, a laaree ɗah, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>heɗ ce hey haye ŋ mbehi a foogɗi, ŋ wahtuuni a inahɗi, a hey ɗe mbugale, a tum ɗe findi ɓooɓi kerhaaɗi-woo ci na tumse.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>Ñaami inah ini heɗ ce waaɗ, a sannga wa tum, te a kooɗkiɗɗi hayiŋ heɗ ce, a hey laɓse ndooɗ laayiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Waaye ñaami inahɗi ini heɗ ce waaɗ, te a tum ini a joy laɓohu ɗah, a hey laɓse ƴissuut. Ɓo' nu eɗu in laayiɗ ɗah, a hey meeksasse in laayiɗ ; ɓoyi uup dengkohu, a yi uupan meeksu. »<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓekoh saɓsukoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>Yeesu woosa ne « Ŋ hayiɗ Adina ne ŋ tum yongkaah nga, te ŋ waaɗeen lool ne wa nik fuuɗuuɗ po ƴutiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Ɗiski wa nik ndii, ŋ joyiɗ hooƴu ŋ miskiɗ keeh-keeh, te ŋ raakanɗi jam po mbaɗna wa nikan. <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Ɗu liiɓiɗ ne ŋ hay ne ŋ ɓay jam ŋ Adina e ? Muk ! Ŋ ɓay saɓsukoh. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Ini camboh woti, ɓo' yatuus nik ŋ fah ɗah, ɓa hey saɓsukohe ; kaahay ci sang kanak ci, kanak ci sang kaahay ci. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Baab sang kuɓu ƴaar, kuɓu ƴaar sang baab ; yaay sang kuɓu ɓitiɓ, kuɓu ɓitiɓ sang yaay ; payum ɓitiɓ sang kilook, kilook sang payum ɓitiɓ. »<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yeesu woyissa mboolnda ne : « Ɗu hotta ngaaɓ ɗah, ɗu na jaare woo ne : “ Wa hey toɓe ” te weɗ na raake. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Sarngi laɓ ɗah, ɗu woo ne : “ Wa hey dohe ” te weɗ na raake. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Naafeehaaci ! Ɗu marak eel ci na kehƴi ɗah, ɗu inah ini na hee raake ; kon ɗu min na inhaaɗi'oh findi Kooh na pangkohe woti-woti ?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>Wa ye tah po ɗu ɗuunnga ini yurhiɗi joy haɓɗu ? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ɓo' ɓayee ɗa waas ɗah, jeema kerhiɗoh na ɗe. Fu tumɗaa ŋ waasi po ɗu ree ngelohaana ɗah, a hey ɗa fase po ŋ atte'ohi, yeem eɗ ɗa alkaateeni, yeem rang ɗa ŋ kasoona. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Ñam na woyee ɗa ne, fu pulohanɗi ndaam feeh fu wirindɗi po ŋ darmi uup ƴissuut ɗah. »<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓoƴsoh kipes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ŋ jamanooneem, ɓi ɓo' naandsukka Yeesu findi Pilaat apoh ɓi ɓo' gen Galile wa ɓa seeƴkee wuu Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ɗu liiɓ ne ɓooɓeem ɓeɗ uupiɗ bakaaɗ ŋ Galile sagu miskiɗi ɓa raak weem e ? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Muk ! Waaye ñam na woyee ɗu ne, ɗu ɓoƴsohɗi kipes ɗah, ɗu hey name boomu jen findiiɓa. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Te ɓooɓa ndaŋkiyaah na yasna-kaahay (18) ca, taɓaha yakka ŋ Silowe keenee nga ɓa, ɓa kaannda, ɗu liiɓ ne ɓeɗ uupee nik bakaaɗoh ŋ Yerusalem jen e ? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Muk ! Waaye ñam na woyee ɗu ne, ɗu ɓoƴsohɗi kipes ɗah, ɗu hey name boomu jen findiiɓa. »<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidgi na rimeeɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Yeesu naandsukka ɓa andiinii : « Ƴaar raakeen ndun ŋ yohon ce. Wa a kaɗa ɓeena, a raakɗi ali rim nga. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>A woosa ƴaara na pangkiɗee ɗe ŋ yohna ne : “ Kiis kaahay ceɗɗi, ŋ hayya ɓeene ŋ ndunii ɗah, ŋ raakuu rim nga. Ƴoɓaa ! Wa joyɗi naaf ɗiski ŋ ɓarang ɓarang. ” <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Ƴaara loffa ɗe ne : “ Kilifaani, faɗaa kiis kii ; ŋ hey bongɗe tasiŋ wa, ŋ tuma kotar. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Miniɗ nik ne wa hey rime ; wa rimɗi ɗah, fu ƴoɓɗuka. ” »<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ɓitiɓ njuuƴiɗ ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Wa nikee ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, Yeesu jangɗoheeɗa ŋ <char style="w" lemma="sinaagog"><char style="tl">sinaagoga</char></char>. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Ɓitiɓ nikeen nga, a njuuƴee njuuƴ, a mineeɗi jaɗtuk delem, a <char style="w">jiini</char> ambee ɗe. A tumiɗ na kosaay keem kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis yasna-kaahay (18). <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Wa Yeesu hot ɗe, a ɓeeɗukka ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoyi, fu saɓsohuuɗ na kosaay kiŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>A degga ɗe yaah ciŋ ɗe, ŋ ɗiska ɗiska ɓoya jaɗtukka, a yakɗeeɗa Kooh.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Waaye ƴaara adgohee <char style="tl">sinaagoga</char> ayrukka ŋ ini Yeesu wiriɗ ɓitɓa ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, a woosa mboolnda ne : « Neeh yasna-yino ceɗ na pangkohse.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Pula 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Rohƴiɗi 5:13-14</ref></char></note> Hayaat nga ca ɗu paƴuk, waaye ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse haa. »<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Naafeehaaci ! Ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse ya ɓa na tokseeɗi inoh fiŋ ɗe wala mbaamiŋ ɗe ŋ ɗiska a toku ne a kaɗ ɗe anɗa ? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Ŋ hot ɓitɓii ɓaah ŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima, te Seytaani jatngiɗ ɗe kiis ndaŋkiyaah na kiis yasna-kaahay (18) ; wa ye joy tah po a toksassanɗi ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse ? » <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Woo kiŋ Yeesu weem tahha po ɓi sang ɗe ñaarra, waaye mboolnda neɓuusa ŋ in ca feyohiɗ ca baahiɗ ca a tumee jen.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tisohiŋ mutardaani na lawiiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Yeesu woyissa ne : « Hayaat ŋ teeɓ ɗu Nguuriŋ-Kooh findi wa mand na ini ŋ mina mandtiɗkoh. <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Wa mand na inii : A nikee ɓo', a ɓayya kuɓu mutarda, a sokkaa ŋ yohon ce, wa paarra, wa nikka kidig po sel ci taarra ŋ naak ciŋ wa. »<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Yeesu woyissa ne : « Ŋ min mandtiɗohis Nguuriŋ-Kooh na ye ? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Wa mand na findi ɓitiɓ na ɓayohee lawiir a siiɓa na kanoh mun kaahay ; ƴut ɗah, ini siiɓuuɗi jen guuf. »<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahndeeri ɓengiɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Kaɗaŋ Yeesu Yerusalem, a taambee ŋ kur ci yakak ci na ci ƴin ci, a jangɗoheeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Raakka ƴaara meekis ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ɓooɓi na hee mucɗasse, ɓa hey laaye e ? » Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>« Ndengɗukaat ɗu aasoh yahndeeri ɓengiɗi, laam ñam na woyee ɗu ne, ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ hey jeeme aas, waaye ɓa heyɗaa mine.<verse eid="LUK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Te jamanooni heɗ kahni na hee kurkohe ne a rang buntaani, ɗu ɓi wa raakan ŋ hara, ɗu hey nike nga, ɗu laɓɗee buntaani, ɗu woyee ne : “ Heɗi, rangsiɗa ɓoo ! ” A hey ɗu lofe ne : “ Ŋ inahɗi ɗiski ɗu kurkoh. ” <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Ŋ ineem ɗu hey woye ne : “ Moo ɓoo ñamiɗ na ɗa, ɓoo aniɗ na ɗa te fu jangɗohiɗ ŋ mbeeddaaciŋ ɓoo ! ” <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>A hey ɗu lofisse ne : “ Ŋ inahɗi ɗiski ɗu kurkoh, usaat to, ɗu ɓi tumoh bakaaɗ ci jen. ”<verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Teemb ndeem, ɗu hey hote Ibrahiima, na Isaahha, na Yaŋhooɓa na woosuuɗ ci jen ŋ ɗooƴ Nguuriŋ-Kooh, ɗu mbetu ŋ hara, ɗiska fuɗ na ɗoɓɗoh sis raak. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Ɓooɓi hey pulohe ŋ ɓak ci jen, ɓa ɓoof ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh ne ɓa ñam kañam ka yakka. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Raakiɗ ɓooɓi mirndoh woti, ɓeɗ na hee adge ; te raakiɗ ɓi adug woti, ɓeɗ na hee mirndohe. »<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Teemb ndeem, ɓi ɓo' ɓaah <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca hayya ŋ Yeesu, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kurka ndii fu coot laam Herod na waaɗee ɗa ap. » <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat ɗu woya ɓaakoɓeem ne, mi yii saɓsoh ɓooɓi na jiiniici te mi yii wiriɗ kosaayiɗ ci woti na kim, faaha kim ŋ hey ɗiindohe ini ŋ hay ne ŋ haɓiɗa. <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Ŋ joyiɗ taalndiɗ waasiŋ ngo woti na kim na faaha kim, woosuuɗ apohsuu ŋ ɗiski nikɗi Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Cey Yerusalem, fu yi na ape woosuuɗ ci, fu tapee ɓooɓi fu na woosohse atoh po ɓa kaan, waas hend na weɗ ŋ waaɗ nangɗoh kuɓuuciŋ ɗa findi pambi na nangɗohe ƴiil ciŋ ɗe ŋ ooɓ ce, waaye ɗu moosɗi waaɗoh ! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Weɗ tah ɗu hey faɗse na kahan ɗu, te ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ɗu hotissanɗi so po mbaɗna ɗu na hee woye ne : “ A barke'iɗ, yi na haye ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗ ɓoo ! ” »<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ƴaar na faan riifɗiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Wa nikee ŋ <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char>, Yeesu ɓeeɗkuusa kañam ŋ kahan kilifa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>. Wa a ree, ɓooɓa ŋ ɗiska feerkeeɗa ɗe baahiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Ƴaar na faan riifɗiɗ nikka ŋ fikiice. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yeesu meekissa <char style="tl">Farisen</char> ca na jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> ne : « Andi waasi teyɗohiɗ ne ɓo' wiriɗ kosaayiɗ ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse wala ? » <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Waaye ali ɓo' lofɗi ɗe ; a ɓayya kosaayɗa, a wiriɗta ɗe, a woosa ɗe ne a kaɗaat. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Ƴutta, Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « E ya ɓa nga ɗu, a yi kuɓkiŋ ɗe wala inoh fiŋ ɗe keenan ŋ naac ŋ mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse, a jaaruu ɗe puliɗ ? » <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Ali ɓo' minɗi ɗe lof ŋ woo keem.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Findi ɓoyi ɓeeɗku kañam joy mand</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Ŋ ineem, Yeesu hotta findi ɓooɓa ɓeeɗku kañam tansukohee ɗisik ci uup baah ne ɓa ɓoof nga, a jangiɗta ɓa inii : <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>« Ɓo' ɓeeɗuk ɗa kañam kilook ɗah, kina kaɗ fu ɓoof ŋ ɗiski uup baah ; miniɗ nik ne ɓoyi uup ɗa eɗu cir namiɗ ɓeeɗku nga. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Ƴaari ɓeeɗuk ɗu, a hay ɗah, a hey ɗa woye ne : “ Ona ƴaarii, a ɓoof. ” Teemb ndeem fu hey kee ɓoofa ŋ finhoora finhoora, ŋ ineem fu hey njoofe. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Waaye fu ɓeeɗku kañam ŋ kilook ɗah, kaɗa fu ɓoofa ŋ finhoora. Ƴaari ɓeeɗuk ɗa hay ɗah, a hey ɗa woye ne : “ Ƴaariŋ ngo haya, fu ɓoof ŋ fikiiri. ” Teemb ndeem, a hey ɗa yakɗe ŋ fiki ɓooɓi fu ɓoof na ɓa jen. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Laam ɓo' nu meeɓ haf ce ɗah, a hey ruhsiɗasse, te ɓo' nu ruhsiɗ haf ce ɗah, a hey meeɓse. »<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">E ñakiɗ ci ɓeeɗkaah kañam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Ƴutta, Yeesu woosa ƴaara ɓeeɗkee ɗe kañam ne : « Fu eɗohee ñakit wala ñamsuk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ñamsuk </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: weɗ kañam ki na niin.</char></note> ɗah, kana ɓeeɗuk nawleeciŋ ɗa, taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa, ɓaah ciŋ ɗa wala raakiɗ ci fu gen na ɓa ; ɓa miniɗ ɗa nam ɓeeɗuk ne ɓa wirind ɗa ineem. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Waaye fu eɗohee kañam ɗah, ɓeeɗka ñakiɗ ci, na ɓeendkiɗ ci na lafñiɗ ci na fuuliɗ ci. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Ɓa minanɗi ɗa wa wirind, a Kooh na hee ɗa wa wirnde ŋ mbeha aa hee hultiɗohe yurhiɗ ci, tahha po fu hey sume. »<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓeeɗkohiŋ kañam ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Ƴaar ngaŋ ɓa ñamee na Yeesu kerahha ineem, a woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoyi na hee ñame ŋ kañam kiŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh, a hey sume. » <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne : « Ƴaar gapeen ɓo' laayiɗ kañam keeh-keeh. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Wi kañam ki ƴut, a woosa <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> ɗe ne a kaɗaat ɓeeɗka ƴaaɓa. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Yaa nu nga ɗah, waakka naafkoha ; ya koc woosa ne : “ Woya kilifaaniŋ ɗa ne, ŋ han rom yohon te ŋ joyiɗa kaɗ marka, a ɗaasaat to. ” <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Ƴaar wiiriis woosa ɗe ne : “ Ŋ rom inoh ndaŋkiyaah, ceɗ ŋ waaɗ kaɗ marka andi ca hey mine guur, a ɗaasaat to. ” <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Raakka ya woo ɗe ne : “ Ŋ han kilook ɓitiɓ, weɗi tah po ŋ minanɗi hay. ”<verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Ñaama wiirukka ŋ kilifaaniŋ ɗe, heɗ kahni, a woosa ɗe in ceem jen ; yeem ayrukka, a woosa ñaami ne : “ Ara kaɗ ŋ cohohaaci na mbeeddaaci, fu haytoh ñakiɗ ci, na ɓeendkiɗ ci na fuuliɗ ci na yiiɓoh ci. ” <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Wi a kaɗ po a hayya, a woosa kilifaani ne : “ Ini fu nakohee haɓɗuuɗ, waaye kahni ris riifɗi. ” <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Heɗ kahni woosa ɗe ne : “ Kaɗa ŋ waas ca na yohon ca, ɓo' nu fu hot ɗah, tuma po a hay, ne kahni riif. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ali ɓo' ƴoohanɗi ŋ kañam ki ngaŋ ɓooɓa ŋ koc ɓeeɗuk ! ” »<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ya ɓa min nik taalubeeniŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Yeesu kooɗissa waasiŋ ɗe, mboolo laayiɗ hunnda na ɗe, a yurhiɗkohha na ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>« Ɓo' nu waaɗ hay nga so ɗah, a joyiɗ to waaɗ waaɗi uup wi a waaɗ baab ɓa na yaay ɓa, ɓitiice, kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, taambɗoh ciŋ ɗe, po haf ce sah, wala a minanɗi nik taalubeeniŋ ngo. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Ɓo' nu degukɗi kurwaani a joy daaƴohu, a ñaakee nga so ɗah, a minɗi nik taalubeeniŋ ngo.<verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Ɓo' nga ɗu waaɗ tufkiɗ taɓah jimimim ɗah, a ɓoofanɗi, a marak, a kind ini a raak, andi wa heya mine reehiɗ e ? <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>A tumɗi ineem, a yipa po ƴut, a minuu wa kurkiɗ ɗah, ɓooɓi na hee wa hote hey ɗe ƴene ; <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>ɓa woyee ne : “ Ƴaari cambiɗ taɓahi waaye a minɗaa reehiɗ ! ”<verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>A yinde buur na hee raake hiñohoh junni-ndaŋkiyaah (10.000) a kee aasa ŋ hiñoh na buur morom ce ya raak hiñohoh junni-ndaŋkiyaah-kanak (20.000) te a ɓoofuu a marak andi ɓiŋ ɗe hey mine ɓaŋ buura na hee ɗe keene ? <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>A hot ne a minɗaa ɗah, a hey woosohe ŋ buura yinoora ŋ ɗiska a nik, a meekis ɗe ini a waaɗ ne jam raak. » <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Wa mand ɗaa, ali ɓo' minɗi nik taalubeeniŋ ngo nga ɗu, ne a faɗɗi in ci a raak jen ɗah.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>Ee, meɗa, wa in baahiɗ, waaye meɗa kaɗ po wa jemisɗi ɗah, wa min jemɗohissu na ye ? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Wa raakiɗɗi kehƴi njiriñ te wa minanɗi kotar, wa hee hey mbetse. Ɓo' nu raak nof kerhoha ɗah, a kerhaat. »<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Mbaala muuƴe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>
    <char style="w">Juuti'oh</char> ca jen na bakaaɗoh ca ɓinooɓa reɓeeɗa ŋ Yeesu ne ɓa sikɗuk ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Waaye <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca na jangɗohoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> ñukumsukeeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ƴaarii deey, a teyɗukiɗ bakaaɗoh ci, a na ñame ñam na ɓa. » <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Weɗi Yeesu woyoh ɓa andiinii : <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>« Ɓo' nga ɗu, raak mbaal teemet (100), yino muuƴ nga ɗah, andi a faɗanɗi ca tas jen ŋ bilaf fa, a kaɗ ɗe waaka po a hot ɗe ? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>A hot ɗe ɗah, a hey sume, a deg ɗe ŋ yuug ciŋ ɗe, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>a haad. A ree kahna ɗah, a ɓeeɗuk nawleeciŋ ɗe na gentoh ciŋ ɗe, a woo ɓa ne : “ Ɓaahaat neɓɗii na so, ŋ hotiɗ mbaaliŋ ngo muuƴe. ” <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu ne wa nam mand ɗaa ngaŋ ɓi nik ŋ Eel ci ; bakaaɗoh yino ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ ɗah, ɓa hey sume nga sumi uup wi ɓa suman ŋ ɓo' ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-nikiis na yasna-nikiis (99) ɓi yurah te ɓa etohɗi ɓoƴsoh pesohaaɗ.<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hanjara muuƴe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Wala ɓitiɓ raak hanjar "<char style="tl">darakma</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false"><char style="tl">darakma</char> </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: hanjar ŋ <char style="w">Gerek</char> ci, wa hendeen na ini ɓoyi na pangke bumit wirndassee ŋ noh yino. Wa meeɗeen tumu findi libidoor.</char></note>" ndaŋkiyaah, yino muuƴ nga ɗah, andi a fuuɗanɗi laampa, a paɗee, a waakee ɓak nu ɓak ŋ kahni po a hota ? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>A hota ɗah, a ɓeeɗuk nawleeciŋ ɗe na gentoh ciŋ ɗe, a woo ɓa ne : “ Ɓaahaat neɓɗii na so, ŋ hotiɗ <char style="tl">darakmaaniŋ</char> ngo muuƴe. ” <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu ne wa nam mand ɗaa ngaŋ malaakaaciŋ Kooh ; bakaaɗoh yino ɓoƴsoh kipes ɗah, ɓa sum nga. »<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuɓka ƴaara muuƴe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Ƴaar raakeen kuɓu ƴaar kanak. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Mbeh, yi uup ƴin nga woosa ɗe ne : “ Baab, eɗ to ɓakiŋ ngo ŋ ini ɓoo joy lam. ” Baab ɓa paysohha ɓa raak-raak kiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Wa degga ɓi neeh, a yi ƴini, a ɓoƴissa ina a raakee jen kopor, a kaɗta naa ŋ kur usiɗ, a yahrohhaa ndaam ŋ nikohaaɗ sepƴiɗ.<verse eid="LUK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Wa a yahroha po wa reehha, aɗ miskiɗ raakka ŋ kur kaam, a cammba ñak. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>A kaɗta ŋ ƴaar gen kur ka, yeem ammba ɗe surga, a niiɗeeɗa mbaam-huk caŋ ɗe ŋ yohon ca. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>A nikka nga, a aɗukka po a waaɗta ñam ŋ rim caŋ kidig ca nikee kañam kaŋ mbaam-huk ca, waaye a onseeɗi nga ca. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>A ɓooffa po a markissa haf ce, a woosa ne : “ Pangkoh caŋ kahan baab ɓoo jen sah, na ñamee ñam po ɓa kap te ndii, mi heeɗa kaane na aɗ. <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Mi na hee dokke ɗiskaŋ baab ɓoo, ŋ ree ɗah, ŋ woo ɗe ne : ‘Baab, ŋ ɗaliɗ Kooh, ŋ ɗalla ɗa, <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>ŋ carisɗi ŋ markohse findi kuɓkiŋ ɗa, amb mbo findi pangkoh ciŋ ɗa.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>A kaɗta kahan baab ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Wa baab ɓa ƴok ɗe usiɗ, a misikka ɗe lool ; a nuppa ŋ kuɓkiŋ ɗe, a morgiɗukka ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Kuɓka woosa baab ɓa ne : “ Baab, ŋ ɗaliɗ Kooh, ŋ ɗalla ɗa, ŋ carisɗi ŋ markohse findi kuɓkiŋ ɗa. ” <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Waaye baab ɓa woosa <char style="w">ñaam</char> caŋ ɗe ne : “ Araat ɓay kulɓaaki uup moɗ, ɗu ɓekiɗ ɗe wa, ɓekɗaat ɗe jaaru na ñafaɗ, <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>te ɗu ap ɗooni yafalse, ɓoo mbuumbaay. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Laam kuɓkiŋ ngo yii, a kaanee kaan, a hultiɗ ; a muuƴee muuƴ, a hotkiɗ ! ” Ɓa mbuumbaayeeɗa.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Wa raak kuɓki yakki ŋ yohon ca ; wi a hay po a heeɗa ree kahni, a kerahha tip ci na mbec ci. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>A ɓeeɗukka ñaam yino ŋ ñaam ci, a meekissa ɗe ini raak. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Ñaami woosa ɗe ne : “ Taambɗoh fu a yi hay, baab ɗu sah apiɗ ɗooni yafalse sagu hoti a hotis kuɓkiŋ ɗe ŋ jam. ” <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Teemb ndeem saawi ayrukka, a sannga ne a heyɗi aase kahni. Weɗi baab ɓa hayoh nga ɗe, a kiimmba ɗe ne a aasaat. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Waaye a loffa ɗe ne : “ Sikɗuk ko, kiis laayiɗ ceɗɗi mi yii ñaamkiɗ ɗa, ŋ moosɗi ɗa nik kerhiɗaaɗi ŋ in ci fu na nakohe, te koteng sah fu moosɗi so ɗe onoh ne ŋ mbuumbaay na nawleeciŋ ngo. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Waaye kuɓkiŋ ɗa yi yahroh koporiŋ ɗa ŋ toonkoh ca hayiɗ, fu apɗiɗ ɗe ɗooni yafalse. ” <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Baab ɓa loffa ɗe ne : “ Kuɓu, fu moos nik na so, ini ŋ raak jen wa wuu fu. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Waaye ɓoo joyiɗ sum te ɓoo mbuumbaay, laam taambɗoh fu kaanee kaan, a hultiɗ ; a muuƴee muuƴ, a hotkiɗ ! ” »<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Ñaama ñaañɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yeesu naandsukeen taalubeeciŋ ɗe andiinii : « A nikee ƴaar heɗ raak-raak, a raakka <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaama</char> meeɗ ɗe taambkohiɗ raak-raakaŋ ɗe. A woyuusa ne ñaamaŋ ɗe na yahrohee wa yahroh. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Ƴaara ɓeeɗukka ñaama, a woosa ɗe ne : “ Ŋ kerhiɗ ini fu na tume ! Teeɓ po findi fu na taambkohohe raak-raakiŋ ngo. Fu pangkiɗissanɗi so. ”<verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Ñaama woosa ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : “ Kilifaaniŋ ngo hey yo aañe, moo ŋ tuman na ? Ŋ hot ne ŋ raakɗi hatil guuroha te ŋ supkiɗ kiim. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Ee, waaye ŋ inhiɗ ini mi na hee haɓɗe po kilifaaniŋ ngo aañ njo ɗah, ŋ raak ɓooɓi na hee so ɓaye ŋ kahan ciŋ ɓa. ”<verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>A ɓeeɗukka ɓooɓa joy wirind kilifaaniŋ ɗe kombot jen, yino yino. A woo yi koc ne : “ Fu joy ye wirind kilifaaniŋ ngo ? ” <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Yeem loffa ɗe ne : “ Diwliin. Ngaal yakak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngaal yakak </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: wa reyeen <char style="tl">liitar</char> ndaŋkiyaah-kanak na <char style="tl">liitar</char> kanak (22).</char></note> teemet (100). ” A woosa ɗe ne : “ Kaytiŋ ɗa weɗɗi, ɓoofa, fu ar fiis ngaal yakak ndaŋkiyaah-yatuus (50). ” <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Ƴutta, a ɓeeɗukka ƴaar wiiriis, a woosa ɗe ne : “ Fu nak, fu joy ye wirind kilifaaniŋ ngo ? ” Ƴaari loffa ne : “ Bele. Saaku teemet (100). ” A woosa ɗe ne : “ Kaytiŋ ɗa weɗɗi, ɓoofa, fu fiis ndaŋkiyaah-yasna-kaahay (80). ” <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Kilifaani hotta ini ñaami yurhaaɗiini haɓiɗ, a woosa ne : “ Ƴaari ñaañiɗ kat ! ” »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:8">Yeesu degga nga ne : « Ɓooɓi na taambɗe jamanooni, ŋ findi ɓa na tiindɗohe ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓeɗ uup yunuk ɓooɓi nik ŋ ñiiniŋ Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu ne, raak-raakiŋ Adina yurahɗi, waaye waakaat nawle naa, kaɗ po wa raakisɗi ɗah, ɓa min ɗu taambuk ŋ <char style="w">ɗiip</char> ca na hee nikee po faw. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Ɓoyi min oolku ŋ in ƴissuut, a miniɗ oolku ŋ in yakak te ɓoyi nik yurhaaɗi ŋ in ƴissuut, a heyɗi name nik yurhiɗ ŋ in yakak. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Kon, nik ne ɗu minɗi oolku ŋ findi ɗu na ambohe raak-raakiŋ Adina ɗah, ya ɓa na hee ɗu dengkohe raak-raak ci kiyooh ci ? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Nik ne ɗu minɗi oolku ŋ findi ɗu na ambohe ini ɗu raakɗi ɗah, andi ɗu hey eɗse ini ɗu raakoot ?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>Ali ñaam minɗi raak heɗ kanak, mbaa a hey waaɗe yino, a sang yi tas ; wala a ŋoɗ ŋ yii, a heef yi tas. Kon ɗu minɗi ñaamuk Kooh, ɗu ñaamkee raak-raak. »<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>
    <char style="w">
      <char style="tl">Farisen</char>
    </char> ca nikee ɓo' waaɗiɗ kopor lool, tahha po, wa ɓa kerah woo ceem jen, ɓa njembteeɗa ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na yurah yurahɗuke ŋ has ciŋ ɓooɓi, waaye Kooh inhiɗ ini nik ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ciŋ ɗu. Laam in ci ɓooɓi na yakɗe, ca in sepƴiɗ ngaŋ Kooh.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">Waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci nikee nga po wi <char style="w">Yahya Ɓoktohi</char> hay. Ini amboh ndeem, <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, wiŋ ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh wii yegɗohu, te ɓo' nu nga ɗah yii ndengɗuk na hatil ne a aas nga. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Waaye eel ci na kehƴi kuruk nga, weɗ uup yooɓ fiisi uup ƴissuut nihsuk ŋ waasiŋ Musaa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>Ƴaar nu saɓsukoh na ɓitiice, a tokis ɓitiɓ wiiriis ɗah, a njaaloo njaaloo. Te ƴaar nu tok ɓitiɓ saɓsukohiɗ na ƴaar ce ɗah, a njaaloo njaaloo. »<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Heɗ raak-raaka na Lasaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Yeesu naandsukissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « A nikee heɗ raak-raak, a meeɗ ɓekuk kulɓa jakiɗ ca uupee raak candoom ; a peseeɗa pes neɓiɗ, Kooh-nu-wiis a meeɗta mbuumbaay. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Raakeen ñakiɗ ŋ serooce, na woyse Lasaar. Lasaar yeem faaniŋ ɗe riifeen na puus, a meeɗ faɗu faankiɗ ŋ nguɓu kahan ƴaara. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>A meeɗeen aɗuk po a waaɗ ñam ŋ ñamohiicaŋ heɗ raak-raaka, ca na keene. Te ɓuu ci sah meeɗ meeɗ hay, ca ɗeewee puus ciŋ ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Wi ƴaari ñakɗi kaan, malaakaaci ɓayya ɗe ŋ sero Ibrahiima. Heɗ raak-raaka nammba kaan, a acuusa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Waaye ŋ ɗiska a nik ŋ Jaanim, a miskiɗta lool. A marakka usiɗ, a hotta Lasaar ŋ sero Ibrahiima. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>A yi heɗ raak-raaka, a woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : “ Baab Ibrahiima, ŋ miskaat ɗa, fu woos Lasaar, a ɓek ndukniŋ ɗe ŋ masuɓ, a iiri'ɗiɗ to peɗmiŋ ngo ne sifaɗki haawsuk, ŋ raakiɗ miskiɗ lool ŋ yongkaahii. ”<verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Waaye Ibrahiima loffa ɗe ne : “ Kuɓu, naandsuka ne fu rahsiɗ neɓɗaŋ ɗa wa fu na pese te Lasaar nikka ŋ miskiɗ. Ɗiski wa nik ndii, keeñiŋ ɗe soosɗuuɗ, a fu nik ngaŋ miskiɗ kotii. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Ɓaat nga, nung angiɗ nooɗiɗ weɗi ŋ harmban ɓoo na ɗu ; tahha po, ali ɓo' waaɗ puloh ndii, a kaɗ nga ɗu, wa minkanɗi te ɓo' minɗi puloh ngaŋ ɗiski fu nik ndeem, a hay ndii. ”<verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Heɗ raak-raaka woosa ne : “ Kon, mi yii kiim ɗa baab Ibrahiima, woosa Lasaar ŋ kahan baab ɓoo. <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>Ŋ raakiɗ taambɗoh yatuus nga, a woo na ɓa, ɓa hayuu ŋ ɗiski miskiɗii. ” <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Ibrahiima loffa ɗe ne : “ Taambɗoh ciŋ ɗa, ɓa ɗaa na woo ciŋ Musaa na ciŋ woosuuɗ ci, ɓa sikɗukaat ca. ” <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Heɗ raak-raaka woosa ɗe ne : “ Baab Ibrahiima, ineem doyɗi, waaye ɓo' hulit ŋ kaaniɗ ci, a kaɗ nga ɓa ɗah, ɓa hey ɓoƴsohe pesohaaɗ. ” <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Waaye Ibrahiima woosa ɗe ne : “ Ɓa sikɗukɗi Musaa na woosuuɗ ci ɗah, ali ɓo' hulit ŋ kakaan ka, tahanɗi ɓa ɓoƴsoh kipes.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11">Saaŋ 11</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Ɗaasoh na kos na ini ñaam joy haɓiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yeesu woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « In ci na hee kome ɓo' bakaaɗ ñakanɗi, waaye mas ɓoyi na hee ca ɓeke. <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Ɓoyeem tokseen atoh ɓitiɗ ŋ mbooh, a njafu ŋ cookma ɗah weɗ ngisoh nga ɗe, a bakaaɗɗukoh yino ŋ ɓooɓi ƴin cii. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Mbaa markaat in ci ɗu na haɓɗe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Morom fu bakaaɗ nga ɗa ɗah, woytohaa ɗe, inwaaso amb ɗe nga ɗah, ɗaasaa ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Ali a ɗal ɗa waas yasna-kanak ŋ mbehi yinoori, te waa nu nga ɗa a ɗaasnuk ɗa ɗah, ɗaasaa ɗe. »<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>
    <char style="w">
      <char style="tl">Apootar</char>
    </char> ci woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ɓaatɗa ɓoo kosi ɓoo kos. » <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ali ɗu raak kos hend na kuɓu mutarda ƴissuut, ɗu woo kidgii ne : “ Ɗofka, fu kaɗ yipa niir ciŋ ɗa ŋ cookma ” ɗah, wa hey ɗu kerhiɗe.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>Ɓo' nga ɗu raak <char style="w">ñaam</char>, yeem guurɗee ɗa wala a niiɗɗee ɗa, a puloh yohon ca ɗah, fu heyɗi ɗe jaare woo ne : “ Haya fu ñam. ” <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Waaye fu na hee ɗe woye ne : “ Tikiɗ to, fu ɓekuk kulɓa wiiriis, ne fu deƴiɗ to. Ŋ ñam, ŋ an po ŋ ƴut ɗah, fu han ñam, fu an. ” <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Tum ini fu nak ɗe, wa tahanɗi po fu corkiɗ ñaamiŋ ɗa. <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Wa mand ɗaa nga ɗu, ɗu haɓiɗ ini ɗu naku po ƴut ɗah, woyaat ne : “ Ɓoo ñaam dong, ɓoo haɓiɗ ini ɓoo joy haɓiɗ. ” »<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ ƴaaɓa faan caŋ ɓa oɓsuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yeesu nikee ŋ waas Yerusalem, a taambeeɗa ŋ harmban Samari na Galile, <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>a aaseeɗa ŋ kur, weɗ ƴaar ndaŋkiyaah hayoh cohe na ɗe, ɓa raakee <char style="w">kosaay ki na oɓse faan</char> ; ɓa tufukka ɗisik usiɗ, <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>ɓa woosa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Yeesu Kilifaani, ɓoo miskaat ɗa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-3">Lewiici 14:2-3</ref></char></note>! » <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>A hotta ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat, ɗu teeɓa haf ɗu <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca. » Ɓa kaɗeeɗa, ɓa wirra. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Yino nga ɓa, wa a hot ne a wiriɗ, a guridda ŋ Yeesu, a yakɗeeɗa Kooh ŋ ɗafka. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>A ƴekka ŋ kot ciŋ Yeesu po pukiŋ ɗe reesa kehƴi, a corkiɗta ɗe. Ƴaareem ɓaahee nga ɓi Samari. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Wa Yeesu hot ɗe, a woosa ne : « Ɓa ndaŋkiyaah ɓeɗ wirɗu haa e ? Moo ɓa nde yasna-nikiis ca tas ? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>A yinoori dong hay ne a yakiɗ Kooh, te a Yawuut haa sah ! » <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>A woosa ƴaara ne : « Kurka, fu miniɗ coot, ƴaari ; kosi fu kos wirɗiɗ ɗa. »<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguuriŋ-Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Wa raakka mbeh, <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> ca meekissa Yeesu ne : « Nguuriŋ-Kooh na hee haye kiɗa ? » A woosa ɓa ne : « Nguuriŋ-Kooh hayee ɗah, wa nikanɗi ini ɓo' min hot, <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>te ɓo' woyanɗi ne : “ Wa ɗii ŋ ndii ! ” wala “ Wa ɗaa ŋ nden ! ” Laam Nguuriŋ-Kooh wa ɗii ŋ ndii na ɗu. »<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Ƴutta, a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : « Jamano hey haye, ɗu hey waaɗe hot <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char>, ali nik ne wa nikan mbeh yino dong, waaye ɗu minanɗi wa. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Te ɓa hey ɗu woye ne : “ A yii ŋ ndii ! ” wala “ A yaa ŋ nden ! ” Kanaat kaɗ nga, kanaat ɓa ñaakiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Findi meleñ na pulohe, wa ñiiniɗ ɓak po ɓak, Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi na hee mande ɗaa ŋ mbehiŋ ɗe, <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>waaye bala ineem, a joyiɗ raak miskiɗ laayiɗ te ɓooɓiŋ jamanooni woti-woti sang ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Bala Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hayissan ɗah, wa mandan findi wa mandee ŋ jamanoonaŋ Noohin. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Ɓooɓa nikee ñameeɗa, aneeɗa, ɓa kilookeeɗa, ɓa kilookseeɗa po mbeha Noohin aasoh ŋ gaala, masuɓ laayiɗ riiffa kehƴi, wa ɗummba ɓa jen.<verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Na findi jamanoonaŋ Loot, ɓooɓa nikee ñameeɗa, ɓa aneeɗa, ɓa romeeɗa, ɓa tooneeɗa, ɓa guureeɗa, ɓa taɓaheeɗa <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>po mbeha Loot pul Sodom, yongkaah na <char style="tl"><char style="w">suufar</char></char> toɓuusa ŋ ɗafuk ɓa, wa ɗummba ɓa jen.<verse eid="LUK 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Mbehi Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi na hee hotkohe, wa mandan ɗaa. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>Mbeheem, ɓoyi wa na hee raake ŋ ɗafuk teeraasiŋ ɗe, a ruhsee ɗah, a kinaat aas ne a ɓay in ciŋ ɗe nik ŋ ɗooƴi. Te ɓoyi wa naman raak ŋ yohon ca, a kinaat gurid ; <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>naandsukaat ina rahsee ɓiti Loot.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Camba 19:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Ɓo' nu waaɗ muciɗ kiñin kiŋ ɗe ɗah, a heya ñake, te ɓo' nu teyɗuk ñak kiñin kiŋ ɗe ɗah, a hey rise naa.<verse eid="LUK 17:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ŋ wekeem ɓo' kanak hey ɓaahe fiƴaang, yinni ɓayu, yi tas faɗu. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Ɓitiɓ kanak hey nike ɓa oɗe, yinni ɓayu, yi tas faɗu. » [<verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak aayaanii : "Ƴaar kanak hey nikee ŋ yohon ca, yinni ɓayu, yi tas faɗu." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut ŋ woo kaŋ ɗe, taalubeeciŋ ɗe meekseeɗa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ineem waa hee nike ŋ nde ? » A loffa ɓa ne : « Ɓa woo ne : “ Ɗiski fiɗaaf nik, suur ci na cohe nga. ” »<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓo' joy gen ŋ kiim Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yeesu naandsukissa taalubeeciŋ ɗe andiinii ne a teeɓ ɓa ne ɓa joy joy gen ngaŋ kiim Kooh, ɓa sang faɗsuk. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>An : « Wa raakeen atte'oh ŋ kur, a nupeeɗi Kooh delem te a kerhiɗeeɗi ali ɓo'. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Wa nameen raak ɓitiɓ nga, ƴaar ce kaanee kaan, a raakka ɓoya a leer na ɗe ; tahha po a meeɗta kaɗ ngaŋ atte'oha ne yeem eɗ ɗe keeh ki a raak ŋ ɓoya a leer na ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Atte'ohi waaɗɗi wa tum, a faɗta po wa maannja, a hannda woo ŋ ɗooƴ ce ne : “ Wa keeh ne ŋ nupɗi Kooh te ŋ kerhiɗɗi ali ɓo'. <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>Waaye yaaɓɗi ɓitɓii na yaaɓɗee so, tahiɗ po ŋ hey ɗe eɗe keeh kiŋ ɗe ne a hayissuu nga so, a apee so na woo. ” » <verse eid="LUK 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu ɓaatta nga ne : « Kerhaat baahiɗ ini atte'ohi yurhaaɗiini woo weem. <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Ɗu liiɓiɗ ne Kooh namanɗi eɗ ɓooɓiŋ ɗe a kooɗ keeh kiŋ ɓa e, ɓeɗ ɓi na leehke nga ɗe noh na wek ? A hey ɓa sekɗohe e ? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, wa maañanɗi, Kooh eɗ ɓa keeh kiŋ ɓa. Waaye andi <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayis ɗah, a hey raake oolkiɗ Kooh ŋ kehƴi ? »<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Farisena</char> na juuti'oha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Raakka ɓi liiɓee ne ɓa yurhiɗ, ɓa heefeeɗa ɓinooɓi. Yeesu naandsukka ɓa andiinii : <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>« Ɓa nikee ƴaar kanak, ɓa kaɗta <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char> ne ɓa kiimaa ɗe nga. Yinoori nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>, yinni nikka <char style="w">juuti'oh</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/><char style="tl">Fariseni</char> tufukka, kiimeeɗa Kooh kiik ce an : “ Eey Kooh ! Mi yii corkiɗ ɗa ŋ ini ŋ mandɗi na ɓinooɓi, ɓa rok, ɓa yurahɗi te ɓa na njaalo'ee njaaloo. Mi yii corkiɗ ɗa ŋ ini ŋ namɗi mand na juuti'ohii. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Mi na ore waas kanak ŋ ɗooƴ mbeh dokkiɗ. Te in nu ŋ raak ndaŋkiyaah nga ɗah, ŋ eɗoh yinoori. ” <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Juuti'oha nak, a cangtiɗuk cangtiɗuk, a kaañɗi sah jaɗtuk, a laɓɗeeɗa daɗi, a miskiɗkeeɗa, a woyeeɗa ne : “ Kooh ŋ miskaat ɗa, laam ŋ bakaaɗoh. ” » <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Yeesu ɓaatta nga ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu ne, bala juuti'ohi haadan, a yi Kooh ɗaas, a ammba ɗe findi yurhiɗ, waaye <char style="tl">Farisena</char> haa. Laam ɓo' nu meeɓ haf ce ɗah, a hey ruhsiɗasse, te ɓo' nu ruhsiɗ haf ce ɗah, a hey meeɓse. »<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguuriŋ-Kooh wa wuu ɓooɓi mand na komaaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Ɓa ɓayeeɗa sah ɓi gooy ŋ Yeesu ne a laal ɓa, waaye taalubeeciŋ ɗe hotta ŋ ineem, ɓa ngaskeeɗa ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Yeesu nakohha ɓa reɓɗu, a woosa ne : « Faɗaat komaakci ɓa hay nga so, kinaat ɓa hondoh hay, ɓooɓi mand na ɓa ɓeɗ raak Nguuriŋ-Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓo' nu teyɗukɗi Nguuriŋ-Kooh findi komaaki ƴin na teyɗukohe ɗah, fu moosanɗi aas nga. »<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nguuriŋ-Kooh na raakiɗ ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ƴaar ɓaah ŋ ɓa adgohee Yawuut ca meekissa Yeesu ne : « Jangɗohohi baahiɗi, ŋ joy ye haɓiɗ po ŋ raak kipes ki heyɗi reehe ? » <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>A loffa ɗe ne : « Wa ye tah fu ɓeeɗkohee so baahiɗ ? Ali ɓo' baahɗi, hanaa Kooh dong. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Fu inhiɗ nakoh ci ; an kina njaaloo, kina ap ɓo', kina rok, kina woyiɗ ɓo' ini a tumɗi, eɗa yaay ɗu na baab ɗu cir. » <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Ƴaara woosa ɗe ne : « In ceem jen mi yii taambiɗ ca ŋ kikomaakiikaŋ ngo poyi. » <verse eid="LUK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Wa Yeesu kerah ina a woo, a loffa ɗe ne : « Wa in yino weɗ fu tas haɓiɗ. Toona in ci fu raak jen, fu paysoh ca ñakiɗ ci, fu hey raake alal ŋ Eel ci. Ƴut ɗah, fu hay, fu ñaakiɗ to. » <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ƴaara nikee ɓo' raakiɗ lool, tahha po wa a kerah woo keem a goyya. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yeesu hotta ne a goyiɗ, a woosa ne : « Heɗ raak-raak aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh wa in ye miskan. <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Ngeelemb aas ŋ ngul kufic weɗ uup yooɓ heɗ raak-raak aas ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. »<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Wa ɓooɓa kerah woo keem, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Kon a ya ɓa min mucɗu ? » <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ini wooñ ɓooɓi wooñɗi Kooh. » <verse eid="LUK 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Moo ɓoo nak, ɓoo faɗiɗ in ciŋ ɓoo, ɓoo ñaakɗiɗ ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓo' nu faɗ kahan mbaa ɓitiɓ, taambɗoh, yaay, baab wala kuɓu sagu Nguuriŋ-Kooh ɗah, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>fu hey raake nga laayoh na laayoh woti te kim fu hey raake kipes ki heyɗi reehe. »<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu woyissiɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut woo na ɓa, a ɓeeɗukka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) kiik ɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Sikɗukaat to, ɓoo na kee Yerusalem te in ci woosuuɗ ci fiis ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi jen, ca hey nike. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>A hey faɗse ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut, ɓa hey ɗe njembte, ɓa ɓas ɗe, ɓa tuhus ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Ɓa laɓ ɗe leraw po ƴut ɗah, ɓa hey ɗe ape te ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh, a hey hulte. » <verse eid="LUK 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Waaye <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci inheeɗi ini woo ceem tokis, ca ñiineeɗi nga ɓa, ɓa inheeɗi ini Yeesu waaɗ woo.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wirɗiɗ fuuliɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Ŋ kaɗaŋ Yeesu, wa a hay po a heeɗa ree Yeriko, fuuliɗ ɓoofeen ŋ mbeeddaana yalwaaneeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Wa a kerah ɗuuɗaŋ mboolnda taambee, a meeksohha ini raak. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « A Yeesu yi gen Nasareet, a yi na taambe. » <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>A leehukka an : « Yeesu setiŋ Dawuuda, ŋ miskaat ɗa ! » <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Ɓooɓa nikee ŋ fikiira ngaskeeɗa ɗe ne a ɗek, waaye a uupeeɗa nga leehuk an : « Setiŋ Dawuuda, ŋ miskaat ɗa ! » <verse eid="LUK 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yeesu tufukka, a woosa ɓooɓa ne ɓa reɓɗaat fuulɗa nga ɗe. Wa fuulɗa hay, Yeesu meekissa ɗe ne : <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>« Fu waaɗ ne ŋ haɓɗiɗ ɗa ye ? » Yeem loffa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ŋ waaɗ ne fu tum po has ciŋ ngo min hot. » <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Hota ! Kosi fu kos wirɗiɗ ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Jaarra fuulɗa hoteeɗa, a taambɗeeɗa Yeesu, a yakɗeeɗa Kooh. Ɓooɓa jen hotta ŋ ineem, ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Sase taambɗiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Wa Yeesu ree Yeriko, a lahha ŋ ɗooƴ kur ka, a kaɗeeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Wa raakeen ƴaar teeku Sase, a yi nikee kilifaanaŋ <char style="w">juuti'oh</char> ca, te a raakeen lool. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>A markeeɗa ne a hot ya ɓa Yeesu, waaye a mineeɗi wa sagu rohƴa a rohƴee na mboolnda. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>A nuppa ŋ fikiira, a rappa ŋ ɗafuk ndun ŋ waasa ne a hot Yeesu, ne yeem taambee ɗah.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Wa Yeesu hay po a reesa ndaam, a taaknukka, a woosa ɗe ne : « Sase ara ruhus, woti ŋ joy dal ŋ kahan fu. » <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>A arra ruhus, a daliɗta Yeesu ŋ kahan ce, a neɓuusa nga lool. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Wa ɓooɓa hot ineem, ɓa jen ɓa lahtukeeɗa ne : « Markaat ƴaari, a dal ŋ kahan bakaaɗoh. » <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Raak Sase tufkiɗ, woyeeɗa Yeesu ne : « Kilifaani, ŋ hey eɗe ñakiɗ ci ɓaki winooriŋ raak-raakiŋ ngo. Te ɓo' nu nik ne ŋ kooɗiɗ in uupiɗ nga ɗe ɗah, ŋ hey ɗe wa dokne waas nikiis. » <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Muci reyiɗ ŋ kahnii woti. Ƴaarii nam ɓaah keeh-keeh ŋ ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Te <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayiɗ ne a waak muuƴiɗ ci, a hirip ɓa. »<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hanjar ca ndaŋkiyaah ca urus ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Ɓooɓa nikee sikɗukeeɗa Yeesu. Raak ɗe ŋ ɓak Yerusalem te ɓooɓi liiɓee ne Nguuriŋ-Kooh na hee hotke win-win. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Ŋ ineem Yeesu woosa ɓa ŋ andiin ne : « A nikee garmi, a joyya kaɗ kur usiɗ ne a ɓekohsa buur nga, ƴut ɗah, a dokuk kur ce. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Bala a kaɗan ɗah, a ɓeeɗukka <char style="w">ñaam</char> ndaŋkiyaah ŋ ɓaŋ ɗe, a eɗta yaa nu nga ɗah hanjar urus, a woosa ɓa ne : “ Toontukaat po ŋ hay. ” <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Wa a na kaɗe jen, ɓi kur ce waaɗeeɗi ɗe, ɓa tuuƴca ɓi ɓo' ŋ finhooce ne ɓa ree ɗah, ɓa woo ne ɓa waaɗɗi ne a nik buuriŋ ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Hondohɗi, a tumuusa buur. A hayissa, a ɓeeɗukka ñaam ca a eɗe kopora ne a marak ini ɓa ɓaat nga. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Ya koc hayya woosa ɗe ne : “ Kilifaani, ursiŋ ɗa fu eɗee so eɗohiɗ hanjar urus ndaŋkiyaah. ” <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Buura loffa ɗe ne : “ Corka ! Fu ñaam baahiɗ, findi fu ndengɗukoh ŋ in ci ƴin ci, tahiɗ po adgoha kur ndaŋkiyaah. ” <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Ya kanakɗoh hayya woosa ɗe ne : “ Kilifaani, ursiŋ ɗa fu eɗee so eɗohiɗ hanjar urus yatuus. ” <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Buura woosa ɗe ne : “ Nama adgoh kur yatuus. ”<verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20-21"/>Ñaam wiiriis hayya, woosa ɗe ne : “ Kilifaani, fu ɓo' miskiɗ ; fu na kooɗe ini fu raakɗi te fu na nguɗe ini fu sokɗi. Ineem weɗ tah po ŋ neƴƴoha ɗa, ŋ loƴca ursiŋ ɗa, ŋ ɗaakkaa. ” <verse eid="LUK 19:20-21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Buura loffa ɗe ne : “ Ñaami baahaaɗiini, ŋ atte'an ɗa ngaŋ in ci fu woo. Fu inheen ne ŋ ɓo' miskiɗ, mi na kooɗe ini ŋ raakɗi, ŋ nguɗe ini ŋ sokɗi. <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Wa ye tah fu ɗaakɗi koporiŋ ngo ŋ ɗiska na ɗaakohse kopor, ne ŋ hay ɗah, ŋ raaka rimɗiɗ to in ? ”<verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Ƴutta, a woosa ƴaaɓa nikee nga ne : “ Ɓayaat ursi nik na ɗe, ɗu eɗa yi raak hanjar urus ndaŋkiyaah. ” <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : “ Moo Kilifaani, ƴaareem raakiɗ hanjar ndaŋkiyaah ! ” <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>A loffa ɓa ne : “ Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ɓoyi raak hey ɓaatse, waaye ɓoyi raakɗi, ini ƴissuuti a amb sah hey naafse nga ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ɓi sang ngo, ɓi waaɗeeɗi ne ŋ nik buuriŋ ɓa, hayaat na ɓa ndii, ɗu ap ɓa ŋ fikiiso. ” »<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Wa Yeesu ƴut ŋ woo ceem, a adgiɗta ɓa ne ɓa kaɗ Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aasaŋ Yeesu ŋ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Wa Yeesu kaɗ po a heeɗa ree Betfase na Betani ŋ sero tangoora na woyse Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca, a woossa taalube kanak. <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat ŋ kur ki ŋ fikiiɗu wii, ɗu ree ɗah, ɗu hey raake cumbur mbaam tokuuɗ nga, yi ali ɓo' moosɗi rapoh. Toksaat ɗe, ɗu hay na ɗe ndii. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Ɓo' meekis ɗu wa ye tah ɗu toksee ɗe ɗah, woyaat ɗe ne a kilifaani etoh ɗe. »<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Wa ɓooɓa woossee kaɗ, ɓa raakohha in ceem ɗaa, findi Yeesu woyohee ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Ɓa tokseeɗa cumbra, ɓooɓa raak ɗe woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu tokse cumbri ? » <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Ɓa loffa ɓa ne : « A kilifaani etoh ɗe. » <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Ɓa kommba Yeesu ɗe, ɓa raɗta kulɓaacaŋ ɓa ŋ ɗafuk cumbra, ɓa rapiɗta Yeesu nga ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>A kaɗeeɗa, ɓooɓa raɗɗeeɗa ɗe kulɓaacaŋ ɓa ŋ waasa.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Wa a hay po a heeɗa ruhse Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca ŋ ɓak Yerusalem, taalubeeciŋ ɗe findi ɓa hend jen, ɓa neɓuusa, ɓa cammba ƴeek Kooh ŋ ɗafka sagu keemaan ca laayiɗ ca fu inah ne ɓa hoteen ca. <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>Ɓa woyeeɗa ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">« Buuri na haye ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">a raakaat barke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">jam raakaat ŋ Eel ci,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">ndami nikaat nik na Kooh yi ŋ ɗafka ɗafka. »<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Ɓi <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char> nikeen ŋ ɗooƴ mboolnda, ɓa woosa Yeesu ne : « Jangɗohohi, woytoha taalubeeciŋ ɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ɓa ɗek ɗah, e atoh ci ƴeekan. »<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu fuɗiɗ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Wa Yeesu kaɗ po a yurhiɗkohha na Yerusalem, wa misikka ɗe, a fuɗtaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>An : « Na ɗa, fu inheen woti in ci min ɗa kom jam ɗah ! Waaye, ɗiski wa nik ndii fu minɗi ca hot. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Jamano miskiɗ hey haye nga ɗa, ɓi sang ɗa hey tufkiɗe miir wiiriis wa wil wiŋ ɗa, ɓa ndeer ɗa, ɓa keen ɗa ŋ ɓak ci jen, <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>ɓa ɗumb ɗa na ɓooɓiŋ ɗa. Ɓa heyɗi ɗa faɗɗe ali atoh kanak degsukohiɗ. Laam fu inhisohɗi jamanooni Kooh hayoh ɗa hirpe. »<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ Kahan Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Wa Yeesu ree Yerusalem, a aassa <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a aañeeɗa toonoh ca. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>A woyeeɗa ɓa ne : « Kooh woyiɗ ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci ne : “ Kahan ndo nikaat kahan kiimohaa so ”, waaye ɗu tumiɗa ɗembohaaniŋ rokoh ci. »<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Mbeh nu nik a meeɗta jangɗoh ŋ Kahan Kooh. Kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, na jangɗohoh caŋ wa, na yakak ca waakeeɗa findi ɓa apohan ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Waaye ɓa inahɗi findi ɓa tuman laam ɓooɓa jen nikee ñaakiɗ nga ɗe, ɓa sikɗukeeɗa ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Ya ɓa nak Yeesu ini a na haɓɗe ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Wa raakka mbeh nga, Yeesu jangɗeeɗa ɓooɓa ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>, a woyeeɗa <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. Kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, na jangɗohoh caŋ wa, na yakak ca hayya nga ɗe, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « In ci fu na haɓɗe, fu gaƴuk nde po fu kaannja ca haɓiɗ ? Ya ɓa tufkiɗ ɗa po fu haɓɗee ca ? » <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ hey ɗu name meekis. <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Ya ɓa tuuƴee <char style="w">Yahya</char> ne a ɓoktoh, a Kooh wala ɓi ɓo' ? » <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Ɓa hotohha ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ɓoo woo ne Kooh a yi woos Yahya ɗah, a na hee woye ne : “ Wa ye tah ɗu kosɗi ɗe ? ” <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Te ɓoo woo ne, e ɓi ɓo' tuuƴ ɗe ɗah, ɓooɓi jen hey ɓoo tapsohe atoh po ɓoo kaan laam ɓa jen, ɓa kosiɗ ne Yahya nikee woosuuɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Ineem tahha po ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo inahɗi ya ɓa tuuƴee ɗe. » <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>A loffa ɓa ne : « Kon ŋ namanɗi ɗu woo ini tufkiɗ to po ŋ haɓɗee in cii. »<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Guuroh ca apee kuɓkaŋ heɗ yohna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Wa ɓa ƴut ŋ woo ceem, Yeesu naandsukka mboolnda andiinii : « A nikee ƴaar, a yippa yohon reseñ. Ƴutta, a hanndaa deg ŋ yaah ɓi guuroh reseñ ne wa ruund ɗah ɓa paysoh ; a ɓaaɓpa in maañiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Wa yohna ruund, a tuuƴca <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ guuroh ca, ne ɓa eɗ ɗe ɓakiŋ ɗe ŋ reseñi, waaye guuroh ca laɓpa ɗe, ɓa aannja ɗe yaah ɓarang. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>A tuuƴissa ñaam wiiriis, guuroh ca nammba ɗe laɓ, ɓa ɓassa ɗe, ɓa aannja ɗe yaah ɓarang. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>A woosissa ñaam wiiriis ya kaahayɗoh, guuroh ca laɓpa ɗe po a gaañukka, ɓa puliɗta ɗe yohna. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Heɗ yohni woosa ŋ haf ce ne : “ Ŋ joy ye haɓiɗ kotii ? Ŋ woosan kuɓkiŋ ngo yi ŋ keeñkoh, ŋ liiɓiɗ ne ɓa hey ɗe supke. ” <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Waaye wa ɓa hot kuɓka, ɓa woosa ŋ harmban ɓa ne : “ Lamohiŋ yohni a yi ! Ɓoo apaat ɗe, lamaahi nik wuu ɓoo kotii. ” <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Ɓa puliɗta ɗe yohna, ɓa appa ɗe. »</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Ŋ ineem Yeesu woosa mboolnda ne : « Moo, ɗu liiɓ ne heɗ yohniŋ reseñi tuman guuroh ceem na ? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>A hey haye, a ap ɓa, a deg yohni ŋ yaah ɓi ɓo' wiiriis. » Wa ɓooɓa kerah ina Yeesu woo weem, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ineem kanaat raak muk ! » <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yeesu markeeɗa ɓa, a loffa ɓa ne : « Kon woo kii tokis ye ? Woo ki Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo wii :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">“ Atoh fi taɓahoh ci mbetee</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">mirndohiɗ nik atoh fi amb taɓahi. ” »<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>A degga nga ne : « Ɓo' nu keen ŋ atoh feem ɗah, a hey weersukohe, te ɓo' nu wa keen ŋ ɗafuk ce ɗah, wa hey ɗe ruñuɓsohe. » <verse eid="LUK 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasi na jangɗohoh caŋ wa inheen ne Yeesu woyee na ɓa ŋ andiina, tahha po, ŋ ɗiska ɗiska, ɓa waakeeɗa findi ɓaa hee ɗe ambohe, waaye ɓa neƴƴoheen mboolnda.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lempooni Sesaar na eɗse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa oɓɗeeɗa Yeesu, ɓa woossa ɓi espiyoŋ. Ɓeem mannda na ɓooɓi yurah, raak ɓa waakee ŋ woo ciŋ ɗe findi ɓa hee ɗe ambohe ne ɓa deg ɗe ŋ yaah ciŋ ɓoya nikiɗ buura yakkaŋ Rom ndaam. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Ŋ ineem ɓa meekissa Yeesu ne : « Jangɗohohi, ɓoo inhiɗ ne jangɗohiŋ ɗa wa yurhiɗ te fu neƴƴohɗi ini ɓooɓi na liiɓe, waaye fu na jangɗohe waasiŋ Kooh ŋ keeh. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Kon, woya ɓoo andi waasiŋ ɓoo teyɗohiɗ ne ɓoo wirind Sesaar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sesaar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: buur nu tufkiɗasseen Rom ɗah, a meeɗ ɓay tiiki Sesaar, waaye yaa nu nga ɓa raakeen tiikiŋ ɗe haf ce.</char></note>, buuri yakki lempo, wala ? » <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Yeesu inahha ne ɓa na waake ambohaa ɗe, a woosa ɓa ne : <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>« Teeɓaat to hanjar <char style="w"><char style="tl">dinaar</char></char> ndii. » A woosa ɓa ne : « A nataaliŋ ya ɓa na tiikiŋ ya ɓa nik nga ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne : « A wiŋ Sesaar. » <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Kon, eɗaat Sesaar ini Sesaar raak, te ɗu eɗ Kooh ini Kooh raak. » <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Ŋ ineem, ɓa minɗi ɗe amb ŋ woo ciŋ ɗe ŋ fiki mboolnda. Ɓa feyuusa ŋ findi a lofoh, ɓa ɗekka teɗ.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ca na hulti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Ɓi ɓo' ɓaah ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Sadusen</char></char> ca hayya ŋ Yeesu. <char style="tl">Sadusen</char> ca ɓeɗ na woye ne ɓooɓi heyɗi hulte. Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>« Jangɗohohi, Musaa fiisɗiɗ ɓoo ne ɓo' nu yakak ce kaan raakaaɗi kuɓu ɗah, a joyiɗ lam ɓitiice, a raakiɗ ƴaari kaaniɗi kuɓu. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Te wa raakeen taambɗoh yasna-kanak ; saawi tokka ɓitiɓ, a kaannda raak ɗe raawɗi raak na ɗe kuɓu. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Yi taamb nga ɗe lammba ɗe, a nammba kaan te a raakɗi na ɗe kuɓu, <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>yi kaahayɗoh ɗaa, po yasna-kanak ci jen reehha, ali yino raakɗi na ɗe kuɓu. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Ŋ mirndaani ɓitɓi kaannda. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Ɓitɓeem, ɓooɓi hulit ɗah, a na hee nike ɓiti ya ɓa nga ɓa ? Laam, ɓeɗ ɓi yasna-kanak ci jen ɓa tokiɗ ɗe findi ɓitiɓ ! »<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ adinaanii, ɓooɓi na kilooke kilook ɓum kilookse. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Ɓooɓi Kooh amb ne ɓa yeyyoo'iɗ hultiɗu ne ɓa ɓaah ŋ kipes ki na haye, ƴaar ci heyɗi toke ɓitiɓ, ɓitiɓ ci heyɗi tokse. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Laam ɓa kaanissanɗi, ɓa mandan na malaakaaci ; ɓa hultiɗ, kon ɓa kuɓu Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Te Fiis ciŋ Musaa sah teeɓohiɗ ŋ ɗiski ca woyoh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kidga ƴina gile<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Pula 3:6</ref></char></note> ne kaaniɗ ci hey hulte. Fiis ceem teek Heɗ ɓoo nga "Koohiŋ Ibrahiima, Isaahha na Yaŋhooɓa" » <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Kooh Koohiŋ kaaniɗ ci haa, a Koohiŋ pesiɗ ci, laam nga ɗe, ɓa jen ɓii pes. »<verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Ɓi jangɗohoh ŋ waasiŋ Musaa woosa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, woo kiŋ ɗa moɗiɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Ŋ ineem ali ɓo' kaañisɗi ɗe meekis ne a markisuk ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mucɗohi Gapohse na Dawuuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓa min na woyoh ne <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> setiŋ Dawuuda ? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Dawuuda ŋ haf ce, a yi woo ŋ Sabuur ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">“ Heɗ ɓoo woyiɗ Heɗ to ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Ɓoofa ŋ ñaahmiŋ ngo<verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>po mbaɗna ŋ folan ɓi sang ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:43">fu tum ɓa degoha kot.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sabuur 110:1</ref></char></note>’ ”<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Ndii, Dawuuda ɓeeɗkohiɗ ɗe Heɗ ce, mbaa Mucɗohi min na nikoh setiŋ ɗe ? »<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naafeehaaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Raak ɓooɓa jen sikɗukeeɗa Yeesu, a woosa taalubeeciŋ ɗe ne : <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>« Wortukaat mand na jangɗohoh ciŋ waasiŋ Musaa, ini neɓ ɓa weɗ ne, ɓa ɓekuk kulɓa yakiɗ ɓa tiindsuke. Te ɓa waaɗ ne, ɓooɓi kañɗan ɓa yaah kanak ŋ ɗisik ci na toonohse ŋ kur. Ɓa nam waaɗ ne, ɓa nikan ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ngaŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci, te ɓa ɓeeɗku kañam yakak ɗah, ɓa na waaɗe ɓoof ŋ ɗisik ci uup eɗu cir. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Ɓeɗ na ñame raakuuɗiŋ ɓitiɓ ci ƴaar ciŋ ɓa kaan po kahan ciŋ ɓa sah ; te ɓa kiimee Kooh ɗah, wa minuu reeh, ɓa waakee hotaat to. Ambaat ne a mbugaliŋ ɓa uupan misik. »<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓitɓa ñakɗa na ina a eɗoh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>A Yeesu woo po a jaɗtukka kotii, a hotta ɓi heɗ alal ɓekeeɗa kopor ca ɓa eɗoh wuu Kooh ŋ ɗiska na ɓekohse kopora ŋ <char style="w">Kahan Kooh</char>. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>A nammba hot ɓitiɓ ñakiɗ yi ƴaar ce kaan ; yeem ɓekeeɗa nga hanjar kanak ƴin findi pistiriñ. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ini ɓitɓi ñakɗii eɗoh weɗ uup ciŋ ɓinooɓi jen. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Laam findi ɓa hend jen, ɓa eɗoh ini ɓa etohɗi ŋ raak-raakiŋ ɓa, waaye a yi, ŋ ñaki a ñak a eɗoh ini a raakee pesoha jen. »<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">In ci raakan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Ƴutta, ɓi ɓo' laaseeɗa Kahan Kooh moɗ sagu atoh ca moɗohngaan ca wa haɓɗohu na in ca na eɗohse wuu Kooh nga. Yeesu loffa ɓa ne : <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>« Ɗu hotiɗ in cii jen e ? Jamano hey haye ali atoh tasanɗi ŋ ɗafuk atoh ŋ ndii, ca jen ca hey yahrohse. »<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Jangɗohohi, in ceem na hee raake kiɗa ? Te wa ye na hee teeɓohe ne in ceem ca ɗi heeɗa raake ? » <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yeesu loffa ne : « Wortukaat muuƴɗu laam ɓo' laayiɗ hey haye, ɓa kooɗ tiikiŋ ngo ɓa woyee ne ɓeɗ <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char>, ɓa namee woo ne jamanooni reyiɗ ; kinaat ɓa taambiɗ ŋ ineem. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Kaɗ po ɗu kerah ɓi hiñoh yakak, wala ɗu kerah ɓi yoond ɗah, kinaat jaahiɗ ; in ceem joy joy raak paaɗ, waaye nikanɗi ne a Adina na reehe. »<verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Kur hey hiñohe na kur morom wa, buur hey hiñohe na buur morom ce. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kehƴi hey yoondɗuke keeh-keeh ŋ ɓi ɗisik laayiɗ te ŋ kur laayiɗ aɗ na kosaay ci kaɓkohan hey raake nga. Ɓi in tiitɗohiɗ hey raake ; te ŋ eel ci ɓi in feyohiɗ hey hotke nga.<verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Waaye bala in ceem raakan, ɗu hey ambse, ɗu torhiɗu, ɗu ɓayu ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">sinaagog</char></char> ci ne ɗu atte'u, ɗu rangu ŋ kaso ; ɗu ɓayu ŋ fiki ɓi buur na ɓi goornoor saguuso. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Ineem hey tahe po ɗu min ndo seede ŋ fikiiɓa. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Waaye ambaat inii ŋ haf ciŋ ɗu : Ɗu joyɗi feyu ŋ findi ɗu joy ngeloh. <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>Laam e mi onan ɗu liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ po ali ɓo' ŋ ɓi sang ɗu minanɗi ngel na ɗu.<verse eid="LUK 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Baab ciŋ ɗu, na yaay ciŋ ɗu, na taambɗoh ciŋ ɗu, na ɓaah ciŋ ɗu na nawleeciŋ ɗu ɓeɗ ambɗukan ɗu, raakiɗ sah ɓi na hee apse nga ɗu. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Ɓooɓi jen hey ɗu sange saguuso. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Waaye ɗu ñakanɗi sah findi uup ƴissuut ŋ haf ciŋ ɗu. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Ɗu amb ndengiɗ ɗah, ɗu hey rahse kipes kiŋ ɗu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>Ɗu hot ɓi hiñohoh laayiɗ ndeeriɗ Yerusalem ɗah, teemb ndeem inhaat ne ɗumbuukiŋ wa usisɗi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Wa ree ɗah, ɓooɓi wa raakan ŋ Yudee, ɓa saandohaat ŋ tangooca, wa raak ɓa ŋ ɗooƴ Yerusalem ɗah, ɓa pulaat nga, ɓi waa hee raake ŋ bilaf fa, ɓa kanaat dokuk ŋ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Ŋ mbeh ceem, Kooh hey wirnde ɓo' nu nga tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe laam in ci woyu ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci jen joy joy raak. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Mas ɓitiɓ ci na hee nike rook ŋ jamanooneem na ɓapɗoh ci ! Tiis miskiɗ hey raake ŋ kur ki, Kooh hey teeɓe ɓooɓi ayrukiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Ɓo' laayiɗ hey apse na ndang, ɓum tumu <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ kur ci cinooci jen. Ɓooɓi nikɗi Yawuut hey daksohe Yerusalem po mbaɗna jamanooniŋ ɓa mitan.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>Ɓi in hey hotke ŋ nohi, na caɓni na hor ci, te ŋ kehƴi, ɗuuɗiŋ cookmi na ginaah ciŋ wa hey feye ɓooɓi po ɓa inhissuu in ci ɓa haɓɗan. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Hatil ci nik ŋ eel ci hey yoondɗasse, ŋ ineem ɓooɓi hey liiɓe ŋ in ci raakan ŋ kehƴi, wa hey ɓa tahe reɓ kaan sagu tiit. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Teemb ndeem ɓa hey hote <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hayee ŋ eel, a hun na hatil, na yaki keeh-keehi a yak. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>In ceem jen camb ɗah, jaɗtukaat, ɗu tufuk ; raakan faɗsuukiŋ ɗu reɓiɗ. »<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Yeesu degga nga ne : « Markaat ndun mbaa kidig ci cinooci, <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>ca kifsee ɗah, ɗu na jaare inah ne rehi usisɗi ɗiski wa nik. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Wa mand ɗaa, ɗu nam hot in ceem ɗah, inhaat ne Nguuriŋ-Kooh usisɗi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa te wa keeh, ɓooɓiŋ adinaani woti kurkohanɗi nga jen te in ceem jen raakɗi. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Eel ci na kehƴi hey coote waaye woo ciŋ ngo moosanɗi cootoh.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>Tumaat ndaangka, kinaat tum kipes kiŋ ɗu an na laar te kinaat apuk ŋ in ciŋ Adina mbaa mbeheem hey ɗu mbipe ; <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>wa hey mbipe ɓooɓiŋ kehƴi jen. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Kinaat neeh, genaat kiim Kooh, ɗu min raak hatil mucoha ŋ in ceem po Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hay ɗah, ɗu min tufuk ŋ fikiice. »<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Ŋ mbeh ceem, noh reesa ɗah, Yeesu jangɗohee ŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh, waaye wek ree ɗah, a kaɗ nika ŋ tangoora na woyse Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Ɓooɓa jen meeɗta kaɗ nga ɗe ŋ Kahnaŋ Kooh na ɓaaɓ-teel ne ɓa sikɗuk ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Yudaa na kilifaaca ŋ ambuukiŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Feeti na woyse <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char>, wiŋ mbuuruuci raakaaɗi lawiir ci, nikee reɓeeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh caŋ wa waakeeɗa findi ɓa hee apɗukohe Yeesu waaye ɓa neƴƴoheen ɓooɓa. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Seytaani aassa Yudaa yi na woyse Iskaryot ; Yudaa yeem, a ɓaahee ŋ <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12). <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>A kaɗta kerhiɗoha na kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na ɓaŋ ɓooɓa niiɗe <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahnaŋ Kooh</char> ŋ findi a joy ɓa eɗndoh Yeesu ; <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>ɓa summba nga lool, ɓa gappa ɗe eɗ kopor. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yudaa teyɗukka, a sekɗoheeɗa findi a eɗndohan ɓa ɗe te mboolnda maasuu.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="tl">Paakiŋ</char> Yeesu mirndoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Wa feetaŋ Mbuuruuci raakaaɗi lawiir ci ree, ŋ mbehi mbaaliŋ <char style="tl">Paaki</char> joy hoosohu, <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yeesu woossa Piyeer na Saaŋ, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kaɗaat ɗu haɓɗiɗa ɓoo kañam kiŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char> ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:3">Pula 12:3</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 12:9">9</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, fu waaɗ ne ɓoo haɓɗohana ŋ nde ? » <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Sikɗukaat to : Ɗu kaɗ po ɗu aasee kur ka ɗah, ɗu hey cohe na ƴaar ɓayiɗ meeme masuɓ. Ñaakɗaat ɗe po kahna aa hee aasohe, ɗu nam aas nga. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Ɗu woo heɗ kahnaam ne : “ Jangɗohohi woo ne wa nde ɗiski a joy ñamoh mbaaliŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char>, a yi na taalubeeciŋ ɗe ? ” <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>A hey ɗu teeɓe tuuƴ angiɗ ŋ ɗafuk kahna na in ci joy nik nga, ɗu kooɗkiɗohan kañam ki ndaam. » <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Taalubeeca kaɗta, ɓa raakohha in ceem ɗaa findi Yeesu woyohee ɓa, ɓa kooɗkiɗta kañam kaŋ <char style="tl">Paak</char>.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Wa wahtuuni kañam ki joy ñamohu ree, Yeesu na <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci jen ɓooffa ne ɓa ñam, <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>a woosa ɓa ne : « Ŋ waaɗeen ɓaah na ɗu kañam kii lool, bala miskiɗiŋ ngo. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Laam ŋ woo ne, ŋ heyɗaa ñamisse po mbaɗna ini <char style="tl">Paak</char> tokis keeh-keeh raakan ŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. »<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>A ɓayya kaas, a corkiɗta Kooh, a woosa ɓa ne : « Ɓayaat kaasii, yaa nu nga ɗah an nga. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ŋ heyɗi anisse masuɓ reseñ po mbaɗna Nguuriŋ-Kooh hayan. » <verse eid="LUK 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Ƴutta, a ɓayya mbuuru, a corkiɗta Kooh, a poɓtohhaa, a eɗta ɓa wa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Wii wa faaniŋ ngo, wi eɗohu wuu ɗu, hey ɗah tumaat inii, ɗu naandsukohee so wa. »<verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Wa ɓa ñam po ƴutta, a nammba ɓay kaas, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kaasii, weɗ ñif miŋ ngo. Ñif miŋ ngo hey aamse wuu ɗu, te weɗ Kooh na hee tufkiɗohe <char style="w" lemma="Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi">Ambtiɗohiŋ ɗe Asi</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ambtiɗohi Koc na wi Asi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: teerndiŋ Kooh, wa ɓak kanak. Ɓaki koc, ini amboh ŋ <char style="tl">Tawreetiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, na woo ciŋ woosuuɗ ci na Sabuur, weɗ na woyse Fiis ciŋ Ambtiɗohi Koc. Cum ɗah, wa teeku Ambtiɗohi Maañiɗi. Ŋ jamanoocaam, Nikiɗi Kooh ambtiɗohee na cuuɓiŋ Israayel, taamboh ŋ woosuuɗi <char style="w">Musaa</char>. Ɓaki kanakɗoh, weɗ na woyse <char style="tl">Injil</char>. Wa na woye ŋ Ambtiɗohi Asi Kooh tufkiɗ ŋ harmban ce na ɓooɓi jen taamboh ŋ Mucɗohi a Gapohee, Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 11:27">Ɓi Rom 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:25">1 Korenta 11:25</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 8">Heber ci 8</ref></char>).</char></note> na ɗu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>Te kat, ɓoyi na hee so wore yii na so ndii ne ɓoo ñam. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Wa keeh ne <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> hey kurke nga findi Kooh woyoha, waaye mas ɓoyi na hee ɗe eɗndohe ŋ ɓi sang ɗe ! » <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Taalubeeciŋ ɗe meeksoheeɗa ŋ harmban ɓa ɓoyi na hee tume ineem nga ɓa.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ya ɓa uup nik kilifa ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Woo nammba kuruk ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓa taastiɗohee ne yinde uup nik kilifa nga ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Buur ciŋ kur ci na uupee ɓooɓiŋ ɓa doole te kilifaaci teek haf ɓa tumoh baahiɗ ci. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Waaye wa joyɗi nikoh ɗaa nga ɗu. Ɓoyi uup nik kilifa nga ɗu, a mandaat na ɓoyi uup ƴissuut ; te ɓoyi adug nga ɗu, mandaat na ɓoyi na taambkohe. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Ɓoyi ɓoof ñame na ɓoyi na taambkohee ɗe, ya ɓa uup nik kilifa nga ɓa ? A ɓoyi na ñame haa e ? Moona mi yii ŋ harmban ɗu findi ɓoyi na taambkohe. <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Po wi ɗu risiɗ na so ŋ miskiɗiŋ ngo, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>weɗ tah ŋ oniɗ ɗu Nguuri findi Baabiŋ ngo onoh ho wa. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Tahha po ɗu hey ɓaahe na so ɓoo ñamee, ɓoo anee ŋ Nguuriŋ ngo. Ɗu hey ɓoofe ŋ ɓoofoha-buur ne ɗu adgoh cuuɓ ciŋ Israayel ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12). »<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu dengiɗ Simong Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Yeesu woosa Simong Piyeer ne : « Simong ! Simong ! Sikɗuka ! Seytaani woyiɗ po a onuuɗ ne a min ɗu bisir findi pees. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Waaye ŋ kiimɗiɗ ɗa ne fu faɗuu kosi fu kos, te fu hayis nga so ɗah, ndengɗa kosiŋ ƴaaɓi tas. » <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ŋ teyɗukiɗ hun na ɗa ŋ kaso po ŋ apu na ɗa sah. » <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>A loffa ɗe ne : « Piyeer, ñam na woyee ɗa wa, weki woti bala siiki leehkan ɗah, fu hey woye waas kaahay ne fu inahɗi so. »<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Ƴutta a woyissa ɓa ne : « Wa ŋ tuuƴ ɗu, raakaaɗi kopor, na saak, na ñafaɗ, ɗu ñakeen in e ? » Ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Ɓoo ñakeeɗi in. » <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Waaye ɗiski wa nik, ɓo' nu raak kopor, mbaa saak ɗah, a ɓayaata. Te ɓo' nu raakɗi ndang ɗah, a toonaat paltooniŋ ɗe a rom ; <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Laam ñam na woyee ɗu wa, ini Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woo, an : “ Ɓa ambiɗ ɗe findi ɓo' yurhaaɗi. ” Ineem raakan nga so. In ci fiisu ŋ ini kaɗ nga so jen ca ɗii raak. » <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Weɗi taalubeeciŋ ɗe woyoh ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ndang kanak ceɗɗi. » A woosa ɓa ne : « Wa doyiɗ. »<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiimaŋ Yeesu ŋ Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Wa Yeesu puloh ŋ ndaam, a kaɗ Tangooraŋ-Oliiw-ca findi a meeɗa tumoh, taalubeeciŋ ɗe ñaakiɗta ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Wa a ree ɗiska, a woosa ɓa ne : « Kiimaat Kooh a ndengiɗ ɗu, po ɗu keenuu ŋ fiir. » <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>A ussa ɓa ini ree njaf atoh, a ƴekka, a kiimeeɗa, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>an : « Baab, fu waaɗa ɗah, usɗiɗ to kaasiŋ miskiɗii ; waaye wa kanaat nik waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ngo, wa nikaat findi fu waaɗoha. » [<verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Malaaka pulohha Eel ci, teeɓukka ɗe, ɓaatta ɗe hatil. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Ŋ tiisi a nikohee weem, Yeesu uupeeɗa kiim Kooh, opiŋ ɗe siiteeɗa ŋ kehƴi haa ñif.] <verse eid="LUK 22:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Wa a ƴut kiim, a kurukka, a kaɗta ŋ taalubeeciŋ ɗe, a raakka ɓa neeheeɗa sagu tiisi ɓa nikohe. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu neehe ? Kurkaat ɗu kiim Kooh a ndengiɗ ɗu po ɗu keenuu ŋ fiir. »<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ambuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Wa Yeesu woyee na taalubeeciŋ ɗe, mboolo reyeeɗa. Yudaa yi adgohee wa, a ɓaahee ŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na kanak ci (12) ; a reɓpa ŋ Yeesu ne a kañiɗ ɗe, a foon ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Waaye Yeesu woosa ɗe ne : « Yudaa, fu na eɗohe Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi sangiɗ ciŋ ɗe na foon e ? » <verse eid="LUK 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Wa taalubeeci hunee na Yeesu hot ŋ ini na hee raake, ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kilifaani, ɓoo puliɗ ndang ciŋ ɓoo e ? » <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Rek, yino nga ɓa ƴoɓpa <char style="w">ñaam</char> ŋ ñaam caŋ seeƴkiɗoha yakka po nofiŋ ɗe ñaahmi nguɗta. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Waaye Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « Faɗaat, wa doyiɗ. » A ammba nofiŋ ƴaari, a wiriɗta ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Ƴutta, a woosa kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca na ɓaŋ ɓooɓa niiɗee Kahan Kooh na yakak ca, ɓooɓa hee ɗe ambe jen ne : « Ɗu joyiɗ hay ndii na ndooɗ na ndang po maa ŋ rokoh e ? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Moona neeh cii jen ŋ nikee na ɗu ŋ Kahan Kooh te ɗu ambɗi so. Waaye a wahtuuniŋ hatiliŋ ñuusi ree, wiŋ ɗu. »<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyeer taaskiɗ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Wa ɓa amb Yeesu, ɓa ɓayeeɗa ɗe kahan seeƴkiɗoha yakka, Piyeer nikee ñaakɗeeɗa ɗe usiɗ ŋ finhoora. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Wa ɓa ree, ɓa fuuɗta yongkaah ŋ ɗooƴ kahna, ɓa willaa. Piyeer ɓooffa ŋ harmban ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Komaaki cafaƴ nikeen nga, a ɓaahee ŋ ñaam ca, a hotta Piyeer ŋ jaalɗaŋ yongkaaha, a marakka ɗe baahiɗ, a woosa ne : « Na ƴaarii, a hunee na ɗe. » <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Waaye Piyeer taasukka an : « A'aa ɓoyi ! Ŋ inahɗi ɗe de' ! » <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Wa degga ƴissuut ɓo' wiiriis hotta ɗe, woosa ɗe ne : « Fu nam ɓaah ŋ ƴaaɓeem. » Piyeer loffa ne : « Muk ƴaari ! Ŋ ɓaahɗi nga ɓa ! » <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Wa degga ini ree wahtu, ƴaar wiiriis ndengiɗtaa ne : « Wa hooliɗ to ne ƴaarii nikee na ɗe, a nam gen Galile. » <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Waaye Piyeer woosa ɗe ne : « Ca' ƴaari ! Ŋ inahɗi sah ini fu waaɗ woo. » A woyee woo rek, siika leehukka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Yeesu Heɗi heelukka, marakka ɗe ; Piyeer jaarra naandsuk ina a woyee ɗe ne : « Ŋ weki woti, bala siiki leehkan ɗah, fu hey yo taaske waas kaahay. » <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Piyeer pulla, fuɗeeɗa fuɗ miskiɗ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ŋ yaah ɓooɓa sang ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, ɓooɓa niiɗee ɗe nikee njembteeɗa ɗe, ɓa laɓeeɗa ɗe ; <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>ɓa ɗippa has ciŋ ɗe, ɓa meekseeɗa ɗe ne : « Nik ne fu woosuuɗ ɗah, woya ɓoyi laɓ ɗa ! » <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Te ɓa degɗeeɗa ɗe ɓi ɓaseeh laayiɗ nga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Wa Kooh wiis, yakak caŋ cuuɓi cohha na kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ waasiŋ Musaa na jangɗohoh caŋ wa. Ɓa nakohha komu Yeesu ŋ fiki <char style="w" lemma="saangniŋ yakak ciŋ Israayel">saangnaŋ</char> ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>ɓa meekissa ɗe ne : « Woya ɓoo, a fu <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> e ? » A loffa ɓa ne : « Ŋ woo ɗu wa ɗah, ɗu heyɗi wa kose muk ; <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>te ŋ meekis ɗu ɗah, ɗu heyɗi lofe. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Waaye inhaat ne ini amboh woti Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi hey nike ŋ yaah-ñaahmiŋ Koohi Min. » <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ɓa jen ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Kon fu <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> e ? » A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu woyiɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Ɓa woosa ne : « Ɓoo etohis seede ye ? Ɓoo kerhootiɗa ŋ nguɓiŋ ɗe. »<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓayuuɗ ɗiskaŋ Pilaat na ɗiskaŋ Herod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Ŋ finho woo keem, ɓooɓa nikee ŋ coha jen kurukka, ɓa ɓayya Yeesu ŋ Pilaat. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Wa ɓa ree ɓa yambeeɗa ɗe in ci an : « Ƴaarii ɓoo raak ɗe ɓekeeɗa ɓi kur ki ŋ yoond, a sangoheeɗa ɓa wirind buura yakkaŋ <char style="w">Rom</char> lempo ; te a nam tum haf ce <char style="w" lemma="Mucɗohi Gapohse">Mucɗohi Kooh gapohe</char>, weɗ buur. » <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Pilaat meekissa ɗe ne : « A fu buuriŋ Yawuut ci e ? » Yeesu loffa ɗe ne « Fu woyiɗa. » <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilaat woosa kilifaacaŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ca na mboolnda ne : « Ŋ hotɗi ne ƴaari ɗaliɗ waas. » <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Waaye ɓa ñaakka nga, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Ŋ jangɗohiŋ ɗe, ƴaarii na ɓeke ɓooɓi ŋ yoond, a camboh Galile po ndii, a wiliɗ Yudee jen naa. »<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Wa Pilaat kerah woo ceem a meeksohha andi Yeesu gen Galile. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Wa a inah ne Yeesu puloh Galile, wa Herod adgohee, a tuuƴca ɗe nga ɗe. Raak Herod nam nik ŋ Yerusalem ŋ neeh caam.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herod maañeen waaɗ hot Yeesu sagu in ca a kerhee nga ɗe, tahha po, wa a hot ɗe, a summba nga lool ; a liiɓee ne a hey tume keemaan ŋ fikiice. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>A meekissa ɗe meeksoh laayiɗ waaye Yeesu lofɗi ɗe ali in. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh caŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> na jangɗohoh caŋ wa nikee nga, ɓa yambeeɗa ɗe yamb na hatil. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herod na soldaar caŋ ɗe ƴissuutɗeeɗa ɗe, ɓa ɓekiɗta ɗe kulɓa moɗoh na moɗoh, ɓa njembteeɗa ɗe, Herod tuuƴca ɗe ŋ Pilaat.<verse eid="LUK 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Pilaat na Herod kerhiɗoheeɗi waaye ina kooɗoh mbaɗi, ɓa nikka nawle.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilaat eɗohiɗ Yeesu ne a apu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Wa ɓa ree ŋ Pilaat, a cohɗohha kilifaacaŋ seeƴkiɗoh ca, na yakak ca, na mboolnda jen. <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Ɗu komiɗ to ƴaarii, ɗu woo ne a na ɓeke ɓi kur ki ŋ yoond. Ŋ meeksiɗ ɗe ŋ fikiiɗu te ŋ hotɗi ali in ŋ in ci ɗu na yambee ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Te Herod namɗi hot in, weɗ tah a tuuƴissa ɗe ndii ; mbaa a haɓiɗɗi ini a joy apohu. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Kon ŋ hey ɗe laɓɗuke, ƴut ɗah, ŋ faɗis ɗe. » [<verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Raak, <char style="tl"><char style="w">Paak</char></char> nu ree ɗah, Pilaat joyeen ɓa faɗsiɗ ambuuɗ yino." Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Ɓa hunnda ɓa woyeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « Apɗuka ƴaarii te fu faɗsiɗ ɓoo Barabaas. » <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Raak, a yi Barabaas a ɓaahohiɗ ŋ yoond ŋ kur ka te a apeen ɓo', weɗ tahee po a ɗaakuusa ŋ kasoona.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Waaɗa Pilaat waaɗee faɗis Yeesu, tahha po a woyisseeɗa na mboolnda ; <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>waaye ɓa leehkeeɗa ne : « Daaƴaa ɗe ŋ kurwaa ! Daaƴaa ɗe ! » <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Pilaat woyissa ɓa, wa nikka waasi kaahayɗoh, ne : « Moo, ƴaari tum ye in moɗaaɗi ? Ŋ hotɗi ali ini joy ɗe tah apu, weɗ tah, ŋ hey ɗe laɓɗuke, ƴut ɗah, ŋ faɗis ɗe. » <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Waaye ɓa taalndiɗta ɓa leehkeeɗa ŋ ɗafka ne : « A daaƴsaat ŋ kurwaa ! » Leehuk caŋ ɓa ɓayndohha Pilaat, <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>a tufukka ɓa tumiɗ ini ɓa meeksohe. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>A faɗsiɗta ɓa ƴaara ɓa meeksohe, ya ɗaaksee ŋ kasoona sagu ɗuuɗa a ɗuuɗɗee kur ka na apa a apee ɓo'. A eɗta ɓa Yeesu ne ɓa tum ɗe ini ɓa waaɗee nga ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu daaƴuuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Wa ɓa ɓayee Yeesu, ɓa cohha na ƴaar puloh ɓak caŋ yohon ca, teeku Simong gen Sireen. Ɓa ammba ɗe, ɓa ɓayɗukohha ɗe kurwaana, a ñaakeeɗa ŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Ɓi ɓo' laayiɗ ñaakeeɗa nga ɗe ; ɓi ɓitiɓ nga ɓa fuɗeeɗa, ɓa miskiɗkeeɗa sagu Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>A yurhiɗkohha na ɓa, a woosa ne : « Ɓitiɓ ciŋ Yerusalem, kinaat to fuɗ, fuɗaat kay haf ɗu na kuɓuuciŋ ɗu, <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>laam jamano wii hay ɓa hey woye ne : “ Ɓitiɓ ci jaasiriɗ ci, ɓi moosɗi raakoh kuɓu te ɓa moosɗi ɓapɗoh, ɓa neɓɗiɗ. ” <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Te ɓooɓi hey woye tangooci njooliɗ ci ne : “ Keenaat ŋ ɗafuk ɓoo ! ” ɓa woo tangoocum ne : “ Ulaat ɓoo ! ” <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Moo, kidig iiri tumu an ɗah, kidig suyiɗ tumsan na ? »<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Raak ɓa ɓayndoheen tumoh moɗaaɗi kanak ne ɓa nam ɓa ap na Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Wa ɓa kaɗ po ɓa reesa ɗiska na woyse "Ƴoh-haf", ɓa daaƴca ɗe ŋ kurwaa. Ɓa nammba daaƴ tumoh moɗaaɗiica kanak ca ŋ kurwaa, yii lahha ɗe yaah-ñaahum, yinni lahha ɗe ŋ yaah-sing. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yeesu woosa ne : « Baab ɗaasaa ɓa, ɓa inahɗi ini ɓa na haɓɗe. » Ɓa piilohha kulɓaacaŋ ɗe ne ɓa paysoh ca. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Ɓooɓa nikee markeeɗa ini raak. Kilifaacaŋ Yawuut ca njembteeɗa ɗe, ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « A mucɗiɗ ɓinooɓi, a mucɗaat haf ce ne a yi Mucɗohi Gapohse, ɓoyi Kooh tan ɗah. » <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Soldaar ca reɓpa nga ɗe ne ɓa nam ɗe njembit, ɓa eɗeeɗa ɗe masuɓ raakiɗ <char style="tl">bineegar</char>, <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>ɓa woyeeɗa ne : « Nik ne a fu buuriŋ Yawuut ci ɗah, mucɗa haf fu. »<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Inii fiisseen wa tiimmba hafiŋ ɗe an : « Yii a yi buuriŋ Yawuut ci. »<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Yino ŋ tumoh moɗaaɗiica daaƴsee ŋ serooce ɓaseeɗa ɗe an : « A fu Mucɗohi Gapohse haa e ? Mucɗa haf fu, fu muciɗ ɓoo book. » <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Yinoora ngassa ɗe an : « Fu nupɗi Kooh e ? Te ŋ hot fu na ƴaari a ɗu ɓaah miskiɗi. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Ini mi na ɗa tumu wa waas, sagu in ci ɓoo haɓiɗ, waaye ƴaarii tumɗi ali in. » <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>A woyissa ne « Yeesu, kinaa so alkoh, ne fu aase ŋ Nguuriŋ ɗa ɗah. » <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yeesu loffa ɗe ne « Ñam na woyee ɗa wa te wa keeh, woti fu hey hune na so Aljana. »<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaan kaŋ Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45"/>Wa nikee ŋ njooloor, nohi ɗasɗukka, kehƴi jen nikka ŋ ñuus ini ree wahtu kaahay. Weɗi ridoona ɗasɗee <char style="w" lemma="Ɗiski Hooliɗi na Ɗiski Hoolohngaani">Ɗiska Hoolohngaanaŋ</char> <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahnaŋ Kooh</char> faarkoh tareet ŋ leerni, ini kooɗoh ɗafka po kehƴa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:44-45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Pula 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yeesu leehukka ŋ ɗafka a woosa ne : « Baab, ŋ wikiɗ kiñin kiŋ ngo ŋ yaah ciŋ ɗa. » Wa a woo woo keem, a nguɗta. <verse eid="LUK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Ƴaara adgohee soldaar ca hotta ina raak, a yakiɗta Kooh an : « Wa keeh kat ne ƴaarii nikee ɓo' yurhiɗ. » <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Mboolnda hayee ŋ ɗiska jen ne ɓa marak, hotta ina raak, ɓa haadeeɗa, ɓa laɓɗeeɗa daɗ ciŋ ɓa, ɓa miskiɗkeeɗaa. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Nawleecaŋ Yeesu jen cangtiɗukka ɓa markeeɗa. Ɓitiɓ ca pulohee na ɗe Galile nikee nga.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu ɓekuuɗ ŋ ruy-ruy</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51"/>Wa raakeen ƴaar teeku Suseef, a genee Arimate ŋ Yudee. A ɓaahee ŋ atte'oh ca yakak ca waaye a huneeɗi ŋ ina ɓa kooɗkee po ɓa mirndohhaa tum. A nikee ɓo' baahiɗ, yurhiɗ, a ɓaah ŋ ɓi sekee hayiŋ Nguuriŋ-Kooh. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>A kaɗta ŋ Pilaat ne yeem eɗ ɗe fiɗaafaŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>A yipkiɗtaa ŋ kurwaana, a lemessaa na uuf, a ɓekkaa ŋ ruy-ruy haɓɗuuɗ ŋ atoh yakak, wi ali ɓo' moosɗi ɓekohu.<verse eid="LUK 23:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Wa nikee ŋ mbehi na kooɗkohse, raak <char style="w">mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> aaseeɗa. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Ɓitiɓ ca pulohee na Yeesu Galile taambiɗta Suseef, ɓa hotta ruy-ruya na findi fiɗaafa ɗaakohu nga. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Ɓa haadda ne ɓa haɓɗa cuuraay na laackoloñ eeñɗohaa wa. Waaye mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse cammba, ɓa iɗsiɗukka findi waasiŋ Musaa woyoha.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yeesu hultiɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Ŋ mbehi taamb ŋ <char style="w" lemma="mbehi na iɗsiɗkohse">wi na iɗsiɗkohse</char> na ɓaaɓa teel, ɓitiɓ ca ɓayya cuuraay ca ɓa haɓɗee, ɓa kaɗta ruy-ruyaŋ Yeesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Wa ɓa ree, ɓa raak atoh fa yakka rangee wa pilnginuuɗ. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Ɓa aassa, waaye ɓa hotɗi fiɗaafaŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu nga. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Ɓa inahɗi ini ɓa haɓɗan, weɗi ɓo' kanak teeɓkoh ɓa, ɓekkiɗ kulɓa na melciɗe melciɗ. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Ɓa tiitta, ɓa hiirra kip. Ƴaaɓa woosa ɓa ne : « Wa ye tah ɗu markee ɓoyi na pese ŋ kaaniɗ ci ? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>A nikɗi ndii, a hultiɗuuɗ ! Naandsukaat ina a woyee ɗu, wa a nik na ɗu ŋ Galile. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>A woyee ne : “ <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ ɓoyi</char> joyiɗ eɗu bakaaɗoh ci, ɓa daaƴ ɗe ŋ kurwaa, ŋ neeha kaahayɗoh a hulit. ” » <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Ɓa naandsukka woo caŋ Yeesu.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Wa ɓitiɓ ca puloh ruy-ruya, ɓa kaɗta naandsuka in ceem jen <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na yinooci (11) na ɓa tas jen. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Mari Makdala na Saan na Mari yaay ɓi Saak na ɓi ɓitiɓ wiiriis, ɓeɗ woo <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci wa. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Waaye ɓeem kosɗi ɓa, ɓa liiɓpa haa ne ɓa na woye mbalay. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Waaye Piyeer kurukka, a yurahha ŋ ruy-ruya na mbup. Wi a ree, a huusukka, a hotɗi ali in nga ɗal uufa ; a haadda, a liiɓsiɗoheeɗa ŋ ini raak.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋ waas Emayuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Mbaɗi taalube kanak nga ɓa, kaɗeeɗa kur ka na woyse Emayuus, harmban wa na Yerusalem joyiɗ ree tiindu wahtu kanak. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Ŋ waasa, ɓa ɓeesɗoheeɗa ŋ in ca raakee jen. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Weɗi Yeesu ŋ haf ce reɓoh ɓa, a hunnda na ɓa, <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>waaye in tahha po ɓa minɗi ɗe inhis. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>A meekissa ɓa ne : « Ɗu na ɓeesɗohe ye an ŋ waasi ? » Ɓa tufukka, ɓa soossa. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Ƴaara teeksee Kelewopaas nga ɓa woosa ɗe ne : « Moo, hanaa ya fu dong nik ŋ Yerusalem inhaaɗi ini raak nga neeh cii ? »<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne « Wa ye raak ? » Ɓa loffa ɗe ne « Ini rahas Yeesu yi gen Nasareet. Ŋ fiki Kooh na fiki Israayel ci jen a nikee woosuuɗ yakak ŋ in ci a haɓɗee na woo ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Waaye kilifaaciŋ <char style="w">seeƴkiɗoh</char> ciŋ ɓoo na ɓi adgoh ɓoo ɓi Yawuut ci eɗohha ɗe ne a apu, ɓa daaƴɗukka ɗe ŋ kurwaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Ɓoo ambeen ne a yi na hee mucɗe Israayel, waaye ina wa raakoh poyi wa tumiɗ neeh kaahay. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Ɓi ɓitiɓ nga ɓoo deey, feyiɗ ɓoo woti ; ɓa ɓaaɓ-teelkiɗ ruy-ruyaŋ ɗe, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>waaye ɓa raakɗi fiɗaafiŋ ɗe nga. Wa ɓa hay, ɓa woo ne ɓi malaaka teeɓkiɗ ɓa nga, ɓa woosa ɓa ne a yii pes. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Ɓi ɓo' nga ɓoo namiɗ kaɗ ruy-ruya, ɓa hotta ini ɓitiɓ ceem woo, waaye a yi ŋ haf ce, ɓa hotɗi ɗe. »<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne : « E ɗu ñaañaaɗi, te keeñ ciŋ ɗu gaawɗi kos in ci woosuuɗ ci woo jen. <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Andi <char style="w">Mucɗohi Gapohse</char> joyeeɗi yaaɓoh ɗaa ne a han aas ŋ ndamiŋ ɗe ? » <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>A teeɓpa ɓa in ci Fiis ci woo nga ɗe jen, cambohha ŋ teereeciŋ <char style="w">Musaa</char> po ŋ ciŋ woosuuɗ ci jen.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Wa ɓa hee ree kur ka ɓa kaɗohe, a mannda na ɓoyi na taalndiɗe ; <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>waaye ɓa ammba ɗe, ɓa woosa ɗe ne « Wela fu tas na ɓoo, nohi weɗi muy, Kooh hooɓiɗ. » A aassa, a tassa na ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Wa ɓa hee ñame, a ɓayya mbuurnda, a corkiɗta Kooh, a nguɗsohhaa, a eɗeeɗa ɓa wa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Teemb ndeem ina tahee po ɓa mineeɗi ɗe inhis, nihsukka, ɓa hotta ne a yi, waaye a saayya ŋ fikiiɓa. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Yaa nu nga ɗah, woosa morom ce ne : « Ŋ waasi, wi a teeɓee ɓoo ini Fiis ci woo, fu yegɗi in ŋ keeñiŋ ɗa e ? »<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ɓa jaarra kuruk, ɓa dokukka Yerusalem, ɓa raakka <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci ndaŋkiyaah na yinooci (11) na ɓooɓa nikee na ɓa cohiɗ, <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>woyeeɗa ne : « Wa keeh ne Yeesu kilifaani hultiɗuuɗ ! A teeɓiɗ haf ce Simong ! » <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Ƴaaɓa kanak ca nammba naandsuk ina rahas ɓa ŋ waasa, na findi ɓa inhisoh Yeesu wa a nguɗsohee mbuurnda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu teeɓiɗ taalubeeciŋ ɗe a yi pes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Wa ɓa jombee ŋ ineem, ɗekka po a yi Yeesu, a nikka ŋ leerooɓa, a woosa ɓa ne : « Nikaat ŋ jam. » <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Ɓa feyuusa lool, ɓa liiɓee ne a husiɗ. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Yeesu woosa ɓa ne « Wa ye fey ɗu po ɗu liiɓsiɗohee ŋ ineem ? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Markaat yaah ciŋ ngo na kot ciŋ ngo, a ñam. Laalaat to ɗu marak ! Husiɗ na raake faan na ƴoh findiiso e ? »<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Wa a woo ɓa ineem, a teeɓpa ɓa yaah ciŋ ɗe na kot ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Ɓa sumeen te ɓa feyseen weɗ tah ɓa areeɗi min kos. A meekissa ɓa andi ɓa raakiɗ kañam ndaam. <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Ɓa eɗta ɗe nguɗ cuurund utuuɗ. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>A ɓayyaa, a ñammbaa ŋ fikiiɓa. <verse eid="LUK 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Ƴutta, a woosa ɓa ne : « Naandsukaat ini ŋ woyee ɗu wa ŋ nikoh na ɗu ne : “ In ci woyu nga so ŋ <char style="w">waasiŋ Musaa</char> na teereeciŋ woosuuɗ ci, na Sabuur joyiɗ raak jen. ” » <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>A rangissa liiɓohaaciŋ ɓa ne ɓa min inah ini Fiis ci tokis. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>A woosa ɓa ne : « Inii weɗ Fiis ci woo : “ Mucɗohi Kooh gapoh hey yaaɓɗasse, a hey apse, a hulit ŋ mbeha kaahayɗoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Te ŋ cuuɓ ciŋ adinaani jen, te wa cambohsan Yerusalem, ɓooɓi hey woyse ŋ tiikiŋ ɗe ne, ɓa ɓoƴsohaat pesohaaɗ, ɓa ɗaasu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa. ” <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>E ɗu seedeeciŋ in ceem. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Ŋ hey ɗu woosohe ini Baabiŋ ngo gapoh, kon tasaat ŋ Yerusalem paaɗ po ɗu ɓeku hatili pulohan ŋ ɗafki. »<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu cootiɗ ŋ eel ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Ŋ finho ineem, Yeesu pulla na ɓa, ɓa yurahha kur ka na woyse Betani. Ŋ ndaam a meeɓpa yaah ciŋ ɗe, a barke'iɗta ɓa. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Wi a na barke'ɗee ɓa, a saɓsukoheeɗa na ɓa, a rapɗasseeɗa ŋ Eel ci. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Ɓa ƴekiɗta ɗe, ƴutta, ɓa dokukka Yerusalem sumoh na sumoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Ŋ neeh caam, ɓa gijisɗi <char style="w" lemma="Kahan Kooh">Kahan Kooh</char>, ɓa taalndiɗta, ɓa yakɗeeɗa Kooh.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
